{"parentUuid":"cc5834bf-6ef9-41b5-b999-dde336c4abe2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfujVShKt34wLgn6n8YZM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01B1pKtcBP6wivsRsapALoyj","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration; python3 - <<'EOF'\na=open('/home/agus/workspace/asermax/claude-plugins/mahou/agents/docs-scout.md').read()\nbody=a.split('---',2)[2].strip() if a.startswith('---') else a\ntask=\"\"\"\n\n## Task\n\nProject: /home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara. Docs folder: docs/ (read docs/README.md first).\n\nContext: nagara is moving its API, database and file storage from Railway to Cloudflare. The settled design is in /home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/design.md (read it whole; it is the source of what changes). In short: the Python FastAPI API on Railway becomes a TypeScript API Worker; Postgres/SQLite with SQLAlchemy and Alembic become one D1 database with hand-written SQL migrations in a new common/ package; the two storage backends become one R2 bucket with audio/ and images/ prefixes and presigned URLs signed by each Worker; per-item work moves from the API's BackgroundTasks step machine and the pipeline's per-job extraction Workflow into one flattened item Workflow in pipeline/ (steps fetch, lease, recipe, release, images, describe, start synthesis, poll, store) whose steps run inside a wrapper that writes current_step and the status; the job index Durable Object and the pipeline's public job routes go away, along with the Cloudflare Access application; queued_at, extraction_handle, enriched_at and modal_call_id go; Modal gains two web endpoints with proxy auth and uploads audio to a presigned PUT URL; rasters go through the Images binding and SVGs stay SVG; describe uses AI Gateway's cache and the ledger gains a cached flag; local development runs vite dev plus wrangler dev with a quick tunnel and a Node proxy for Modal's upload; CI order is common/ migrations, pipeline, API; Railway is deleted.\n\nQuestion: which notes under docs/ (and the docs sections of /home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/CLAUDE.md) describe something this design changes or removes? For each note, give its path and the specific sections or statements that no longer hold, one line each, quoting a few words so they can be found. Also list notes you checked that need no change. Do not propose new wording. Under 700 words.\n\"\"\"\nopen('briefs/docs-scout-migration.md','w').write(\"<supervisor-agent>\\n\"+body+task+\"</supervisor-agent>\\n\")\nEOF\nH=/home/agus/.claude/plugins/cache/herdr-subagents/herdr-subagents/0.10.0/bin/herdr-helper; $H spawn --kind claude --label \"docs-scout: migration\" --model sonnet --body-file briefs/docs-scout-migration.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1393,"cache_read_input_tokens":515389,"output_tokens":1341,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":323},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1393,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1341,"cache_read_input_tokens":515389,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1393,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1393},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01B1pKtcBP6wivsRsapALoyj":{"command":"cd /home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration; python3 - <<'EOF'\na=open('/home/agus/workspace/asermax/claude-plugins/mahou/agents/docs-scout.md').read()\nbody=a.split('---',2)[2].strip() if a.startswith('---') else a\ntask=\"\"\"\n\n## Task\n\nProject: /home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara. Docs folder: docs/ (read docs/README.md first).\n\nContext: nagara is moving its API, database and file storage from Railway to Cloudflare. The settled design is in /home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/design.md (read it whole; it is the source of what changes). In short: the Python FastAPI API on Railway becomes a TypeScript API Worker; Postgres/SQLite with SQLAlchemy and Alembic become one D1 database with hand-written SQL migrations in a new common/ package; the two storage backends become one R2 bucket with audio/ and images/ prefixes and presigned URLs signed by each Worker; per-item work moves from the API's BackgroundTasks step machine and the pipeline's per-job extraction Workflow into one flattened item Workflow in pipeline/ (steps fetch, lease, recipe, release, images, describe, start synthesis, poll, store) whose steps run inside a wrapper that writes current_step and the status; the job index Durable Object and the pipeline's public job routes go away, along with the Cloudflare Access application; queued_at, extraction_handle, enriched_at and modal_call_id go; Modal gains two web endpoints with proxy auth and uploads audio to a presigned PUT URL; rasters go through the Images binding and SVGs stay SVG; describe uses AI Gateway's cache and the ledger gains a cached flag; local development runs vite dev plus wrangler dev with a quick tunnel and a Node proxy for Modal's upload; CI order is common/ migrations, pipeline, API; Railway is deleted.\n\nQuestion: which notes under docs/ (and the docs sections of /home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/CLAUDE.md) describe something this design changes or removes? For each note, give its path and the specific sections or statements that no longer hold, one line each, quoting a few words so they can be found. Also list notes you checked that need no change. Do not propose new wording. Under 700 words.\n\"\"\"\nopen('briefs/docs-scout-migration.md','w').write(\"<supervisor-agent>\\n\"+body+task+\"</supervisor-agent>\\n\")\nEOF\nH=/home/agus/.claude/plugins/cache/herdr-subagents/herdr-subagents/0.10.0/bin/herdr-helper; $H spawn --kind claude --label \"docs-scout: migration\" --model sonnet --body-file briefs/docs-scout-migration.md"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"3c508ab5-7e3a-4376-adf0-13b224663e8b","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfujVRaMAM3YNo2oL6fu2","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7b520f46-e5e3-4e7b-8e56-915f6ee5f1df","timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:23:46.545Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
