{"parentUuid":"772f717b-cdb7-4378-a33a-8cf1ab750bbf","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b3ec86c9-9a77-4ff5-a417-88782d9dd0db","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0119toCo1daq5BxFR4JhdaGe","type":"tool_result","content":"Command running in background with ID: bzrslt0qg. Output is being written to: /tmp/claude-1000/-home-agus-workspace-asermax-nagara/f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e/tasks/bzrslt0qg.output. You will be notified when it completes. To check interim output, use Read on that file path.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"bee39ab3-3400-4414-b10d-d04d19fe0789","timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:23:56.761Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"backgroundTaskId":"bzrslt0qg"},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"812a8fc8-b317-4457-a26c-0d16ac314dc6","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","root":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","platform":"linux"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"772f717b-cdb7-4378-a33a-8cf1ab750bbf","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"f52a3d24-4b17-4550-8505-0330ac2adcb7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b3ec86c9-9a77-4ff5-a417-88782d9dd0db","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012DmccEuCWoQ5ZXVSG2g9su","type":"tool_result","content":"---\ntitle: \"Extraction service\"\nsummary: \"The extraction pipeline as a service on Cloudflare: a Worker entrypoint, a per-domain queue Durable Object, one Workflow per job, Flue agents for authoring and revision, called by the API with spawn-and-resolve, like the TTS service.\"\ncreated: \"2026-09-13\"\n---\n\n# Extraction service\n\n## 🔭 Overview\n\nExtraction runs as a service on Cloudflare, separate from the item pipeline. The Python API sends an article and a recipe, and receives the extraction result and, when an agent authored or revised the recipe, the final recipe. The service is stateless over recipes and items; every call carries everything, and the item database stays the record. The TTS service stays on Modal, a separate deployable\n\n## 🏗️ Architecture\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  subgraph inputs [API side]\n    api[Python item pipeline]\n  end\n  subgraph service [Extraction service on Cloudflare]\n    direction LR\n    entry[\"Worker entrypoint:<br/>POST /jobs, GET /jobs\"] --> queue[\"Domain-queue Durable Object,<br/>one per domain:<br/>lease + FIFO queue\"]\n    queue -->|\"creates when free\"| wf[\"Extraction Workflow,<br/>one instance per job\"]\n    index[\"Index Durable Object:<br/>job id to domain\"]\n    queue -->|\"writes job id at enqueue\"| index\n---\n---\ntitle: \"Item lifecycle\"\nsummary: \"The item's four-state machine: enqueue commits a queued row, a mortal in-process task fetches the article and spawns its extraction job, poll resolves extraction, enrichment and synthesis to ready or failed, and retry re-drives from the phase that failed.\"\ncreated: \"2026-07-29\"\n---\n\n# Item lifecycle\n\n\n## 🔭 Overview\n\nAn item is the single persisted entity nagara has: the record of one `enqueue(url, voice?)` call, from creation through to playable audio or a clear failure. A four-state machine, three routes and one background task drive it. The background task fetches the article and hands it to the [extraction-service](extraction-service.md); every later step runs on poll. [article-extraction](article-extracti\n\n## 💽 Modeling","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"57dc8786-979a-45e6-9c1e-72161d4e4f94","timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:23:56.876Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"---\ntitle: \"Extraction service\"\nsummary: \"The extraction pipeline as a service on Cloudflare: a Worker entrypoint, a per-domain queue Durable Object, one Workflow per job, Flue agents for authoring and revision, called by the API with spawn-and-resolve, like the TTS service.\"\ncreated: \"2026-09-13\"\n---\n\n# Extraction service\n\n## 🔭 Overview\n\nExtraction runs as a service on Cloudflare, separate from the item pipeline. The Python API sends an article and a recipe, and receives the extraction result and, when an agent authored or revised the recipe, the final recipe. The service is stateless over recipes and items; every call carries everything, and the item database stays the record. The TTS service stays on Modal, a separate deployable\n\n## 🏗️ Architecture\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  subgraph inputs [API side]\n    api[Python item pipeline]\n  end\n  subgraph service [Extraction service on Cloudflare]\n    direction LR\n    entry[\"Worker entrypoint:<br/>POST /jobs, GET /jobs\"] --> queue[\"Domain-queue Durable Object,<br/>one per domain:<br/>lease + FIFO queue\"]\n    queue -->|\"creates when free\"| wf[\"Extraction Workflow,<br/>one instance per job\"]\n    index[\"Index Durable Object:<br/>job id to domain\"]\n    queue -->|\"writes job id at enqueue\"| index\n---\n---\ntitle: \"Item lifecycle\"\nsummary: \"The item's four-state machine: enqueue commits a queued row, a mortal in-process task fetches the article and spawns its extraction job, poll resolves extraction, enrichment and synthesis to ready or failed, and retry re-drives from the phase that failed.\"\ncreated: \"2026-07-29\"\n---\n\n# Item lifecycle\n\n\n## 🔭 Overview\n\nAn item is the single persisted entity nagara has: the record of one `enqueue(url, voice?)` call, from creation through to playable audio or a clear failure. A four-state machine, three routes and one background task drive it. The background task fetches the article and hands it to the [extraction-service](extraction-service.md); every later step runs on poll. [article-extraction](article-extracti\n\n## 💽 Modeling","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"812a8fc8-b317-4457-a26c-0d16ac314dc6","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","root":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","platform":"linux"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f52a3d24-4b17-4550-8505-0330ac2adcb7","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/docs","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
