{"parentUuid":"b24d6127-f6f5-4381-acd3-8f85505aa8d0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfujc4TZHsnp8ZMFQTsmd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The scout is back. Its full report is in `.scratch/cloudflare-migration/docs-impact.md`.\n\nAlmost every technical note needs changes. Only `read-along-timing.md`, `markdown-units.md`, the charter, the template and the product-design notes are unaffected. The one exception on the product side: `product-design/queue.md` lists three states where there are four, and it was already out of date before this design.\n\n| Note | How much changes |\n|---|---|\n| `item-lifecycle.md` | Nearly all of it: the BackgroundTasks step machine, the `queued_at` ceiling, the retry table keyed on `enriched_at`, the failure prefixes, and the async-over-sync section |\n| `extraction-service.md` | The job routes, the job state machine, the job index, the calling side and spawn-and-resolve. The Dynamic Worker warning, the runtime and the agents sections still hold |\n| `deployment-and-ci.md` | The whole Railway section, the Access warning, the CI diagram and order, and \"two deploy models\" |\n| `persistence-and-storage.md` | ORM, Alembic, SQLite and Postgres, the two storage backends, local files, `s3_configured`, and the ledger (adds `cached`, changes the commit points) |\n| `item-contract.md` | pydantic models move to `common/`, the route table, the asymmetry between local and bucket image serving goes away, and retry |\n| `authentication.md` | The FastAPI dependency, and \"streams the local file in dev\" (it's a 307 everywhere now) |\n| `tts-service.md` | The two web endpoints with proxy auth, the destination URL, no `audio_base64` in the result, and polling instead of `spawn` and `get` |\n| `article-extraction.md` | The fetch moves into the Workflow, Pillow and cairosvg become the Images binding with SVGs kept, and the Railway apt-packages warning goes |\n| `the-describer.md` | Gemini now goes through AI Gateway with the cache, SVG markup as text, the Python retry machinery, and \"no describer cache\" |\n| `recipes.md` | `extraction_handle` comes off the ER diagram, recipes live in D1, and who writes a version |\n| `invariants.md` | Invariants 5, 7 and 8 change; 6 and 10 need a check |\n| `technical-design/README.md` | Index summaries and the reading order |\n| `CLAUDE.md` | Layout table (adds `common/`), commands, Python pinning, the CI paragraph, invariants 5, 7 and 8, the code-style pydantic rule and `api/app/` layout, \"When adding something\", and the checks line |\n\nFor each one, decide: update it, add the minimum and point to the new note, or skip it.\n\n`extraction-service.md` is also still open. It can become the note on the pipeline Worker's parts (DomainQueue, the recipe runtime, the agents), with `item-lifecycle.md` linking to it from the lease and recipe steps, or it can fold into `item-lifecycle.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4757,"cache_read_input_tokens":520717,"output_tokens":1096,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":89},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4757,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1096,"cache_read_input_tokens":520717,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4757,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4757},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f6f559fd-3c6e-449e-a273-ee8ab47ab2ea","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfujc3r6LPPqZjv9Lf1wL","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ce69ba14-0f0c-4a44-b77e-3e3359d5a039","timestamp":"2026-10-