{"parentUuid":"9969414d-eb38-446f-93de-89fb179bc613","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfujpodgqzLtatm6rG86o","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Five drafters are working in parallel, each in its own tab. Together they cover:\n- `item-lifecycle.md`, with the useful parts of `extraction-service.md` folded in\n- storage, the item contract and authentication\n- deployment, the invariants, the index, `queue.md` and `CLAUDE.md`\n- TTS, article extraction, recipes, and the describer, renamed to `image-and-code-describer.md`\n- the two new notes, `common-package.md` and `local-development.md`\n\nEach one writes its note in full plus the edits to show you into `.scratch/cloudflare-migration/docs-drafts/`. Nothing under `docs/` or in `CLAUDE.md` changes yet.\n\nWhen they finish, I'll run the unslop pass and the documentation reviewer over the drafts. Then I'll show you every edit before anything lands."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":320,"cache_read_input_tokens":536890,"output_tokens":280,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":320,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":280,"cache_read_input_tokens":536890,"cache_creation_input_tokens":320,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":320},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"db8d2f7e-3498-44db-9583-60d56d37b7a0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfujpo5SdFhoUbQVUhAeq","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionSkill":"mahou:write-documentation","attributionPlugin":"mahou",