{"parentUuid":"3195cd39-489e-4cf8-b2d5-949499bea146","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"93123f5c-2014-4df8-8796-cbf57f61f75a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"\n\n<pasted_content id=\"bfba\">\n# Annotations on claude · last message\n\n## Annotation 1 (line 39)\nLooks good: \"Do these changes apply to shape-with-canvas too\"\n\n## Annotation 2 (line 40)\nComment on: \"- **Item 7:** you said \"adjust the existing design types\", plural. Does any type besides contract change? The session also drew data flows (branches 2, 7 and 8), a lifecycle (4) and rules (6) in the coloured style.\"\n> all that apply\n\n## Annotation 3 (line 41)\nComment on: \"- **Item 8:** does the palette go in superpowers:mermaid-validation, in a new skill about drawing diagrams, or somewhere else? Is it the same palette in every project, or a pattern of one colour and shape per kind with this palette as the example?\"\n> what do we do on the filadd experimental dev plugin about these? maybe we need to rethink the mermaid-validation into a mermaid skill and include this stuff too\n\n## Annotation 4 (line 42)\nComment on: \"- **Item 9:** do the general rule and the three rendering problems go in superpowers:mermaid-validation's \"Rendering rules the validator cannot catch\", or with item 8 wherever that lands?\"\n> same as item 8\n\n</pasted_content id=\"bfba\">\n"},"uuid":"fb235571-0159-4ebc-96e1-6d28ad0303b2","timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:42:16.761Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":57,"turnIndex":194},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
