h the answer, diagrams what reads clearer as a picture, separates the verified from the claimed, cuts what does not bear on the ask, structures by reader need rather than by source; ported from `filadd-experimental-dev` 2026-10 with the unslop and mermaid loads re-pointed at superpowers).\n307:**Cross-plugin dependencies:** `superpowers:unslop` (the writing pass in `write-documentation`, the rules held while writing in `report`) and `superpowers:mermaid-validation` (diagrams in `design`, `write-documentation` and `report`). Both degrade to \"say so and continue\" when absent. External CLIs: `plannotator` (`human-review`) and `agent-browser` (`validate`'s browser reference loads its skill content via `agent-browser skills get core --full`; `canvas` drives its tab with it), plus Node and npm for `canvas`.\n370:`superpowers` and `lesserpowers` are sibling plugins. `superpowers` keeps the curated, most-used surface (agent-browser, herdr, bro, mermaid-validation, show-markdown, unslop, the three `using-` skills, plus the situation-state and process-directives commands); `lesserpowers` holds everything else that was split out (systematic-debugging, self-maintaining-claude-md, hunk-review, agent-communication, financial-summary, and the evolve commands). They have no cross-references — the split is clean.\n398:- Plugin-specific skills (using-live-documentation, self-maintaining-claude-md, using-antigravity, agent-communication, financial-summary, using-code-directives, mermaid-validation, show-markdown) have no upstream and are never modified during sync","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"8fc9920d-d5a5-4d8d-b2f8-7d9cc875863a","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","root":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"unt