{"parentUuid":"960af778-e2b7-44bc-b359-96cb7b79408c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"f12c0c33-8795-4922-be5d-821f6ae8031b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"\n\n<pasted_content id=\"bfba\">\n# Annotations on claude · last message\n\n## Annotation 1 (line 7)\nComment on: \"Your rule, that the same id asking again gets the lease, covers a restart from fetch or lease, because then A asks again and is granted. A restart from recipe never asks. What should happen there?\"\n> ah okay, in that case we need to re-get the lease and recheck for the recipe on every retry just in case that situation happened\n\n## Annotation 2 (line 13)\nComment on: \"Should a retried authoring run continue the earlier conversation, or start a fresh one?\"\n> can we make the step retrying to use the same conversation instead of indexing by attempt too?\n\n</pasted_content id=\"bfba\">\n"},"uuid":"6379eeb1-1818-46dc-8cb3-d7953ff6b1c8","timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:58:14.801Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":63,"turnIndex":202},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
