{"parentUuid":"7d828089-c696-4e32-a607-5c7887dd341a","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_012UxBXogWtPLXKYFEiGgVJu","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"20e7d9e1-a98d-4192-a3c5-67c94bee9090","timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:58:40.311Z","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"20e7d9e1-a98d-4192-a3c5-67c94bee9090","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfunAVzaNiUxCpvLS6dSN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Recorded both answers:\n- **Lease on retry:** I read \"on every retry\" as every retry whose failed step needs the lease, meaning recipe or release. Those restart from the lease step, so the item asks for its domain's lease again under the same id, gets it, and recipe re-reads the domain's current recipe. That recipe may have been authored by another item in the meantime. A retry from images or later doesn't touch the lease. Tell me if you meant every retry, including those.\n- **Conversations:** the conversation id becomes the instance id alone, with no attempt suffix. A step retrying on its own and a restart both continue the same conversation and its history. Today's suffix starts each attempt with an empty conversation. Continuing means a failed attempt's turns stay in the context the next attempt sees.\n\nAll the answers from this round are in `.scratch/cloudflare-migration/recording-decisions.md`: P1–P13, D1–D8, and the lease and conversation rules. When the parallel-steps spike reports back, I'll send that file to the five drafters to revise their notes. Then I'll run the unslop pass and the reviewer, and show you the edits."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1975,"cache_read_input_tokens":598264,"output_tokens":373,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1975,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":373,"cache_read_input_tokens":598264,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1975,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1975},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"a6762cfe-8537-4a66-836e-286f07cfeabe","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfunAVKewYCizMZUL7F2S","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c0e5bd8c-6cd6-42c2-8cb5-8d1995ccd3ee","timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:58:40.310Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
