{"parentUuid":"8bd764f5-196f-4937-a0d6-2ebbdab5223d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d9e00f24-2908-4c0a-98e9-596935c1bcfc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016cP1efdNKvACQmtWpQuaW6","type":"tool_result","content":"24:- D4 describe fans out one step per description, run concurrently and awaited with Promise.allSettled, with no parent step (proposed after the parallel-steps spike; awaiting confirmation). Gemini calls run at most 6 at a time because a Workers instance holds 6 outbound connections. The describe phase never fails the item, even when every description fails; the rule that an item fails when every code block failed goes.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"a141aac7-bd36-4669-b298-86966f43dc85","timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:00:58.703Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"24:- D4 describe fans out one step per description, run concurrently and awaited with Promise.allSettled, with no parent step (proposed after the parallel-steps spike; awaiting confirmation). Gemini calls run at most 6 at a time because a Workers instance holds 6 outbound connections. The describe phase never fails the item, even when every description fails; the rule that an item fails when every code block failed goes.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"7731bdf4-7498-44dd-ae9f-95335930bb56","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","root":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"filadd/cc-plugin-marketplace","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","platform":"linux"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8bd764f5-196f-4937-a0d6-2ebbdab5223d","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"a141aac7-bd36-4669-b298-86966f43dc85","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14994387 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"622b9469-cf62-46f6-8a18-8bd9a46dc814","timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:00:58.718Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14994387 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"622b9469-cf62-46f6-8a18-8bd9a46dc814","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfunM81odvRRJ8eGs4BPk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The parallel-steps spike confirmed all three on a deployed Worker, and every instance ended complete:\n\n- **Concurrency:** 25 steps started within 96 ms of each other and ran together. An instance holds only 6 outbound connections, though, so 25 five-second fetches finished in batches of 6 and took 26 s in total. The Gemini calls would batch the same way.\n- **Failures:** with `Promise.allSettled`, the instance kept running whether 5 or all 25 steps failed after their retries.\n- **Nesting:** `step.do` inside a `step.do` works, but the step list records the children as ordinary top-level steps. If the parent step retries, all 25 children run again as new steps, and none are reused.\n- **Restart:** restarting from a step after the fan-out replayed the 25 children from cache in 0.3 s. Failed children aren't retried by that restart, because a failure is cached the same way as a success.\n- **Trap:** if a catch around `Promise.all` doesn't wait for the other children, the instance reports complete while they're still running.\n\nAll spike resources are deleted, and the spike is in the README table.\n\nMy proposal for describe: run one step per description concurrently, awaited with `Promise.allSettled`, with no parent step. A parent step adds nothing visible, since its children show up as top-level steps anyway. Its retry would also rerun every description, and each Gemini call is billed. Confirm this, or keep the parent step.\n\nOnce you confirm, I'll send `recording-decisions.md` to the five drafters to revise their notes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1114,"cache_read_input_tokens":602660,"output_tokens":508,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1114,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":508,"cache_read_input_tokens":602660,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1114,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1114},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"83b7f269-8dcf-4447-981d-a1f0ecc470b9","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfunM7TKPbUq71YCSSQPw","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ff10eb9f-88f0-4893-8906-fcc98044e70c","timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:01:18.590Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
