{"parentUuid":"75f75ba4-022a-4c9f-a079-29da30f8668f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfunTD26P7Bji7mQBCWaL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":51,"cache_read_input_tokens":604282,"output_tokens":680,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":256},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":51,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":680,"cache_read_input_tokens":604282,"cache_creation_input_tokens":51,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":51},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":3289,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"b4693c29-365c-4621-8ca2-c8236fe1e9f4","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfunTCEi2buECbkikVN3V","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6832e779-47d4-412c-9661-afeee3fe723f","timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:02:26.668Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"6832e779-47d4-412c-9661-afeee3fe723f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfunTD26P7Bji7mQBCWaL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Workflow's `run()` method holds it. That's the function that calls the steps in order: fetch, then lease, then recipe, and so on. Between the images step and the start-synthesis step, `run()` starts one `step.do` per description and awaits all of them with `Promise.allSettled`. It then reads which descriptions succeeded and continues. The fan-out is plain code in `run()`, not a step of its own.\n\nThe difference from a parent step:\n- **Plain code in `run()`:** code outside a step runs again whenever the instance resumes. Here that's harmless. On a resume, `run()` reaches the fan-out again, and every describe step that already finished returns its cached result instead of calling Gemini. The spike measured this, 25 children in 0.3 s.\n- **A parent step:** the children run inside the parent's callback. If the parent retries, Workflows runs all 25 children again as new steps, which is 25 new billed Gemini calls. The spike measured that too.\n\nThis changes two things in what's already settled:\n- **`current_step` during describe:** the wrapper still wraps each describe step, but 25 of them start at once and each writes its own name. During describe, `current_step` names whichever child wrote last.\n- **No retry from describe:** describe never fails the item, so a retry never restarts from a describe step."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":51,"cache_read_input_tokens":604282,"output_tokens":680,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":256},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":51,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":680,"cache_read_input_tokens":604282,"cache_creation_input_tokens":51,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":51},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b4693c29-365c-4621-8ca2-c8236fe1e9f4","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfunTCEi2buECbkikVN3V","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7767976c-41c6-43cb-9440-f2d652adc7b0","timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:02:30.985Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
