{"parentUuid":"c2cee3c4-f5d2-4251-a572-589e448a1604","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14998477 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"4988e039-fd0a-4701-b14a-b7a2ff01e550","timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:04:31.857Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14998477 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"4988e039-fd0a-4701-b14a-b7a2ff01e550","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuncqCCwyMC761t1e9wF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I recorded the describe fan-out:\n- **Before the fan-out:** `run()` writes `current_step` (describe) and the status once, outside any step. This write runs again if the instance resumes, but it writes the same values each time, so that's harmless.\n- **Each describe step:** writes only its own unit's information, meaning its spoken form, its degradation if it has one, and its ledger row.\n- **The other steps:** the wrapper's `current_step` and status write still applies to them.\n\nOne constraint follows from this. The units live in one JSON column on the item row. Each describe step's write has to change only its own unit within a single statement. If each step read the column, changed its unit and wrote the whole column back, 25 concurrent writes would overwrite each other. D1 runs each statement on its own, so a write scoped to one unit keeps them apart.\n\nI sent `recording-decisions.md` and the spike findings to the five drafters to revise their notes. When they finish, I'll run the unslop pass and the documentation reviewer, then show you every edit."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":322,"cache_read_input_tokens":606364,"output_tokens":333,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":322,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":333,"cache_read_input_tokens":606364,"cache_creation_input_tokens":322,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":322},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d9a6d409-e0ef-4d35-a7db-cfad8f2f46f2","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfuncpbkCXZVgBVt9ZUzm","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"12c61b52-95c4-4c78-8071-3e5c6a3691f5","timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:04:37.200Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
