{"parentUuid":"588355cd-b928-428c-aaf9-1d9c9bc07bcd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfuni2nrmrXrnw7wyxVRY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've switched describe to the parent-step version:\n- **The parent:** describe is one step, wrapped like every other step, so it writes `current_step` and the status as it starts.\n- **The children:** inside it, one child step per description runs concurrently under `Promise.allSettled`. Each child calls Gemini and returns its result without writing anything.\n- **The single write:** when all the children finish, the parent writes every unit's spoken form, the degradations and the ledger rows in one write. That also removes the problem of concurrent writes to the units column.\n- **Failures:** the parent never fails because a child failed.\n\nThis brings back one cost from the spike. If the parent itself retries, for example because its final write fails, every child runs again as a new step and calls Gemini again. AI Gateway's cache can answer those repeated calls while the entries are still cached.\n\n`recording-decisions.md` now has this version, and I sent the five drafters the correction while they revise."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1084,"cache_read_input_tokens":607090,"output_tokens":302,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1084,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":302,"cache_read_input_tokens":607090,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1084,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1084},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"6d7a9b21-e5ba-415f-a49d-e202131fd23f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfuni2AuSpnizL69KDGrZ","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"21e8fe92-aa8a-495b-b230-a47eac74d510","timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:05:47.439Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
