components | `data-flow.md` | `references/types/data-flow.md` |\n\n## New file: design-with-canvas/references/types/contract.md\n\n# Contract on the canvas\n\nDraw one `mermaid` shape per member, in the form `design`'s contract type gives, each under a caption `<member> · <when it is called>` in the hand font, stacked in the order the members are called. A branch with several boundaries draws each boundary's members under that boundary's sub-branch heading. Draw no table and no separate class diagram: the braces boxes inside each flowchart carry the interfaces.\n\n## New file: design-with-canvas/references/types/data-flow.md\n\n# Data flow on the canvas\n\nThe canvas's `mermaid` shape draws sequence diagrams with their labels out of place. Draw a data flow as a left-to-right flowchart instead: the components as nodes in the palette's shapes, each arrow numbered in the order of the path (`1 GET the audio`, `2 the item exists?`), and the prose naming the steps by number. Use a sequence diagram in the final document only when the document's renderer draws it correctly.\nEOF\necho done"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"c7f01526-f8b5-43c5-bb17-b720ca536c09","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfunuYQ97ht7DBRYRzMi4","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"25cb9ca4-d428-4ba2-8857-da8ad47f9dad","timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:08:39.679Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/learn/round2","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
