{"parentUuid":"6fe0148b-d26b-4a50-af67-126e3d6116fd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfunx9FBoP2VTpqVFA4P2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2116,"cache_read_input_tokens":628371,"output_tokens":1257,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":429},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2116,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1257,"cache_read_input_tokens":628371,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2116,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2116},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":10289,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"5beae476-691f-4334-97e6-1053a2586c4e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfunx8eDvcB4eq6MUkF8D","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"3c8212f5-dd42-4305-a2db-1077603f102f","timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:09:06.506Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/learn/round2","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"3c8212f5-dd42-4305-a2db-1077603f102f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfunx9FBoP2VTpqVFA4P2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The drafters have applied the decisions. Two things need you.\n\n**A subagent is waiting on a permission prompt.** The \"learn: canvas ports\" tab, pane `w30:p1M`, wants to run `rm -rf ~/.cache/mahou-canvas/servers /tmp/cvtest /tmp/cvA /tmp/cvB`. Those are the test folders it made, plus the per-document state folder its new script created during the test. The current canvas script doesn't use that folder, so nothing else depends on it. Approve it in that tab, or tell me to answer for you. Its test passed: two canvases ran at once on ports 5191 and 5192, while your filadd canvas stayed on 5190.\n\n**`item-lifecycle.md` now has the end-to-end diagram you asked for.** It's a new section, \"🗺️ How an item moves through the system\", right after the Overview. It shows:\n- enqueue\n- the nine steps, with the describe fan-out\n- the services and stores each step reaches\n- where the status moves\n- the retry path\n- the client reading the item and its audio\n\nThe Workflow is drawn as a frame around its steps, because mermaid can't give a group a shape.\n\n**Gaps the drafters still found:**\n\n- **Title (my proposal):** the recipe step writes the title together with the units, since both come out of the recipe. Confirm or correct.\n- **Describe children:** how many attempts and what timeout does each child step get? Shape set describe at 5 minutes per attempt when it was one step. With the parent waiting on up to 25 children, and at most 6 Gemini calls at a time, does the 5 minutes now apply to each child or to the parent?\n- **Stuck items vs the retry claim:** the retry route claims only an item whose status is failed (P5). An item stuck in queued, or stranded by a dev-server reload, never reaches failed, but branch 8 and P12 say to restart those through the retry route. Which way should it go?\n- **Command lines:** the `api/` and `common/` command lines in `CLAUDE.md` are guesses copied from the pipeline's scripts. Keep them as placeholders, or leave those lines for program design?\n\nI'll also give the charter fix (P13) to the drafter that owns `CLAUDE.md`.\n\nThe learn drafts are in `.scratch/cloudflare-migration/learn/round2/`: items 1–7 and 10 are written. The mermaid-skill draft is still in progress. When it finishes, I'll run the unslop pass over all of them and show you the drafts."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2116,"cache_read_input_tokens":628371,"output_tokens":1257,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":429},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2116,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1257,"cache_read_input_tokens":628371,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2116,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2116},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5beae476-691f-4334-97e6-1053a2586c4e","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfunx8eDvcB4eq6MUkF8D","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"beb7f393-6e1a-4872-8b39-f9b44524874a","timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:09:07.641Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/learn/round2","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
