, its check in `scripts/validate-mermaid.mjs`, the \"Shapes Notion renders\" section of `references/flowchart.md` and the Notion fix in `SKILL.md`. superpowers carries none of them. superpowers' validator reads stdin and Filadd's takes a file path, so the validation steps differ too.\n  ```\n(eval):1: ==== not found","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"cd404f70-2e18-4b07-bc1a-9b298a6dd818","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"subcommandResults"},"session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/learn/round2","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
