 decision that more than one answer could reasonably settle is asked open.\n\n**Item 8, revised paragraph**\n\n**`mahou/skills/design-with-canvas/SKILL.md`**: the table and the two canvas references stay as drafted.\n\nFor a branch whose type has a canvas reference under `references/types/`, read both the type in `design` and the canvas reference: draw the canvas as the canvas reference describes, and write `design.md` and the final documentation in the type's own form. A type with no canvas reference is drawn in its own form. Each canvas reference has the same file name as the type it adapts.\n\nThis matches the data-flow canvas reference. The canvas draws a numbered flowchart, while `design.md` and the notes keep the type's sequence diagram.\n\nYou left items 1–6 and 9 without comments. Should I write all nine items to the plugins now, uncommitted, or do you want to look at any of them again first?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1489,"cache_read_input_tokens":679725,"output_tokens":984,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":129},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1489,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":984,"cache_read_input_tokens":679725,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1489,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1489},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8cd31134-c4d4-407f-90a0-82e64e945981","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfupE6iCkqr6Vnt87FbWt","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"11f46e33-546b-41e5-9c5a-a6a646d5df84","timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:25:48.332Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5