{"parentUuid":"44b6d2fc-8a54-413b-ab82-a52c67513415","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfupMQaRz7C95j7GiNPhH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All nine learn items are written to the plugins, uncommitted. `git mv` staged the rename of `mermaid-validation` to `mermaid`. Everything else is unstaged.\n\n- **canvas:** the font, `growY` and multi-port rules in `SKILL.md`, and the new `canvas.sh`.\n- **Questions under the write-up and the opening-tree note:** both in design-with-canvas and shape-with-canvas.\n- **Proposing obvious answers:** basics rule 2, the program-design phrase, and design-tree.\n- **Design types:**\n  - the contract type's representation is now one flowchart per member, with braces boxes for interfaces\n  - the palette is added to component-architecture, data-flow, lifecycle and rules\n  - design-with-canvas has its table and two new references, `contract.md` and `data-flow.md`\n- **Workflows wiki:** the restart, fan-out and step facts.\n- **`superpowers:mermaid`:** replaces `mermaid-validation`. Every reference is updated: the root `CLAUDE.md` and `README.md`, superpowers' README, mahou's README, the five mahou skills, and both sync skills, with the Notion divergence written into `sync-to-filadd`.\n\n**The docs.** All five drafters have applied both rounds of decisions. Every note is drafted in full, with its edits file, in `.scratch/cloudflare-migration/docs-drafts/`:\n- 11 notes updated\n- 2 new notes: `common-package.md` and `local-development.md`\n- `image-and-code-describer.md`, renamed from the describer note\n- `CLAUDE.md`\n- the charter fix\n\nNothing under `docs/` or in `CLAUDE.md` has changed yet. Two points are open before I run the unslop pass and the documentation reviewer and show you every edit:\n\n- **Retry vs stuck items.** The retry route claims only a failed item (P5), but the local-development note restarts an item stuck in queued through that same route. Should the retry route also accept an item stuck in queued?\n- **The charter's markdown example.** The charter's folder example still cites `markdown-it-py`, the Python library the API uses today to walk markdown tokens. Should the drafter update that line, or leave it?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1190,"cache_read_input_tokens":693594,"output_tokens":896,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":152},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1190,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":896,"cache_read_input_tokens":693594,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1190,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1190},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3d723737-9696-4443-8ab0-c060173e15ae","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfupMPeNQR54geMEnDXkF","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6ecb8b67-63ed-4a87-b6c0-62df079daf4f","timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:27:26.889Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
