{"parentUuid":"9f729e02-2ce8-4da2-8a80-5d5a56f55e71","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"bfa32ed9-babd-4bb0-92a6-0867b6b276d3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0176WP4Ao8g5ZiPc5zL9LQAF","type":"tool_result","content":"# Basics\n\n- Subagents run through `herdr-subagents:delegate`, not the Agent tool. Each one is a herdr tab. When a skill names a mahou agent, such as a scout, a reviewer or the researcher, spawn a generic child. Its brief holds the body of that agent's `agents/<name>.md` in the mahou plugin, verbatim, followed by the task. A generic child does not load the agent file, so the brief is the only way the agent's rules reach the child.\ncloudflare\nINDEX.md\ntesting\n# Local wiki\n\n- [`testing`](testing/INDEX.md): how the suites replay the services behind HTTP boundaries\n- [`cloudflare`](cloudflare/INDEX.md): running the pipeline locally against the real AI Gateway\n/home/agus/workspace/asermax/claude-plugins/mahou/skills/test-design\n# Status\n\n- **Stage**: design recorded in `docs/`, committed on branch `feat/cloudflare-migration` (not pushed). Next: the user's review of the docs, then mahou:tasks.\n\n## Links\n\n- Linear: milestone \"Cloudflare migration\", project nagara.\n\n## Local artifacts\n\n- `README.md`: folder index, spike table, credentials to delete by hand.\n- `shape.md`: the settled shape tree.\n- `design.md`: the design tree and each branch's prose and diagrams.\n- `recording-decisions.md`: decisions made while recording the docs, which amend design.md.\n- `docs-drafts/`: the drafts the docs were written from.\n- `docs-impact.md`: the docs-scout's list of notes the migration touched.\n- `canvas/design.tldr.json`: the design canvas, drawn from `design.md`.\n- `canvas/current-system.tldr.json`, `canvas/cloudflare-options.tldr.json`: exploration drawings.\n- `spikes/`: spike code and findings; `spikes/REPORT.md` is the combined report of the first nine; `spikes/restart-resolve/` measured when `restart()` resolves.\n- `briefs/`: briefs sent to scouts, researchers and spikes.\n- `learn/`: mahou:learn drafts, applied.\n\n## Tracking\n\n- Delete the Modal proxy auth token and revoke the R2 API tokens from the spikes (see `README.md`, \"Still to delete by hand\").\n   122 docs/technical-design/article-extraction.md\n    52 docs/technical-design/authentication.md\n    81 docs/technical-design/common-package.md\n   123 docs/technical-design/deployment-and-ci.md\n   127 docs/technical-design/image-and-code-describer.md\n    35 docs/technical-design/invariants.md\n    97 docs/technical-design/item-contract.md\n   345 docs/technical-design/item-lifecycle.md\n    80 docs/technical-design/local-development.md\n    64 docs/technical-design/markdown-units.md\n   167 docs/technical-design/persistence-and-storage.md\n    50 docs/technical-design/read-along-timing.md\n    45 docs/technical-design/README.md\n   140 docs/technical-design/recipes.md\n   104 docs/technical-design/tts-service.md\n  1632 total","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"aef1cf84-3343-4685-b344-b449633c6545","timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:47:55.690Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"# Basics\n\n- Subagents run through `herdr-subagents:delegate`, not the Agent tool. Each one is a herdr tab. When a skill names a mahou agent, such as a scout, a reviewer or the researcher, spawn a generic child. Its brief holds the body of that agent's `agents/<name>.md` in the mahou plugin, verbatim, followed by the task. A generic child does not load the agent file, so the brief is the only way the agent's rules reach the child.\ncloudflare\nINDEX.md\ntesting\n# Local wiki\n\n- [`testing`](testing/INDEX.md): how the suites replay the services behind HTTP boundaries\n- [`cloudflare`](cloudflare/INDEX.md): running the pipeline locally against the real AI Gateway\n/home/agus/workspace/asermax/claude-plugins/mahou/skills/test-design\n# Status\n\n- **Stage**: design recorded in `docs/`, committed on branch `feat/cloudflare-migration` (not pushed). Next: 