n- `src/world.ts` holds the `ItemWorld` seam, copied from the shape of `pipeline/src/workflow/world.ts`.\n- `test/cassette.ts` holds a vcrpy YAML loader and an in-order replayer that matches on method and URI, with optional JSON body matching and URI rewriting.\n- `test/fixtures.ts` imports three repo cassettes with Vite `?raw`: `test_firecrawl_fetch/test_firecrawl_http_surface`, `test_describe_images/test_image_describe_returns_a_clean_sentence` and `test_describe/test_a_429_retries_then_succeeds`. It also imports one fabricated Modal cassette, `test/cassettes/modal_tts_fabricated.yaml` (submit, 202, 202, 200 with an `X-Duration` header), because the repo has no Modal cassette: modal is mocked in the Python suite today.\n- Tests: `test/introspection.test.ts`, `test/msw.test.ts` (msw 3.0.2), `test/msw2.test.ts` (msw 2.15.0), `test/seam.test.ts`, and `test/outbound/outbound.test.ts` under its own config, `vitest.outbound.config.ts`.\n\n```\ncd .scratch/cloudflare-migration/spikes/workflow-testing/app        # or app-1.3.6\npnpm install\npnpm vitest run --reporter=verbose --silent=false                   # 19 tests\npnpm vitest run -c vitest.outbound.config.ts --reporter=verbose     # 1 test\npnpm tsc --noEmit\n```\n\nNo test reaches a real service, and no cloud resource was created.\n\n## Measurements\n\n| Test | Elapsed |\n|---|---|\n| Everything mocked through introspection, sleeps disabled | 22 ms |\n| Two mocked errors on `describe image` with `disableRetryDelays` | 13–20 ms |\n| One mocked error on `fetch page` without `disableRetryDelays` (5 s constant delay) | 5016 ms |\n| One 30 s sleep not disabled (introspection test and seam test alike) | 30013 / 30024 ms |\n| MSW replaying Firecrawl, Gemini and Modal through the real step bodies | 44–76 ms |\n| `outboundService` replaying the same set | 61–117 ms |\n| Whole suite, 19 tests, files in parallel | 38.6 s on both plugin versions, almost all of it the two deliberate 30 s sleeps |\n\nMSW replay produced the same