{"parentUuid":"3b9119ad-c04c-4661-b696-27f4ec8f7438","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14769553 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"33fbf6e0-0b1d-4a53-ac00-63876f377407","timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:57:06.649Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14769553 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"33fbf6e0-0b1d-4a53-ac00-63876f377407","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfurdP2bZbeF3i5BkUten","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The canvas is at **http://localhost:5191**.\n\nI drew the whole program design on it. The tree is at the top, with a Claude note beside it listing the points worth checking first. Below that, each branch is a column and each of its parts is a box, all marked proposed. The column order is workspace, common/, api/, the item Workflow, DomainQueue, tts/, local dev, CI and standards. The full text is in `program-design/nagara.md` in the scratch folder.\n\nPut a sticky note on anything that doesn't match your idea and click Send to Claude. Voice messages work too. The proposal makes these calls that go beyond the recorded docs or that the docs left open:\n\n- **CI:** one `cloudflare.yml` with path-filtered jobs replaces the three workflows the docs describe. Separate workflows can't wait for each other within one push.\n- **Re-queue:** the 15-minute re-queue claims the row with a single conditional update, so two polls landing together restart the instance only once. It doesn't count toward the 3 retries, and it restarts from `current_step`.\n- **Lease queue:** DomainQueue keeps an item that is already waiting at its place in the queue, so re-queuing an item that waits for its domain's lease doesn't send it to the back.\n- **Failed create at enqueue:** if creating the Workflow instance fails, enqueue still answers 202, and the re-queue picks the item up 15 minutes later.\n- **Poll steps:** each poll step is named `poll <n>`, and a retry restarts at that poll without asking Modal to synthesize again.\n- **Alt-text filter placement:** the filter that decides whether an image's alt is good enough stays in `pipeline/`, although two pipeline modules use it. A literal reading of CLAUDE.md would put it in `common/`.\n- **Tests:** they replay HTTP with msw, and the current `WORLD_SEAM` test seam goes.\n- **Still not covered:** an item left stuck in `generating` by a dev-server reload. Only `queued` items re-queue.\n\nI'll run /test-design once the program design is settled."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":383,"cache_read_input_tokens":230160,"output_tokens":689,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":383,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":689,"cache_read_input_tokens":230160,"cache_creation_input_tokens":383,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":383},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"141ee930-cfde-451c-b2b2-cc95bd4dc731","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfurdNe2nkeA283m7GYsa","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionSkill":"mahou:program-design","attributionPlugin":"mahou","type":"assistant","uuid":"87fc4222-bc60-4a33-b757-40c4c7017c9e","timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:57:13.671Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
