{"parentUuid":"6e922135-3fd6-452b-a102-e47043a4b098","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfus1ZaD6AwgKo6XCrCGm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I redrew the canvas as diagrams. The first redraw you saw was a mistake on my part: my script re-ran the old text version before the diagram version loaded. What's there now is the diagram version.\n\nIt has 17 diagrams in the same columns, one branch per column, each part with a one- or two-line caption. They cover:\n- packages and their dependencies\n- the shared types and modules in common/\n- the enqueue/poll, retry and media routes as flowcharts\n- the api/ modules\n- the nine Workflow steps and the step wrapper\n- what each step calls\n- the lease, the describe fan-out, and the pipeline files changed\n- DomainQueue's acquire, release and alarm\n- the two Modal endpoints\n- the local dev launch\n- the CI workflow and the conventions that apply\n\nI left the Claude note in place and updated its references to the new part numbers. The full text stays in `program-design/nagara.md`, and the diagram sources are in `program-design/canvas.md`.\n\nOn drawing speed: yes, I can draw a large batch at once. I'll do that from now on, so when I redraw a lot of content it all appears together instead of one shape at a time.\n\nThe canvas is still at http://localhost:5191. Put sticky notes on anything that doesn't match your idea and click Send to Claude."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":600,"cache_read_input_tokens":248634,"output_tokens":421,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":600,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":421,"cache_read_input_tokens":248634,"cache_creation_input_tokens":600,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":600},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8d8760f4-5c34-42fd-a2a0-5f5254a907e7","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfus1Yp5hXG53MUAEnznR","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ad0faf33-8fa1-49eb-a77f-28b2cbc9bdcd","timestamp":"2026-10-11T05:02:12.729Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
