{"parentUuid":"df81775d-dc5f-4262-b538-1a613a4d0cbf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfusCvmybrEnrZtKAMcfK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I redrew \"What each step calls\" (4.3) so its arrows no longer cross. The fan-in arrows are what crossed, and they're gone:\n\n- **One row per step.** Each row reads step → module → external service, left to right.\n- **AI Gateway twice.** It now appears once in the agents row and once in the Gemini row, so the recipe and describe rows don't share a node.\n- **No D1 arrows.** The six arrows from the steps into D1 and the ledger box are removed. The caption now says that only the step files write to D1, ledger rows included, and that the modules only return values.\n\nI moved the rest of the pipeline column up to close the space the shorter diagram left. The same diagram is updated in `program-design/canvas.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":593,"cache_read_input_tokens":258139,"output_tokens":238,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":593,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":238,"cache_read_input_tokens":258139,"cache_creation_input_tokens":593,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":593},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c4342697-b285-42bd-8eff-a4901b577903","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfusCv5oTu4auEQfxkMiN","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d5b9dd74-d90f-4c3d-9813-7796e8c1f1ae","timestamp":"2026-10-11T05:04:45.397Z","advisorMod