{"parentUuid":"a143827e-4459-4440-b17a-5b57feff30f8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfusT6eCboKktZTga7Kyy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I redrew the CI diagram (8.1) to show what a failed check stops:\n\n- **Deploy chain box.** The three deploy jobs sit in one box labelled \"deploy chain: a job runs only when no job before it failed\": 1 migrate, then 2 deploy pipeline, then 3 deploy api.\n- **Failure arrows.** Each check has a dashed \"fails\" arrow to a red end showing what doesn't run:\n  - common checks fail: 1, 2 and 3 don't run, so there's no migration and no Worker deploys.\n  - pipeline checks fail: 2 and 3 don't run.\n  - api checks fail: 3 doesn't run.\n- **Trigger labels.** The arrows from the paths filter now say which tree's change triggers each check.\n\nThe caption now says that a check skipped because its tree didn't change doesn't stop the chain, so a pipeline-only push still deploys. I updated the diagram in `program-design/canvas.md` too."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1642,"cache_read_input_tokens":261847,"output_tokens":378,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":58},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1642,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":378,"cache_read_input_tokens":261847,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1642,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1642},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"4a92e59d-30e4-4056-85b5-9c266ab40d77","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfusT69vpfQ12PNYHE8eF","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5