{"parentUuid":"03a721ee-3ff1-4385-a334-cd70da50fb9d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfusTzQfwwehWomrNhZrE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":681,"cache_read_input_tokens":263489,"output_tokens":1005,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":260},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":681,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1005,"cache_read_input_tokens":263489,"cache_creation_input_tokens":681,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":681},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":3225,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"86fa85d0-82ad-4c41-a4c7-d96412d21731","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfusTz4bZmyBM1gsU2YuH","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6b34b866-764c-4a48-9ddf-33dc096cbfa7","timestamp":"2026-10-11T05:08:10.688Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/program-design","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"6b34b866-764c-4a48-9ddf-33dc096cbfa7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfusTzQfwwehWomrNhZrE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The canvas parts are proposals, and none is settled until you accept it. Most of them follow straight from the docs. These ones go beyond the docs or fill a gap the design left open, so they're the ones to check:\n\n1. **Re-queue rules (3.1, 5.1).** The re-queue claims the row with a conditional update, so two polls landing together restart the instance once. It doesn't count toward the 3 retries. It restarts from `current_step`, and DomainQueue keeps an already-waiting item at its place in the queue.\n2. **Instance creation fails at enqueue (3.1).** The route still answers 202, and the 15-minute re-queue recovers the item.\n3. **Poll steps (4.1).** Each is named `poll <n>`, `current_step` holds that name, and a retry restarts at that poll without synthesizing again. The poll interval is 10 s.\n4. **Lease waits (4.4).** The item waits up to 3 times for 1 h each, and asks DomainQueue again after each timeout.\n5. **Images not yet acquired (2.1).** The recipe step writes them to the row as a `declared-image` unit, which the images step replaces. The describe step reads an image's alt back from its display markdown, so the unit needs no extra field.\n6. **Alt-text filter placement (4.3).** The filter stays in `pipeline/images/alt` although describe uses it too. A literal reading of CLAUDE.md puts it in `common/`.\n7. **Tests (4.6).** They replay HTTP with msw, and the `WORLD_SEAM` test seam goes.\n8. **CI (8.1).** One `cloudflare.yml` replaces the three workflows the docs describe. I'm reading your \"looks pretty good\" on that diagram as accepting it. Tell me if that's wrong.\n9. **Item stuck in `generating` after a dev reload.** Nothing covers it. Only `queued` items re-queue, so locally it stays stuck unless we add something.\n\nOnce you've answered these, the remaining step is updating the docs. Each departure you accept goes into the notes through mahou:write-documentation, for example item-lifecycle for the poll step naming and the re-queue claim, and deployment-and-ci for the single workflow. After that comes /test-design."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":681,"cache_read_input_tokens":263489,"output_tokens":1005,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":260},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":681,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1005,"cache_read_input_tokens":263489,"cache_creation_input_tokens":681,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":681},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"86fa85d0-82ad-4c41-a4c7-d96412d21731","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfusTz4bZmyBM1gsU2YuH","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a80919fa-5095-4b1a-906b-61c700dd7e1b","timestamp":"2026-10-11T05:08:17.223Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/program-design","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
