s units dropped, declared images anchored after the last kept text unit.\" }',\n    '\"spoken.toTypedUnits(recipeUnits)\": { \"description\": \"→ {units, declaredImages}: the text units with their spoken form, empty-of-letters units dropped; each declared image as {after, src, alt}, after = the index of the last kept text unit before it, -1 when none.\" }')\nrep('\"images.acquire(env, units, itemId)\": { \"description\": \"→ {units, degradations}:','\"images.acquire(env, units, declaredImages, itemId)\": { \"description\": \"→ {units, degradations}: each acquired image interleaved after its anchor, the rest dropped with a degradation;')\nrep('\"fetch\": { \"properties\": { \"html\": { \"type\": \"string\" } } },','\"fetch\": { \"properties\": { \"html\": { \"type\": \"string\" } } },\\n    \"recipe\": { \"properties\": { \"declaredImages\": { \"type\": \"array\", \"items\": { \"properties\": { \"after\": { \"type\": \"integer\" }, \"src\": {}, \"alt\": {} } }, \"description\": \"The recipe\\'s images, not yet acquired; the images step reads them. Not on the row: the row holds only finished units.\" } } },')\nrep('\"pollIntervalSeconds\": { \"const\": 10 }','\"pollIntervalSeconds\": { \"const\": 5 }')\ns=s.replace('timeout: \"1 hour\"','timeout: \"5 minutes\"')\ns=re.sub(r'At 10 s, the 10,000-step limit covers about 27 h of synthesis', 'At 5 s, as in the item-workflow spike, the 10,000-step limit covers about 13.8 h of synthesis', s)\nrep(\"pipeline/src/spoken/derive.ts                 new       ported from extract.py: to_spoken, the token walk, tables\",\n    \"pipeline/src/spoken/derive.ts                 new       ported from extract.py: to_spoken, the token walk, tables\\npipeline/src/spoken/sanitize.ts               new       the sanitize tail, also imported by describe/core\")\ns=re.sub(r'`images/alt.ts` holds the good-alt filter[^\\n]*', \"`images/alt.ts` holds the good-alt filter and `spoken/sanitize.ts` the sanitize tail; the describe module imports both from there, per CLAUDE.md's rule that code only pipeline modules share stays in `pipeline/`.\", s)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"1 h\\b\\|3 waits\\|After the third\\|lease wait\" nagara.md | cut -c1-250"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2311,"cache_read_input_tokens":268087,"output_tokens":1823,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":131},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2311,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1823,"cache_read_input_tokens":268087,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2311,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2311},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01P3dCJCWHWF2nG9CHWK78ja":{"command":"cd /home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/program-design; python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\np='nagara.md'; s=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a,b):\n    global s\n    assert a in s, a[:60]\n    s=s.replace(a,b)\nrep(\"types, keys, presigning, item row, sanitize\",\"types, keys, presigning, item row\")\nrep('\"items\": { \"$ref\": \"common/src/units.ts#/$defs/RowUnit\" }','\"items\": { \"$ref\": \"common/src/units.ts#/$defs/Unit\" }')\ns=re.sub(r'\\n    \"DeclaredImageUnit\": .*\\n    \"RowUnit\": .*', '', s)\nrep('\"title\": \"common/src/ledger.ts, common/src/recipe.ts, common/src/sanitize.ts\"','\"title\": \"common/src/ledger.ts, common/src/recipe.ts\"')\ns=re.sub(r',\\n    \"sanitizeSpoken\": \\{[^\\n]*\\}', '', s)\ns=re.sub(r'`sanitizeSpoken` and the row reads and writes are in `common/`[^\\n]*', \"The row reads and writes are in `common/` because both Workers make them; code o