{"parentUuid":"c870f619-4452-4f21-86f0-8d5ae1c98bdb","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"866e279e-27ce-438f-82de-cca5de874443","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FJUfk13cKyqpKae48YALsC","type":"tool_result","content":"canvas.md:253:    s7 --> loop\ncanvas.md:259:    r -->|\"yes, returns the result\"| s9[\"9 store · generating<br/>join timings; writes<br/>ready, units, duration,<br/>format, tts ledger row\"]\ncanvas.md:266:    loop -. \"failed or expired\" .-> fail\nnagara.md:135:    \"STEP\": { \"enum\": [\"fetch\", \"lease\", \"recipe\", \"release\", \"images\", \"describe\", \"start synthesis\", \"poll\", \"store\"], \"description\": \"Constant map of step names. A poll step runs as `\nnagara.md:387:    s7 --> loop\nnagara.md:393:    r -->|\"yes, returns the result\"| s9[\"9 store · generating<br/>join timings; writes<br/>ready, units, duration,<br/>format, tts ledger row\"]\nnagara.md:400:    loop -. \"failed or expired\" .-> fail\n**The poll loop.** Step `poll <n>` asks Modal for the result; when it is not ready, `step.sleep(\"poll sleep <n>\", pollIntervalSeconds)` and `n + 1`. Each name carries its counter, because a repeated name replays the cached result. Each poll step has 3 attempts of 1 min; Modal's 500 (the synthesis crashed) and 410 (the result expired after 7 days) throw, so a crashed synthesis uses the poll step's attempts and fails the item. At 5 s, as in the item-workflow spike, the 10,000-step limit covers about 13.8 h of synthesis; a 70-minute article took 176 s.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"951b5aeb-ff23-4ebf-9ac5-628fd5b493f4","timestamp":"2026-10-11T05:20:33.297Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"canvas.md:253:    s7 --> loop\ncanvas.md:259:    r -->|\"yes, returns the result\"| s9[\"9 store · generating<br/>join timings; writes<br/>ready, units, duration,<br/>format, tts ledger row\"]\ncanvas.md:266:    loop -. \"failed or expired\" .-> fail\nnagara.md:135:    \"STEP\": { \"enum\": [\"fetch\", \"lease\", \"recipe\", \"release\", \"images\", \"describe\", \"start synthesis\", \"poll\", \"store\"], \"description\": \"Constant map of step names. A poll step runs as `\nnagara.md:387:    s7 --> loop\nnagara.md:393:    r -->|\"yes, returns the result\"| s9[\"9 store · generating<br/>join timings; writes<br/>ready, units, duration,<br/>format, tts ledger row\"]\nnagara.md:400:    loop -. \"failed or expired\" .-> fail\n**The poll loop.** Step `poll <n>` asks Modal for the result; when it is not ready, `step.sleep(\"poll sleep <n>\", pollIntervalSeconds)` and `n + 1`. Each name carries its counter, because a repeated name replays the cached result. Each poll step has 3 attempts of 1 min; Modal's 500 (the synthesis crashed) and 410 (the result expired after 7 days) throw, so a crashed synthesis uses the poll step's attempts and fails the item. At 5 s, as in the item-workflow spike, the 10,000-step limit covers about 13.8 h of synthesis; a 70-minute article took 176 s.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"ed0b340b-f541-428f-996f-7990eaebfae9","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/program-design","root":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","branch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"filadd/cc-plugin-marketplace","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/program-design","platform":"linux"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":