{"parentUuid":"8401076b-6617-464f-b165-cd356da33794","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuuMBvFxkivRv4p9R4xj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I drew a sample branch as a tree, below the roots on the canvas. It uses presign from common/ as the example:\n\n- **Top:** the function under test.\n- **Violet boxes:** the factors that change its outcome. Here that's the method and the endpoint.\n- **Green boxes:** the cases of each factor. GET and PUT under method; R2 and the local S3 endpoint under endpoint.\n- **Grid below:** one line per test row, with its id and what the test does on the left, a dot under each case the row picks, and the expected result and kind (test or manual) on the right. Manual rows would get orange dots.\n\nTell me what to change about the drawing: layout, colours, where the expected results go, or another form altogether. Once the drawing works for you, I'll use it for every branch, after you've confirmed the roots."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3979,"cache_read_input_tokens":369148,"output_tokens":335,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":72},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3979,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":335,"cache_read_input_tokens":369148,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3979,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3979},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"90858be8-6ec6-42a6-b49b-65f0893e5773","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfuuMB3RuT2chHbUq1Jig","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid