{"parentUuid":"5ccae700-215f-406b-892a-7bbe74e5815c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuudAbqADqhKTGSRp7WV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I redrew the candidate roots as a map of the system, so each one shows where it sits:\n\n- **Layout:** the client on the left calls **api/** (D1 to D5). The API starts **pipeline/** (C1 ItemWorkflow.run, C2 DomainQueue), which calls **tts/** (B1 start, B2 result). **common/** (A1 to A4) runs along the bottom as what both Workers import.\n- **Arrows:** they show the hand-offs, labelled create, restart, acquire and release, start, and wait for synthesis.\n- **Cards:** each root is a ☐ card with an example scenario. For D2 that's polling a ready item and getting timed units and `audio_url`, or a queued item 16 minutes old getting re-queued once.\n- **Not roots:** the grey dashed cards are what I propose not to make a root, with the reason. One is the Flue agents and recipe runtime, which only run inside the recipe step. The other is the migrations, which are checked by hand by reading an item back through D2.\n\nTick or cross out cards with sticky notes, or tell me by voice. The sample presign tree is now further down the canvas."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":512,"cache_read_input_tokens":379688,"output_tokens":377,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":512,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":377,"cache_read_input_tokens":379688,"cache_creation_input_tokens":512,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":512},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"