{"parentUuid":"c1a30566-048d-423f-b36f-4529d26cdb94","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14939066 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"41c0caa4-d7fd-4493-acf9-44a5b5ea059a","timestamp":"2026-10-11T05:41:52.674Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14939066 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"41c0caa4-d7fd-4493-acf9-44a5b5ea059a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfuv3P4c1RBC6Zo13rNio","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Every tree is now drawn below the map in the presign style. Presign is a single test, as you said. There are 103 rows, 9 of them manual checks in orange, and they're also in `test-design/nagara.md`:\n\n| Tree | Branches | Rows | Manual checks |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| A common/ | presign (1), writeStatus/readItem, restartPoint, replayCassettes | A1–A16 | none |\n| B tts/ | POST start, GET result | B1–B10 | B6: a real synthesis into R2 |\n| C pipeline/ | wrapper, fetch, lease/release, recipe, images, describe, synthesis, DomainQueue | C1–C46 | C18: a new domain's recipe; C31: descriptions heard; C38: a real article listened to |\n| D api/ | POST /items, GET, retry, media, key guard | D1–D31 | D5: enqueue to ready; D14: migrations read back; D22: retry to ready; D28: audio plays in a browser |\n\nThe Claude note on the canvas lists four open questions, which need your answers:\n\n1. **C20:** does a raster under 200 px record a degradation when it's dropped, or is it dropped silently?\n2. **C14–C17:** with `WORLD_SEAM` gone, how do the tests stand in for the Flue agents, which run in their own Durable Objects? I'd make this an implementation task: replay the agents' AI Gateway calls if those Durable Objects run inside the test, otherwise fake the agent's reply.\n3. **C19:** I haven't checked whether the Images binding works in local tests. If it doesn't, the images rows need setup or become manual checks.\n4. **B2:** what does the result endpoint return for an unknown or malformed call id? The design only names 202, 200, 500 and 410.\n\nCorrect rows with sticky notes or voice. Once every tree is settled, I'll write it up and list the implementation tasks."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":559,"cache_read_input_tokens":404198,"output_tokens":640,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":559,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":640,"cache_read_input_tokens":404198,"cache_creation_input_tokens":559,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":559},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e1356387-cce4-4f3d-bd66-2d3acf42aee8","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfuv3Na5kx85RwAshVCwL","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a90f338e-3705-4bce-97ed-85f79e6d771c","timestamp":"2026-10-11T05:41:59.885Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
