{"parentUuid":"c939adab-9374-49d8-bf2a-ebf95eab5065","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfuvg9RqLei4hH8htJZ6m","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"There are no separate manual rows now. Instead, I marked the most relevant automated rows \"test + manual\", with the by-hand check written into the expected result:\n\n- **C1, the full article (C1):** run a real article locally through the tunnel and listen: it reaches ready, the audio is the article, the descriptions are heard, and no markup leaks.\n- **C1, new domain (C7):** a real article from a domain with no recipe authors one and reaches ready.\n- **C1, not an article (C9):** enqueue a site's home page and watch it fail with the not-an-article verdict.\n\nYou said this on C1, and it's the same thing you asked for on B1, so I applied it to api/ as well. Tell me if you wanted it on C1 only:\n\n- **D1 enqueue:** on the deployed API, the item goes from queued to generating to ready.\n- **D6 poll a ready item:** after `migrate:local` on a fresh local state folder, the row reads back with every column. This replaces the separate migrations check.\n- **D15 retry:** on the deployed API, a retried failed item reaches ready.\n- **D23 audio:** the signed URL plays and seeks in a browser audio element.\n\nThe trees are now A1–A17, B1–B9, C1–C28 and D1–D27, and orange rows are the ones also run by hand. The canvas and `test-design/nagara.md` are updated."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1868,"cache_read_input_tokens":425725,"output_tokens":474,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":27},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1868,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":474,"cache_re