um"}
{"parentUuid":"499d9eab-3b7f-425c-911e-a39ed6868524","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"575305f9-8090-45cc-a43d-85b00eaf756a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EQ71ffpW6HioPuQnNekinB","type":"tool_result","content":"# Tasks\n\nThe tracker, the tools that reach it, and the task states are declared in `implement.md`.\n\n- Ground every task in the docs: its description cites the notes that carry its design by path. A note never links back to an issue; the issue closes and the link rots.\n- A `Spike` task is throwaway code written to answer a question; it never merges.\n- Implementation tasks under one feature land on its `feat/<feature-name>` branch, one branch per feature.\n# Implement\n\nTask tracker: **Linear**, workspace `asermax`, team Asermax (key `ASE`), project **nagara**.\n\nReached through the `linear-server` MCP tools: `save_issue` creates an issue (team, title, description, project, milestone, labels, priority) and updates one (`id` plus `title`, `description`, `state`, `labels`); `list_issues` reads them (filter by `project`); `save_comment` comments on an issue.\n\nStates a task moves through: `Backlog` (the default) → `Todo` (about to be worked) → `In Progress` (started) → `Done` (implemented, tested and committed). A task a settled design retires is set `Canceled` with a comment naming the note that supersedes it, never deleted silently.\n\nPriorities: 2 High, 3 Medium, 4 Low. Labels: `Bug`, `Feature`, `Improvement`, `Spike`. A milestone is a feature; an issue is one task under it, or a loose task with no milestone.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e2ad3031-b627-4966-a8ac-06df4c6f8755","timestamp":"2026-10-11T05:58:59.489Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"# Tasks\n\nThe tracker, the tools that reach it, and the task states are declared in `implement.md`.\n\n- Ground every task in the docs: its description cites the notes that carry its design by path. A note never links back to an issue; the issue closes and the link rots.\n- A `Spike` task is throwaway code written to answer a question; it never merges.\n- Implementation tasks under one feature land on its `feat/<feature-name>` branch, one branch per feature.\n# Implement\n\nTask tracker: **Linear**, workspace `asermax`, team Asermax (key `ASE`), project **nagara**.\n\nReached through the `linear-server` MCP tools: `save_issue` creates an issue (team, title, description, project, milestone, labels, priority) and updates one (`id` plus `title`, `description`, `state`, `labels`); `list_issues` reads them (filter by `project`); `save_comment` comments on an issue.\n\nStates a task moves through: `Backlog` (the default) → `Todo` (about to be worked) → `In Progress` (started) → `Done` (implemented, tested and committed). A task a settled design retires is set `Canceled` with a comment naming the note that supersedes it, never deleted silently.\n\nPriorities: 2 High, 3 Medium, 4 Low. Labels: `Bug`, `Feature`, `Improvement`, `Spike`. A milestone is a feature; an issue is one task under it, or a loose task with no milestone.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"3887aa0e-6742-431e-87a1-f0c876c6ad36","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","root":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","branch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"filadd/cc-plugin-marketplace","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/