{"parentUuid":"8840e6ae-c3b2-4de6-a52a-1568bf88b9ce","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuwS9uqPGT1tQM3KrXtg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NRKKRncUfywVBRFMAiJK6h","name":"mcp__linear-server__save_issue","input":{"team":"ASE","project":"nagara","milestone":"Cloudflare migration","title":"Workspace and the common/ package","labels":["Feature"],"priority":2,"description":"Create the root pnpm workspace (one lockfile for `common/`, `api/`, `pipeline/`; `pipeline/`'s own lockfile and workspace file go, their allowBuilds and overrides move to the root) and the `@nagara/common` package, source only, imported by both Workers.\n\n`common/` holds:\n- the shared types: item row, unit union, degradations, statuses and the cost and unit constant maps, recipe version row, ledger row, `ItemWorkflowParams`, the `STEP` names\n- `restartPoint(current_step)`: lease for recipe and release, the step itself otherwise, every step when empty\n- the R2 key layout (`audioKey`, `imageKey`) and `presign` (GET or PUT, aws4fetch)\n- `readItem` and the two-form `writeStatus` (queued or generating clears the error; failed requires one)\n- `migrations/0001_initial.sql` and a `wrangler.jsonc` to apply it\n- the cassette replay library under the `./testing` export (msw handlers, vcrpy matching and filters, unmatched requests fail)\n\nNotes: `docs/technical-design/common-package.md`, `docs/technical-design/persistence-and-storage.md`, `docs/technical-design/item-lifecycle.md` (the step wrapper's status write).\n\nTest rows A1–A17 from the test design (presign, writeStatus, readItem, restartPoint, replayCassettes).\n\nBranch: `feat/cloudflare-migration`."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2878,"cache_read_input_tokens":469759,"output_tokens":845,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_toke