{"parentUuid":"60cdf397-35cf-4164-bfc5-80b48eb87132","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14999117 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"fda83024-96ee-40f2-9ff0-cfbd7aa0e4bf","timestamp":"2026-10-11T06:00:21.707Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14999117 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"fda83024-96ee-40f2-9ff0-cfbd7aa0e4bf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuwT8exkWYyPn3FB1WwL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DdmVqdXPw992amQYbfjobZ","name":"mcp__linear-server__save_issue","input":{"team":"ASE","project":"nagara","milestone":"Cloudflare migration","title":"tts/: start and result web endpoints","labels":["Feature"],"priority":2,"description":"Give the Modal app two web endpoints behind Modal's proxy auth, on a CPU web function in the same app:\n\n- **start** (POST): paragraphs, voice (default `af_heart`), destination (a presigned PUT URL). Spawns `Kokoro.synthesize` and answers `{call_id}` at once.\n- **result** (GET `?call_id=`): `202` while running; `200` with format, duration, timings once done; `500` when the synthesis raised; `410` once Modal no longer holds the result; `422` for an id Modal never issued or one that is not a call id.\n\n`synthesize` gains `destination`, PUTs the encoded audio there with its content type, and returns the result without audio bytes. Request and response shapes are pydantic models.\n\nNotes: `docs/technical-design/tts-service.md`, `docs/technical-design/read-along-timing.md`.\n\nTest rows B1–B10 from the test design; B1 is also run by hand against the deployed app with a presigned R2 URL.\n\nBranch: `feat/cloudflare-migration`."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1884,"cache_read_input_tokens":472637,"output_tokens":5866,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1884,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":5866,"cache_read_input_tokens":472637,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1