omic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"a04d2791-6ab0-4a19-8468-c7079737a42c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuwT8exkWYyPn3FB1WwL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VJLYHxi8cPaLqEZccVv818","name":"mcp__linear-server__save_issue","input":{"team":"ASE","project":"nagara","milestone":"Cloudflare migration","title":"pipeline/: start synthesis, wait for synthesis, store","labels":["Feature"],"priority":2,"description":"The last three steps of the item Workflow:\n\n- start synthesis: sign a PUT URL for the item's audio key against `R2_S3_ENDPOINT`, hand Modal the URL with `R2_UPLOAD_ENDPOINT` in its place, the spoken forms and the voice; the call id as the step result\n- wait for synthesis: one step asking the result endpoint every `pollIntervalSeconds` (5 s) until ready, 15 minutes per attempt; `500` fails the attempt, `410` and `422` fail the item at once\n- store: join the timings onto the units (a length mismatch fails the item, invariant 2) and write ready, timed units, duration, format, the tts ledger row and `current_step` null in one batch\n\nThe whole-run rows of the item Workflow land here, once every step exists.\n\nNotes: `docs/technical-design/tts-service.md`, `docs/technical-design/item-lifecycle.md`, `docs/technical-design/read-along-timing.md`.\n\nTest rows C1 and C15–C21 from the test design (C1 is the full article run); C1 and C5 are also run by hand.\n\nBranch: `feat/cloudflare-migration`."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1884,"cache_read_input_tokens":472637,"output_tokens":5866,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1884,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2