f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"5cddae7f-f030-4a23-9b81-867c83ee74e2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuwT8exkWYyPn3FB1WwL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017hESScDdY9yVHGWMJ2urgE","name":"mcp__linear-server__save_issue","input":{"team":"ASE","project":"nagara","milestone":"Cloudflare migration","title":"api/: the TypeScript API Worker","labels":["Feature"],"priority":2,"description":"Replace the Python `api/` tree with a TypeScript Worker (`nagara-api`) serving the same routes and item JSON:\n\n- the `X-API-Key` guard ahead of every `/items` route; `/health` open\n- `POST /items`: the queued row, then `ITEM_WORKFLOW.create({itemId})`; a create that throws writes the item failed with its error\n- `GET /items/{id}`: the wire projection (units only once ready, no spoken, `audio_url`); an item queued over 15 minutes is claimed with one conditional write, then restarted from `restartPoint(current_step)` or created; the re-queue does not count toward retries\n- `POST /items/{id}/retry`: the conditional claim (failed, under 3), restart from `restartPoint(current_step)`, or create when the row has no instance id\n- audio and image routes: 307 to a GET URL signed for one hour\n- the tests' stand-in for the Workflow binding\n\nThe Python app, its migrations and Railway config are deleted; the cassettes move to `pipeline/test/cassettes/`.\n\nNotes: `docs/technical-design/item-contract.md`, `docs/technical-design/authentication.md`, `docs/technical-design/item-lifecycle.md`, `docs/technical-design/persistence-and-storage.md`.\n\nTest rows D1–D27 from the test design; D1, D4, D5, D13, D16, D20, D21 and D25 are also run by hand.\n\nBranch: `feat/cloudflare-migration`."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1884,"cache_read_input_tokens":472637,"output_tokens":5866,"output_tokens_det