"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01LKftyiGxxsuTK17d5LsKrA":{"team":"ASE","project":"nagara","milestone":"Cloudflare migration","title":"Switch nagara over to Cloudflare and retire Railway","labels":["Improvement"],"priority":2,"description":"Bring the migrated stack up in production and remove what it replaces:\n\n- create the production D1 database, R2 bucket and the two R2 API tokens (GET for the API, PUT for the pipeline); set each Worker's secrets\n- deploy (migrations, pipeline, API) and point `nagara.asermax.com` at the API Worker\n- remove the Cloudflare Access application and its service token from the pipeline\n- run every \"test + manual\" row of the test design by hand against the deployed system\n- delete the Railway API service, Postgres and bucket; nothing is copied over\n\nNotes: `docs/technical-design/deployment-and-ci.md`, `docs/technical-design/authentication.md`, `docs/technical-design/persistence-and-storage.md`.\n\nBranch: `feat/cloudflare-migration`."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"a8661d95-feda-4eae-a12a-324a6fd99f6c","apiBlockIndex":9,"requestId":"req_011CfuwT8BRxMziRW9fuBjht","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"linear-server","attributionMcpTool":"save_issue","type":"assistant","uuid":"fe21905c-631f-4465-adc6-093ec7af5d57","timestamp":"2026-10-11T06:01:05.255Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
