{"parentUuid":"a7c6a997-73a4-4153-9a17-209a03c4a070","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b2c85a7b-e8f0-4973-a4f1-8014af2a18de","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017hESScDdY9yVHGWMJ2urgE","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"ASE-80\",\"uuid\":\"92db227e-9fbf-4866-9bd9-add561fd12c0\",\"title\":\"api/: the TypeScript API Worker\",\"description\":\"Replace the Python `api/` tree with a TypeScript Worker (`nagara-api`) serving the same routes and item JSON:\\n\\n* the `X-API-Key` guard ahead of every `/items` route; `/health` open\\n* `POST /items`: the queued row, then `ITEM_WORKFLOW.create({itemId})`; a create that throws writes the item failed with its error\\n* `GET /items/{id}`: the wire projection (units only once ready, no spoken, `audio_url`); an item queued over 15 minutes is claimed with one conditional write, then restarted from `restartPoint(current_step)` or created; the re-queue does not count toward retries\\n* `POST /items/{id}/retry`: the conditional claim (failed, under 3), restart from `restartPoint(current_step)`, or create when the row has no instance id\\n* audio and image routes: 307 to a GET URL signed for one hour\\n* the tests' stand-in for the Workflow binding\\n\\nThe Python app, its migrations and Railway config are deleted; the cassettes move to `pipeline/test/cassettes/`.\\n\\nNotes: `docs/technical-design/item-contract.md`, `docs/technical-design/authentication.md`, `docs/technical-design/item-lifecycle.md`, `docs/technical-design/persistence-and-storage.md`.\\n\\nTest rows D1–D27 from the test design; D1, D4, D5, D13, D16, D20, D21 and D25 are also run by hand.\\n\\nBranch: `feat/cloudflare-migration`.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"1f715c70-f21d-466d-92a3-ef263db6955e\",\"name\":\"Cloudflare migration\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/asermax/issue/ASE-80/api-the-typescript-api-worker\",\"gitBranchName\":\"asermax/ase-80-api-the-typescript-api-worker\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:33.221Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:33.221Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"Feature\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Agustin Carrasco\",\"createdById\":\"c8b03f1c-0b66-413e-85b8-f11067346ca8\",\"project\":\"nagara\",\"projectId\":\"14d108e2-6712-4129-b37d-e021d5aa2f0b\",\"team\":\"Asermax\",\"teamId\":\"c821b24b-23d9-403e-9038-23d9024a2110\"}"}]}]},"uuid":"407838b5-1698-4d43-8e7a-ef3569be7639","timestamp":"2026-10-11T06:01:35.903Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"ASE-80\",\"uuid\":\"92db227e-9fbf-4866-9bd9-add561fd12c0\",\"title\":\"api/: the TypeScript API Worker\",\"description\":\"Replace the Python `api/` tree with a TypeScript Worker (`nagara-api`) serving the same routes and item JSON:\\n\\n* the `X-API-Key` guard ahead of every `/items` route; `/health` open\\n* `POST /items`: the queued row, then `ITEM_WORKFLOW.create({itemId})`; a create that throws writes the item failed with its error\\n* `GET /items/{id}`: the wire projection (units only once ready, no spoken, `audio_url`); an item queued over 15 minutes is claimed with one conditional write, then restarted from `restartPoint(current_step)` or created; the re-queue does not count toward retries\\n* `POST /items/{id}/retry`: the conditional claim (failed, under 3), restart from `restartPoint(current_step)`, or create when the row has no instance id\\n* audio and image routes: 307 to a GET URL signed for one hour\\n* the tests' stand-in for the Workflow binding\\n\\nThe Python app, its migrations and Railway config are deleted; the cassettes move to `pipeline/test/cassettes/`.\\n\\nNotes: `docs/technical-design/item-contract.md`, `docs/technical-design/authentication.md`, `docs/technical-design/item-lifecycle.md`, `docs/technical-design/persistence-and-storage.md`.\\n\\nTest rows D1–D27 from the test design; D1, D4, D5, D13, D16, D20, D21 and D25 are also run by hand.\\n\\nBranch: `feat/cloudflare-migration`.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"1f715c70-f21d-466d-92a3-ef263db6955e\",\"name\":\"Cloudflare migration\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/asermax/issue/ASE-80/api-the-typescript-api-worker\",\"gitBranchName\":\"asermax/ase-80-api-the-typescript-api-worker\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:33.221Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:33.221Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"Feature\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Agustin Carrasco\",\"createdById\":\"c8b03f1c-0b66-413e-85b8-f11067346ca8\",\"project\":\"nagara\",\"projectId\":\"14d108e2-6712-4129-b37d-e021d5aa2f0b\",\"team\":\"Asermax\",\"teamId\":\"c821b24b-23d9-403e-9038-23d9024a2110\"}"}],"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"a8661d95-feda-4eae-a12a-324a6fd99f6c","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","root":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","branch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"filadd/cc-plugin-marketplace","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","platform":"linux"}},"mcpMeta":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}],"version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app"}}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a7c6a997-73a4-4153-9a17-209a03c4a070","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"983d3fdb-c846-4593-8542-ba517b8db75d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b2c85a7b-e8f0-4973-a4f1-8014af2a18de","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01H52yBR3wSw8EscKXtj3789","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"ASE-81\",\"uuid\":\"ced8b27b-fe8f-41cf-b1c0-69f4d77999aa\",\"title\":\"Local development setup for both Workers\",\"description\":\"Make both Workers run together locally, as `docs/technical-design/local-development.md` describes:\\n\\n* the shared state folder `.wrangler-state/` at the repository root (git-ignored): `persistState` in `pipeline/vite.config.ts`, `--persist-to` in `api/`'s dev script\\n* `pnpm migrate:local` in `common/`\\n* `pipeline/scripts/tunnel-proxy.mjs` (`/s3/<bucket>/<key>` to `/cdn-cgi/local/r2/s3/...` with localhost as host) and `pnpm dev:proxy`\\n* the experimental local S3 credentials in the Vite config, and `pipeline/.dev.vars.example` with `R2_S3_ENDPOINT` and `R2_UPLOAD_ENDPOINT`\\n\\nNotes: `docs/technical-design/local-development.md`.\\n\\nChecked by the manual parts of C1, D4 and D5 from the test design.\\n\\nBranch: `feat/cloudflare-migration`.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"1f715c70-f21d-466d-92a3-ef263db6955e\",\"name\":\"Cloudflare migration\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":3,\"name\":\"Medium\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/asermax/issue/ASE-81/local-development-setup-for-both-workers\",\"gitBranchName\":\"asermax/ase-81-local-development-setup-for-both-workers\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:37.780Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:37.780Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"Improvement\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Agustin Carrasco\",\"createdById\":\"c8b03f1c-0b66-413e-85b8-f11067346ca8\",\"project\":\"nagara\",\"projectId\":\"14d108e2-6712-4129-b37d-e021d5aa2f0b\",\"team\":\"Asermax\",\"teamId\":\"c821b24b-23d9-403e-9038-23d9024a2110\"}"}]}]},"uuid":"1ae32f42-f801-4a3b-b855-7dec97376187","timestamp":"2026-10-11T06:01:38.944Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"ASE-81\",\"uuid\":\"ced8b27b-fe8f-41cf-b1c0-69f4d77999aa\",\"title\":\"Local development setup for both Workers\",\"description\":\"Make both Workers run together locally, as `docs/technical-design/local-development.md` describes:\\n\\n* the shared state folder `.wrangler-state/` at the repository root (git-ignored): `persistState` in `pipeline/vite.config.ts`, `--persist-to` in `api/`'s dev script\\n* `pnpm migrate:local` in `common/`\\n* `pipeline/scripts/tunnel-proxy.mjs` (`/s3/<bucket>/<key>` to `/cdn-cgi/local/r2/s3/...` with localhost as host) and `pnpm dev:proxy`\\n* the experimental local S3 credentials in the Vite config, and `pipeline/.dev.vars.example` with `R2_S3_ENDPOINT` and `R2_UPLOAD_ENDPOINT`\\n\\nNotes: `docs/technical-design/local-development.md`.\\n\\nChecked by the manual parts of C1, D4 and D5 from the test design.\\n\\nBranch: `feat/cloudflare-migration`.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"1f715c70-f21d-466d-92a3-ef263db6955e\",\"name\":\"Cloudflare migration\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":3,\"name\":\"Medium\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/asermax/issue/ASE-81/local-development-setup-for-both-workers\",\"gitBranchName\":\"asermax/ase-81-local-development-setup-for-both-workers\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:37.780Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:37.780Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"Improvement\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Agustin Carrasco\",\"createdById\":\"c8b03f1c-0b66-413e-85b8-f11067346ca8\",\"project\":\"nagara\",\"projectId\":\"14d108e2-6712-4129-b37d-e021d5aa2f0b\",\"team\":\"Asermax\",\"teamId\":\"c821b24b-23d9-403e-9038-23d9024a2110\"}"}],"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"a8661d95-feda-4eae-a12a-324a6fd99f6c","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","root":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","branch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"filadd/cc-plugin-marketplace","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","platform":"linux"}},"mcpMeta":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}],"version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app"}}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"983d3fdb-c846-4593-8542-ba517b8db75d","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"640b50fa-1faa-4dca-a6e5-5e6ad72fa971","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b2c85a7b-e8f0-4973-a4f1-8014af2a18de","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NUUCMabNeCMVz55xNZWmeY","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"ASE-82\",\"uuid\":\"a069d39a-255c-40cc-b2c0-2433ed1e02c2\",\"title\":\"CI: one Cloudflare workflow for common, pipeline and api\",\"description\":\"Replace `.github/workflows/api.yml` and `pipeline.yml` with one `cloudflare.yml`:\\n\\n* a paths filter decides which of `common/`, `pipeline/` and `api/` changed; each changed tree runs test, lint and types; a change to `common/` also runs both Workers' type checks\\n* the deploy chain: migrate (`wrangler d1 migrations apply --remote`), then the pipeline (`pnpm build`, deploy `dist/nagara/wrangler.json`), then the API\\n* a job runs only when no job before it failed; a skipped job does not stop the ones after it\\n* `tts.yml` stays as it is\\n\\nNotes: `docs/technical-design/deployment-and-ci.md`.\\n\\nBranch: `feat/cloudflare-migration`.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"1f715c70-f21d-466d-92a3-ef263db6955e\",\"name\":\"Cloudflare migration\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":3,\"name\":\"Medium\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/asermax/issue/ASE-82/ci-one-cloudflare-workflow-for-common-pipeline-and-api\",\"gitBranchName\":\"asermax/ase-82-ci-one-cloudflare-workflow-for-common-pipeline-and-api\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:42.958Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:42.958Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"Improvement\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Agustin Carrasco\",\"createdById\":\"c8b03f1c-0b66-413e-85b8-f11067346ca8\",\"project\":\"nagara\",\"projectId\":\"14d108e2-6712-4129-b37d-e021d5aa2f0b\",\"team\":\"Asermax\",\"teamId\":\"c821b24b-23d9-403e-9038-23d9024a2110\"}"}]}]},"uuid":"17412cfb-11d6-464d-a16a-5ff2ecf846d5","timestamp":"2026-10-11T06:01:45.195Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"ASE-82\",\"uuid\":\"a069d39a-255c-40cc-b2c0-2433ed1e02c2\",\"title\":\"CI: one Cloudflare workflow for common, pipeline and api\",\"description\":\"Replace `.github/workflows/api.yml` and `pipeline.yml` with one `cloudflare.yml`:\\n\\n* a paths filter decides which of `common/`, `pipeline/` and `api/` changed; each changed tree runs test, lint and types; a change to `common/` also runs both Workers' type checks\\n* the deploy chain: migrate (`wrangler d1 migrations apply --remote`), then the pipeline (`pnpm build`, deploy `dist/nagara/wrangler.json`), then the API\\n* a job runs only when no job before it failed; a skipped job does not stop the ones after it\\n* `tts.yml` stays as it is\\n\\nNotes: `docs/technical-design/deployment-and-ci.md`.\\n\\nBranch: `feat/cloudflare-migration`.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"1f715c70-f21d-466d-92a3-ef263db6955e\",\"name\":\"Cloudflare migration\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":3,\"name\":\"Medium\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/asermax/issue/ASE-82/ci-one-cloudflare-workflow-for-common-pipeline-and-api\",\"gitBranchName\":\"asermax/ase-82-ci-one-cloudflare-workflow-for-common-pipeline-and-api\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:42.958Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:42.958Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"Improvement\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Agustin Carrasco\",\"createdById\":\"c8b03f1c-0b66-413e-85b8-f11067346ca8\",\"project\":\"nagara\",\"projectId\":\"14d108e2-6712-4129-b37d-e021d5aa2f0b\",\"team\":\"Asermax\",\"teamId\":\"c821b24b-23d9-403e-9038-23d9024a2110\"}"}],"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"a8661d95-feda-4eae-a12a-324a6fd99f6c","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","root":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","branch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"filadd/cc-plugin-marketplace","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","platform":"linux"}},"mcpMeta":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}],"version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app"}}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"640b50fa-1faa-4dca-a6e5-5e6ad72fa971","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"fe21905c-631f-4465-adc6-093ec7af5d57","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b2c85a7b-e8f0-4973-a4f1-8014af2a18de","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LKftyiGxxsuTK17d5LsKrA","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"ASE-83\",\"uuid\":\"88a75223-8f1b-4fdd-bc3a-206276da0f5f\",\"title\":\"Switch nagara over to Cloudflare and retire Railway\",\"description\":\"Bring the migrated stack up in production and remove what it replaces:\\n\\n* create the production D1 database, R2 bucket and the two R2 API tokens (GET for the API, PUT for the pipeline); set each Worker's secrets\\n* deploy (migrations, pipeline, API) and point `nagara.asermax.com` at the API Worker\\n* remove the Cloudflare Access application and its service token from the pipeline\\n* run every \\\"test + manual\\\" row of the test design by hand against the deployed system\\n* delete the Railway API service, Postgres and bucket; nothing is copied over\\n\\nNotes: `docs/technical-design/deployment-and-ci.md`, `docs/technical-design/authentication.md`, `docs/technical-design/persistence-and-storage.md`.\\n\\nBranch: `feat/cloudflare-migration`.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"1f715c70-f21d-466d-92a3-ef263db6955e\",\"name\":\"Cloudflare migration\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/asermax/issue/ASE-83/switch-nagara-over-to-cloudflare-and-retire-railway\",\"gitBranchName\":\"asermax/ase-83-switch-nagara-over-to-cloudflare-and-retire-railway\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:48.076Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:48.076Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"Improvement\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Agustin Carrasco\",\"createdById\":\"c8b03f1c-0b66-413e-85b8-f11067346ca8\",\"project\":\"nagara\",\"projectId\":\"14d108e2-6712-4129-b37d-e021d5aa2f0b\",\"team\":\"Asermax\",\"teamId\":\"c821b24b-23d9-403e-9038-23d9024a2110\"}"}]}]},"uuid":"346b85a3-ce37-46b2-9966-fd09d493a359","timestamp":"2026-10-11T06:01:48.849Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"ASE-83\",\"uuid\":\"88a75223-8f1b-4fdd-bc3a-206276da0f5f\",\"title\":\"Switch nagara over to Cloudflare and retire Railway\",\"description\":\"Bring the migrated stack up in production and remove what it replaces:\\n\\n* create the production D1 database, R2 bucket and the two R2 API tokens (GET for the API, PUT for the pipeline); set each Worker's secrets\\n* deploy (migrations, pipeline, API) and point `nagara.asermax.com` at the API Worker\\n* remove the Cloudflare Access application and its service token from the pipeline\\n* run every \\\"test + manual\\\" row of the test design by hand against the deployed system\\n* delete the Railway API service, Postgres and bucket; nothing is copied over\\n\\nNotes: `docs/technical-design/deployment-and-ci.md`, `docs/technical-design/authentication.md`, `docs/technical-design/persistence-and-storage.md`.\\n\\nBranch: `feat/cloudflare-migration`.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"1f715c70-f21d-466d-92a3-ef263db6955e\",\"name\":\"Cloudflare migration\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/asermax/issue/ASE-83/switch-nagara-over-to-cloudflare-and-retire-railway\",\"gitBranchName\":\"asermax/ase-83-switch-nagara-over-to-cloudflare-and-retire-railway\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:48.076Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:48.076Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"Improvement\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Agustin Carrasco\",\"createdById\":\"