ew: \"Pick the manual checks from the test rows: a picked row's kind becomes `test + manual`, and its expected outcome adds what the check observes by hand. On a service they always include the most common flows and the most common error cases. A row is `manual` alone only when no automated test can check it. Schema rejections are not manual picks.\"\n\n## 6. Mermaid: no crossing edges\n\nLands in `superpowers/skills/mermaid/references/flowchart.md`, appended to \"Styling guidance\":\n\n```markdown\n- **No two edges cross.** When the layout makes edges cross, reorder the nodes or restructure the diagram until none do.\n```\n\n## 7. Canvas: delete the arrows of deleted shapes\n\nLands in `mahou/skills/canvas/SKILL.md`, \"Drawing\":\n\n```markdown\n- **Delete the arrows of the shapes you delete.** An arrow bound to a deleted shape stays on the canvas where it was drawn. After deleting shapes, delete every arrow with fewer than two bindings.\n```","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"33fe96c1-92b3-4a78-9071-149ce404acd0","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","root":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","branch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"filadd/cc-plugin-marketplace","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","platform":"linux"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fc626576-7a56-4fba-bc8f-06924bcd733b