a red terminal with its status, and a success a green one. A failure that the entry handles without refusing the request is a dotted edge labelled with the error. Two entries that share their parts may share one shape.\n\nUnder the shape, one or two lines stating the rule the flowchart implements.\n\n\n# Module list on the canvas\n\n`program-design`'s module list reference still says what the part covers, what to read before proposing it and when it fits. The record keeps the paths.\n\n## Representation\n\nOne `mermaid` shape holding a flowchart with three subgraphs: deleted, touched and new. Each node is a file or a set of files in one folder, labelled with the path and, with the reason the file changes, when the path does not make the reason clear. New nodes are green, touched amber and deleted red.\n\nUnder the shape, one or two lines on the placement decisions.\n\n\n# Standards on the canvas\n\n`program-design`'s standards reference still says what the part covers, what to read before proposing it and when it fits. The record keeps the list.\n\n## Representation\n\nOne `mermaid` shape holding a flowchart: each source of conventions is a document node, joined to a node listing the parts of the change it governs in this root.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"aca5c806-67e8-44c6-a933-176d394815bb","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","root":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","branch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"