{"parentUuid":"14511902-43de-4b82-a28f-5168fa753c9a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuyC28MmR7n1bfC7xRP6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've written item 4 as well, so all the items you kept are now in claude-plugins:\n\n- Five new canvas references in `program-design-with-canvas/references/representations/`: `package-layout.md`, `interfaces.md`, `callstack.md`, `module-list.md` and `standards.md`.\n- Their five rows in that skill's table.\n\nI also updated program design's description on the mahou README with-canvas line, which you haven't seen yet. It now says a screen's parts come from bundled mockups and a service's parts are drawn as mermaid diagrams.\n\nThe base program-design representations are unchanged. Nothing is committed. The changes sit with the earlier learn round's uncommitted work in claude-plugins."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":488,"cache_read_input_tokens":553588,"output_tokens":231,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":488,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":231,"cache_read_input_tokens":553588,"cache_creation_input_tokens":488,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":488},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"beaaf7af-d6c7-49df-9377-a1b80b134cf8","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfuyC1h4pNstnBL1LkJTJ","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"55efbc11-a062-4c14-8c64-0e1ffd3a1964","timestamp":"2026-10-11T06:23:15.091Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort"