{"parentUuid":"393848df-70ef-4ecf-931c-d288574c6aa7","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"auto_mode","autoModeConsentFlow":false,"bashFirst":true,"bashFirstSteer":"relaxed","steerOnly":true,"bypass":false},"type":"attachment","uuid":"5f085049-a9ad-44f9-9dcb-87655b0feaaf","timestamp":"2026-10-11T06:26:33.441Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nWhile auto mode is active:\n\nYou can do much of your work through the Bash tool when it is the simpler route: read files with cat, head, or sed -n, search with grep and find, and make small, mechanical file changes with sed, heredocs, or short scripts instead of the dedicated Read, Edit, or Write tools. The choice is yours: prefer Edit or Write when a shell edit would be fragile, such as exact or multi-line replacements, or sed/awk flags that differ between GNU and BSD/macOS.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
