{"parentUuid":"4fd40b23-e7f0-4842-864b-59ec4088e86b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fa24657c-a4b7-4b9d-9c50-2e639d9c0f75","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014cKbX29Ufat9iSGvQtJ7VM","type":"tool_result","content":"# Implement\n\nTask tracker: **Linear**, workspace `asermax`, team Asermax (key `ASE`), project **nagara**.\n\nReached through the `linear-server` MCP tools: `save_issue` creates an issue (team, title, description, project, milestone, labels, priority) and updates one (`id` plus `title`, `description`, `state`, `labels`); `list_issues` reads them (filter by `project`); `save_comment` comments on an issue.\n\nStates a task moves through: `Backlog` (the default) → `Todo` (about to be worked) → `In Progress` (started) → `Done` (implemented, tested and committed). A task a settled design retires is set `Canceled` with a comment naming the note that supersedes it, never deleted silently.\n\nPriorities: 2 High, 3 Medium, 4 Low. Labels: `Bug`, `Feature`, `Improvement`, `Spike`. A milestone is a feature; an issue is one task under it, or a loose task with no milestone.\n---\nbasics.md\nimplement.md\nspike.md\ntasks.md\nwiki\n---\n# Status\n\n- **Stage**: design recorded in `docs/`, committed on branch `feat/cloudflare-migration` (not pushed). Program design settled and recorded in docs (commit 4930ea1). Tasks created in Linear (ASE-73 to ASE-83). Next: mahou:implement.\n\n## Links\n\n- Linear: milestone \"Cloudflare migration\", project nagara; tasks ASE-73 to ASE-83, in run order. ASE-28 and ASE-29 canceled as superseded.\n- Docs: commits c0dbdba, 4930ea1, fdc0c1a on `feat/cloudflare-migration`.\n\n## Local artifacts\n\n- `README.md`: folder index, spike table, credentials to delete by hand.\n- `shape.md`: the settled shape tree.\n- `design.md`: the design tree and each branch's prose and diagrams.\n- `recording-decisions.md`: decisions made while recording the docs, which amend design.md.\n- `docs-drafts/`: the drafts the docs were written from.\n- `docs-impact.md`: the docs-scout's list of notes the migration touched.\n- `canvas/design.tldr.json`: the design canvas, drawn from `design.md`.\n- `canvas/current-system.tldr.json`, `canvas/cloudflare-options.tldr.json`: exploration drawings.\n- `spikes/`: spike code and findings; `spikes/REPORT.md` is the combined report of the first nine; `spikes/restart-resolve/` measured when `restart()` resolves.\n- `program-design/nagara.md`: the program design record, every part proposed.\n- `program-design/canvas.md`: the diagrams the program design canvas draws.\n- `test-design/nagara.md`: the test trees and their matrices.\n- `canvas/test-design.tldr.json`: the test design canvas.\n- `canvas/program-design.tldr.json`: the program design canvas, drawn from the record.\n- `briefs/`: briefs sent to scouts, researchers and spikes.\n- `learn/`: mahou:learn drafts, applied.\n\n## Tracking\n\n- Implementation tasks from the test design: listed at the end of `test-design/nagara.md`.\n\n- Delete the Modal proxy auth token and revoke the R2 API tokens from the spikes (see `README.md`, \"Still to delete by hand\").\n---\n  backup/polish-extraction-pre-rewrite\n* feat/cloudflare-migration\n  feat/polish-extraction\n  idea/read-along-player\n  main\n  remotes/origin/HEAD -> origin/main\n  remotes/origin/idea/read-along-player\n  remotes/origin/main\napi\nCLAUDE.md\ndocs\npipeline\nREADME.md\ntts","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"9a69d66c-a5f8-4f9b-8f6b-697ae02071c7","timestamp":"2026-10-11T06:32:01.941Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"# Implement\n\nTask tracker: **Linear**, workspace `asermax`, team Asermax (key `ASE`), project **nagara**.\n\nReached through the `linear-server` MCP tools: `save_issue` creates an issue (team, title, description, project, milestone, labels, priority) and updates one (`id` plus `title`, `description`, `state`, `labels`); `list_issues` reads them (filter by `project`); `save_comment` comments on an issue.\n\nStates a task moves through: `Backlog` (the default) → `Todo` (about to be worked) → `In Progress` (started) → `Done` (implemented, tested and committed). A task a settled design retires is set `Canceled` with a comment naming the note that supersedes it, never deleted silently.\n\nPriorities: 2 High, 3 Medium, 4 Low. Labels: `Bug`, `Feature`, `Improvement`, `Spike`. A milestone is a feature; an issue is one task under it, or a loose task with no milestone.\n---\nbasics.md\nimplement.md\nspike.md\ntasks.md\nwiki\n---\n# Status\n\n- **Stage**: design recorded in `docs/`, committed on branch `feat/cloudflare-migration` (not pushed). Program design settled and recorded in docs (commit 4930ea1). Tasks created in Linear (ASE-73 to ASE-83). Next: mahou:implement.\n\n## Links\n\n- Linear: milestone \"Cloudflare migration\", project nagara; tasks ASE-73 to ASE-83, in run order. ASE-28 and ASE-29 canceled as superseded.\n- Docs: commits c0dbdba, 4930ea1, fdc0c1a on `feat/cloudflare-migration`.\n\n## Local artifacts\n\n- `README.md`: folder index, spike table, credentials to delete by hand.\n- `shape.md`: the settled shape tree.\n- `design.md`: the design tree and each branch's prose and diagrams.\n- `recording-decisions.md`: decisions made while recording the docs, which amend design.md.\n- `docs-drafts/`: the drafts the docs were written from.\n- `docs-impact.md`: the docs-scout's list of notes the migration touched.\n- `canvas/design.tldr.json`: the design canvas, drawn from `design.md`.\n- `canvas/current-system.tldr.json`, `canvas/cloudflare-options.tldr.json`: exploration drawings.\n- `spikes/`: spike code and findings; `spikes/REPORT.md` is the combined report of the first nine; `spikes/restart-resolve/` measured when `restart()` resolves.\n- `program-design/nagara.md`: the program design record, every part proposed.\n- `program-design/canvas.md`: the diagrams the program design canvas draws.\n- `test-design/nagara.md`: the test trees and their matrices.\n- `canvas/test-design.tldr.json`: the test design canvas.\n- `canvas/program-design.tldr.json`: the program design canvas, drawn from the record.\n- `briefs/`: briefs sent to scouts, researchers and spikes.\n- `learn/`: mahou:learn drafts, applied.\n\n## Tracking\n\n- Implementation tasks from the test design: listed at the end of `test-design/nagara.md`.\n\n- Delete the Modal proxy auth token and revoke the R2 API tokens from the spikes (see `README.md`, \"Still to delete by hand\").\n---\n  backup/polish-extraction-pre-rewrite\n* feat/cloudflare-migration\n  feat/polish-extraction\n  idea/read-along-player\n  main\n  remotes/origin/HEAD -> origin/main\n  remotes/origin/idea/read-along-player\n  remotes/origin/main\napi\nCLAUDE.md\ndocs\npipeline\nREADME.md\ntts","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4fd40b23-e7f0-4842-864b-59ec4088e86b","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"subcommandResults"},"session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
