 describer per call, tts per second\" }, \"existing\": { \"description\": \"agentModel, agentMaxTurns, authoringRetries, revisionRetries, leaseAlarmMs, recipeCpuMs, maxHtmlBytes, CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID, CLOUDFLARE_GATEWAY_ID\" } } },\n.scratch/cloudflare-migration/program-design/nagara.md:467:    \"secrets\": { \"properties\": { \"FIRECRAWL_API_KEY\": {}, \"GEMINI_API_KEY\": {}, \"CLOUDFLARE_API_KEY\": { \"description\": \"The AI Gateway token, the name the agents already read.\" }, \"MODAL_PROXY_KEY\": {}, \"MODAL_PROXY_SECRET\": {}, \"R2_PUT_ACCESS_KEY_ID\": {}, \"R2_PUT_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY\": {} } }\n.scratch/cloudflare-migration/program-design/nagara.md:571:  \"title\": \"tts/app.py: start (POST, requires_proxy_auth)\",\n.scratch/cloudflare-migration/program-design/nagara.md:581:  \"title\": \"tts/app.py: result (GET ?call_id=, requires_proxy_auth)\",\n.scratch/cloudflare-migration/program-design/nagara.md:609:pipeline/scripts/tunnel-proxy.mjs        new       Node proxy: /s3/<bucket>/<key> to localhost /cdn-cgi/local/r2/s3/<bucket>/<key>, host rewritten\n.scratch/cloudflare-migration/program-design/nagara.md:610:pipeline/package.json                    touched   dev:proxy = node scripts/tunnel-proxy.mjs\n.scratch/cloudflare-migration/program-design/nagara.md:614:Launch: `pnpm --filter @nagara/common migrate:local`, then `pnpm dev` in `pipeline/`, `pnpm dev:proxy` in `pipeline/`, `cloudflared tunnel --url http://localhost:<proxy port>` by hand, the tunnel host into `.dev.vars`, and `pnpm dev` in `api/`. `cloudflared` is a tool on the developer's machine, not a dependency.\n.scratch/cloudflare-migration/program-design/nagara.md:657:- wiki cloudflare/r2 and cloudflare/local-dev: presigning with aws4fetch, the local S3 endpoint and the tunnel proxy\n.scratch/cloudflare-migration/program-design/nagara.md:661:- wiki modal: proxy-auth headers on web endpoints","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3d0772c1-ed88-461c-ba39-8a7ee23b771e","timestamp":"2026-10-11T06:32:16.639Z","toolUs