 and api subagents start from your commits. Commit as soon as the workspace and common/ are done and green.\nEOF\ncp implement-common.md implement-ASE-74.md; cat >> implement-ASE-74.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Your part: tts/ (ASE-74)\n\nTask: ASE-74 \"tts/: start and result web endpoints\". You work in a worktree on branch `feat/cloudflare-migration-tts`, forked from `feat/cloudflare-migration`. Touch only `tts/`.\n\n- The start (POST) and result (GET ?call_id=) web endpoints behind Modal proxy auth, on a CPU web function in the same app, as the program design and `docs/technical-design/tts-service.md` say: 202 running, 200 done, 500 raised, 410 expired, 422 for an invalid call id.\n- Your tests: tree B (B1 to B10) of the test design, with pytest.\n- You may run `uv run modal serve app.py` to check the endpoints answer as designed (an ephemeral copy; it does not touch the deployed `nagara-tts`). Stop it by its PID when done. Never `modal deploy`. The proxy token, once the user has written it, is in `/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/modal-proxy.env` (keys MODAL_PROXY_KEY, MODAL_PROXY_SECRET); never print it. If the file is not there yet, skip the live check and say so. A live synthesis check uses a short paragraph or two, nothing long.\n- In your report, include how to serve the dev copy and the start and result URLs `modal serve` printed, so the local pipeline can call them later.\nEOF\nH=/home/agus/.claude/plugins/cache/herdr-subagents/herdr-subagents/0.10.0/bin/herdr-helper\n$H spawn --kind claude --label \"impl: workspace + common (ASE-73)\" --model opus --body \"<supervisor-agent>Read and follow /home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/briefs/implement-ASE-73.md. It is your full brief.</supervisor-agent>\"\n$H spawn --kind claude --label \"impl: tts endpoints (ASE-74)\" --model opus --worktree --branch feat/cloudflare-migration-tts --base feat/cloudflare-migration --body \"<supervisor-agent>Read and follow /home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/briefs/implement-ASE-74.md. It is your full brief.</supervisor-agent>\"","description":"Write part briefs and spawn the common and tts subagents"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"ba94c7ce-c761-47ae-9fc7-dd850a5537c5","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfuz8vZnobcmmNDmXvBi9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionSkill":"mahou:implement","attributionPlugin":"mahou","type":"assistant","uuid":"f60f5888-a458-4fa9-a28e-f6cfea6449ca","timestamp":"2026-10-11T06:35:50.161Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
