{"parentUuid":"fc75b221-8e6b-420c-b698-8b7caf8cf80a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuzeaFzNeATjjX1sw1xw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The tts endpoints (ASE-74) are done and committed on `feat/cloudflare-migration-tts` as `d9f05bd`. pytest, ruff and ty all pass. The same subagent is now running the agentic review on that change.\n\n**Not checked yet:** no call with credentials and no real synthesis has run, because `modal-proxy.env` is still missing.\n\n**Where the tts code differs from or goes beyond the design** (none of these block the work; reply in the inbox to change any):\n- **Response fields:** the result drops `sample_rate` and each timing's `index` and `text`, since the program design returns only `{format, duration, timings[{start,end}]}`.\n- **Error bodies:** 410 and 422 answer `{error}`.\n- **Malformed call ids:** an id that doesn't start with `fc-` answers 422; without the check Modal would make it a 500.\n- **Timeouts:** a synthesis that runs out of time answers 500.\n- **GPU image:** it gets an extra layer for fastapi and httpx, which the design doesn't mention.\n\n**Dev copy for local runs:** `https://asermax--nagara-tts-web-dev.modal.run/{start,result}`, from `uv run modal serve app.py`.\n\n**Waiting on you:** the `common/` subagent (ASE-73) is still stuck on the `rm -rf` permission prompt."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1065,"cache_read_input_tokens":118137,"output_tokens":454,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1065,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":454,"cache_read_input_tokens":118137,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1065,"cache_creation