{"parentUuid":"22b700a7-597d-4119-b9c5-d0602aa3265c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuzvjQquSRMGNfjY8dEM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The workspace and `common/` (ASE-73) are committed on `feat/cloudflare-migration` as `ee21dae` and `624387d`.\n\n- **Checks:** `common/` passes 17 tests and the old `pipeline/` still passes 55 after the workspace move. Lint and types are clean in both.\n- **Placeholder D1 id:** all three wrangler configs use `00000000-…` as the D1 `database_id`, so both Workers share one local database. It has to be swapped for the real id when the production D1 is created tomorrow.\n- **Cassette misses:** a request the cassette doesn't hold comes back as a 500 instead of a thrown error. I've told the pipeline subagent to assert actual outputs in its tests, so a step that falls back after a 500 can't hide a miss.\n\n**Running now:**\n- the pipeline subagent, on ASE-75 to 79, in worktree `feat/cloudflare-migration-pipeline`\n- the API subagent, on ASE-80, in worktree `feat/cloudflare-migration-api`\n- the agentic review of `common/`\n- the agentic review of tts"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":538,"cache_read_input_tokens":129461,"output_tokens":370,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":538,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":370,"cache_read_input_tokens":129461,"cache_creation_input_tokens":538,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":538},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f552d719-911b