{"parentUuid":"edf62016-e67c-456e-b133-d74abba4dfff","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfv1azktvfLur7yoYDwbx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TiJM4HJsLeMGi9qvRQdZnm","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"H=/home/agus/.claude/plugins/cache/herdr-subagents/herdr-subagents/0.10.0/bin/herdr-helper; $H collect w30:p24 | python3 -c \"import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(d['status']); print(d.get('message',''))\"; cd /home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara; git log --oneline -4; git status --short","description":"Collect the common split result"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1698,"cache_read_input_tokens":144341,"output_tokens":212,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1698,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":212,"cache_read_input_tokens":144341,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1698,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1698},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01TiJM4HJsLeMGi9qvRQdZnm":{"command":"H=/home/agus/.claude/plugins/cache/herdr-subagents/herdr-subagents/0.10.0/bin/herdr-helper; $H collect w30:p24 | python3 -c \"import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(d['status']); print(d.get('message',''))\"; cd /home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara; git log --oneline -4; git status --short","description":"Collect the common split result"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"e48a3cc6-da4a-46e2-982c-dbd88763a19c","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfv1azQoxKPf1oRFzcnke","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"dd521c95-0b02-46ac-9b80-d73c1114978f","timestamp":"2026-10-11T06:54:38.313Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"dd521c95-0b02-46ac-9b80-d73c1114978f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e6e94b49-5d1f-4775-90e5-464723d48de0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TiJM4HJsLeMGi9qvRQdZnm","type":"tool_result","content":"done\nI committed the four review fixes and then split `row.ts` and `cassettes.ts` into one module per function. `@nagara/common` and `@nagara/common/testing` export exactly the same names as before, so nothing changes for the pipeline and api worktrees. Biome, tsc and vitest pass in both `common/` and `pipeline/`.\n\n## Commits\n\n| Hash | Subject |\n|---|---|\n| `349fe2d` | refactor(common): share the unit text fields and the key comparator |\n| `2cbc866` | refactor(common): one module per item-store function and cassette step |\n\n## New module list\n\n**`common/src/item-store/`** replaces `src/row.ts`:\n\n| Module | Holds |\n|---|---|\n| `json-column.ts` | `encodeJson` and `decodeJson`, the two halves of the JSON column codec |\n| `read-item.ts` | `readItem`, with the private stored-row type it decodes from |\n| `write-status.ts` | `writeStatus` and `StatusWrite` |\n\n`src/index.ts` re-exports these three files in place of `row.ts`.\n\n**`common/testing/`** replaces `testing/cassettes.ts`:\n\n| Module | Holds |\n|---|---|\n| `cassette.ts` | `RecordedInteraction` and `parseCassette` (the YAML to interactions step) |\n| `item-id.ts` | the `itm_` pattern and `normalizeIds` |\n| `sort-keys.ts` | `byKey` and `sortKeys` (`byKey` is the comparator `sortKeys` uses) |\n| `canonical-body.ts` | `canonicalBody`, which compares JSON bodies by value |\n| `request-key.ts` | `requestKey`, with the default ports |\n| `rewrite-uri.ts` | `rewriteUri` (formerly the private `rewrite`) |\n| `recorded-response.ts` | `toResponse`, with the framing-header and null-body-status sets |\n| `replay-cassettes.ts` | `replayCassettes` and `ReplayOptions` |\n\n`testing/index.ts` re-exports only `replay-cassettes.ts`. Before and after, the exported names are:\n- `src/`: `encodeJson`, `decodeJson`, `readItem`, `StatusWrite`, `writeStatus`\n- `testing/`: `ReplayOptions`, `replayCassettes`\n\n**Tests**\n\n| Before | After |\n|---|---|\n| `test/row.test.ts` | `test/item-store/read-item.test.ts` and `test/item-store/write-status.test.ts` |\n| (helper inside `row.test.ts`) | `test/item-store/insert-item.ts`, holding `STALE` and `insertItem` |\n| `test/cassettes.test.ts` | `test/replay-cassettes.test.ts` |\n\nThe test names are unchanged.\n\n## Checks\n\n- **`common/`:** biome checked 33 files with no fixes; `tsc --noEmit` is clean; vitest ran 5 files, 17 tests passed.\n- **`pipeline/`:** biome checked 49 files with no fixes; types exited 0; vitest ran 11 files, 55 passed and 1 skipped.\n2cbc866 refactor(common): one module per item-store function and cassette step\n349fe2d refactor(common): share the unit text fields and the key comparator\n624387d chore: move to one root pnpm workspace\nee21dae feat(common): add the @nagara/common package","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"45683cb3-a219-4dc1-b730-776af5cccd8d","timestamp":"2026-10-11T06:54:38.833Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"done\nI committed the four review fixes and then split `row.ts` and `cassettes.ts` into one module per function. `@nagara/common` and `@nagara/common/testing` export exactly the same names as before, so nothing changes for the pipeline and api worktrees. Biome, tsc and vitest pass in both `common/` and `pipeline/`.\n\n## Commits\n\n| Hash | Subject |\n|---|---|\n| `349fe2d` | refactor(common): share the unit text fields and the key comparator |\n| `2cbc866` | refactor(common): one module per item-store function and cassette step |\n\n## New module list\n\n**`common/src/item-store/`** replaces `src/row.ts`:\n\n| Module | Holds |\n|---|---|\n| `json-column.ts` | `encodeJson` and `decodeJson`, the two halves of the JSON column codec |\n| `read-item.ts` | `readItem`, with the private stored-row type it decodes from |\n| `write-status.ts` | `writeStatus` and `StatusWrite` |\n\n`src/index.ts` re-exports these three files in place of `row.ts`.\n\n**`common/testing/`** replaces `testing/cassettes.ts`:\n\n| Module | Holds |\n|---|---|\n| `cassette.ts` | `RecordedInteraction` and `parseCassette` (the YAML to interactions step) |\n| `item-id.ts` | the `itm_` pattern and `normalizeIds` |\n| `sort-keys.ts` | `byKey` and `sortKeys` (`byKey` is the comparator `sortKeys` uses) |\n| `canonical-body.ts` | `canonicalBody`, which compares JSON bodies by value |\n| `request-key.ts` | `requestKey`, with the default ports |\n| `rewrite-uri.ts` | `rewriteUri` (formerly the private `rewrite`) |\n| `recorded-response.ts` | `toResponse`, with the framing-header and null-body-status sets |\n| `replay-cassettes.ts` | `replayCassettes` and `ReplayOptions` |\n\n`testing/index.ts` re-exports only `replay-cassettes.ts`. Before and after, the exported names are:\n- `src/`: `encodeJson`, `decodeJson`, `readItem`, `StatusWrite`, `writeStatus`\n- `testing/`: `ReplayOptions`, `replayCassettes`\n\n**Tests**\n\n| Before | After |\n|---|---|\n| `test/row.test.ts` | `test/item-store/read-item.test.ts` and `test/item-store/write-status.test.ts` |\n| (helper inside `row.test.ts`) | `test/item-store/insert-item.ts`, holding `STALE` and `insertItem` |\n| `test/cassettes.test.ts` | `test/replay-cassettes.test.ts` |\n\nThe test names are unchanged.\n\n## Checks\n\n- **`common/`:** biome checked 33 files with no fixes; `tsc --noEmit` is clean; vitest ran 5 files, 17 tests passed.\n- **`pipeline/`:** biome checked 49 files with no fixes; types exited 0; vitest ran 11 files, 55 passed and 1 skipped.\n2cbc866 refactor(common): one module per item-store function and cassette step\n349fe2d refactor(common): share the unit text fields and the key comparator\n624387d chore: move to one root pnpm workspace\nee21dae feat(common): add the @nagara/common package","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"reque