{"parentUuid":"58376bdf-14b6-4f59-aaa5-7037b8d01503","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfv1bx1Dn2o3hXuepHYkp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013hMwvverhSHviPSKAr4XoG","name":"mcp__plannotator__plannotator_inbox","input":{"action":"send_message","thread":"cloudflare-migration: orchestrator","subject":"Progress: common split, api Worker done","body":"**common/**\n- Fixes committed as `349fe2d`.\n- Split committed as `2cbc866`. `common/src/item-store/` now holds `json-column.ts`, `read-item.ts` and `write-status.ts`. The cassette replay code is in eight small modules under `common/testing/`. The exports haven't changed.\n- The same subagent is now on ASE-82, the CI workflow.\n\n**api/ (ASE-80)**\n- Done as `79ed096` on `feat/cloudflare-migration-api`: the Python tree is replaced by the `nagara-api` Worker. All 35 tests pass (D1–D27), and lint and types are clean. Its agentic review is running.\n- Choices the notes left open, which the subagent made itself. Reply if you want any changed:\n  - When the Workflow can't be created, enqueue still answers 202, with the item `failed`.\n  - Error bodies keep the FastAPI shape `{\"detail\": …}`.\n  - `duration` and `audio_url` are `null` until the item is ready.\n  - A `create` or `restart` that fails during a retry or re-queue answers 500 and leaves the item `queued`, so the 15-minute re-queue picks it up.\n  - `/health` answers plain `ok`, as the program design says. The old API answered JSON.\n- Drift to reconcile in the docs later:\n  - The API has no R2 binding, because it only signs URLs. `persistence-and-storage`, `deployment-and-ci` and `local-development` say both Workers bind the bucket. The local-dev task settles how the API's presigned GETs reach the local bucket.\n  - The R2 bucket name `nagara` is a placeholder. Nothing in the notes settles it.\n\n**pipeline/ (ASE-75 to 79)** is still running. The tts review and its live check are running too."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1081,"cache_read_input_tokens":147437,"output_tokens":754,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1081,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":754,"cache_read_input_tokens":147437,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1081,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1081},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_013hMwvverhSHviPSKAr4XoG":{"action":"send_message","thread":"cloudflare-migration: orchestrator","subject":"Progress: common split, api Worker done","body":"**common/**\n- Fixes committed as `349fe2d`.\n- Split committed as `2cbc866`. `common/src/item-store/` now holds `json-column.ts`, `read-item.ts` and `write-status.ts`. The cassette replay code is in eight small modules under `common/testing/`. The exports haven't changed.\n- The same subagent is now on ASE-82, the CI workflow.\n\n**api/ (ASE-80)**\n- Done as `79ed096` on `feat/cloudflare-migration-api`: the Python tree is replaced by the `nagara-api` Worker. All 35 tests pass (D1–D27), and lint and types are clean. Its agentic review is running.\n- Choices the notes left open, which the subagent made itself. Reply if you want any changed:\n  - When the Workflow can't be created, enqueue still answers 202, with the item `failed`.\n  - Error bodies keep the FastAPI shape `{\"detail\": …}`.\n  - `duration` and `audio_url` are `null` until the item is ready.\n  - A `create` or `restart` that fails during a retry or re-queue answers 500 and leaves the item `queued`, so the 15-minute re-queue picks it up.\n  - `/health` answers plain `ok`, as the program design says. The old API answered JSON.\n- Drift to reconcile in the docs later:\n  - The API has no R2 binding, because it only signs URLs. `persistence-and-storage`, `deployment-and-ci` and `local-development` say both Workers bind the bucket. The local-dev task settles how the API's presigned GETs reach the local bucket.\n  - The R2 bucket name `nagara` is a placeholder. Nothing in the notes settles it.\n\n**pipeline/ (ASE-75 to 79)** is still running. The tts review and its live check are running too."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"174eb840-5be1-4227-a69e-1753778a8a6a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfv1bweddsAesJVFwdB1V","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"bc0aff6a-9f87-4166-862c-7a749a53b264","timestamp":"2026-10-11T06:54:56.285Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
