{"parentUuid":"6473e917-6c49-4a3d-babf-8d70d8640ca6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfv1cYQRqQsKKLm33aUqX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**`common/`**\n- The four review fixes are committed as `349fe2d`.\n- The module split is committed as `2cbc866`:\n  - `common/src/item-store/` holds `json-column.ts`, `read-item.ts` and `write-status.ts`.\n  - The cassette replay code is split into eight small modules under `common/testing/`.\n  - The exports are unchanged.\n- The same subagent is now writing the CI workflow (ASE-82).\n\n**API (ASE-80)**\n- Done as `79ed096` on `feat/cloudflare-migration-api`: the Python tree is replaced by the `nagara-api` Worker.\n- All 35 tests pass (D1 to D27), and lint and types are clean. Its agentic review is running.\n- The choices it made where the notes left gaps are in the Inbox.\n- It also found two places where the code and docs disagree, which I'll reconcile later:\n  - The API has no R2 binding, because it only signs URLs, while three notes say both Workers bind the bucket.\n  - The bucket name `nagara` is a placeholder.\n\n**Still running:** the pipeline (ASE-75 to 79), and the tts review plus its live check."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1231,"cache_read_input_tokens":148518,"output_tokens":389,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1231,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":389,"cache_read_input_tokens":148518,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1231,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1231},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":n