{"parentUuid":"fa52e83e-59a3-4876-976a-da7b228752bd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfv23xfdbCgSj25XRdRwy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The tts, API and CI reviews have all finished. Their fixes are uncommitted, and the tests pass in all three.\n\nThe tts live check against the Modal dev copy passed end to end:\n- a request without credentials is refused with 401\n- bad call ids answer 422\n- a start with credentials is accepted\n- polling returns 202 until a 200 after about 25 seconds, with correct timings\n- an 8.6-second Ogg Opus file landed at the upload target\n\nThe deployed `nagara-tts` wasn't touched.\n\nI've sent you six decisions in the Inbox:\n- whether to commit each set of review fixes\n- the API creating each item's Workflow with the item id, so a re-queue or retry can't start a duplicate instance\n- how the API handles a Workflow call that fails after the item is already claimed\n- where the API's row writes live\n- the extra layer in the tts GPU image\n\nIf you haven't answered by the time the pipeline finishes, I'll take my recommendations so local validation keeps moving.\n\nThe pipeline subagent (ASE-75 to 79) is still working and hasn't committed anything yet."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":386,"cache_read_input_tokens":169601,"output_tokens":361,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":386,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":361,"cache_read_input_tokens":169601,"cache_creation_input_tokens":386,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":386},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_t