{"parentUuid":"eb6a42f5-585e-4ec5-80d9-605b1b4ff12d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14919471 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"9687ac55-45ec-433e-8091-78205cfc1888","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:14:29.075Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14919471 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/briefs","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"9687ac55-45ec-433e-8091-78205cfc1888","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfvb8ZmhjvyeUZXs19Sgc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The api branch is merged (`2313182`). On the merged tree its 40 tests pass, and types and lint are clean.\n\nThe api subagent's two fixes:\n- Each item's Workflow uses the item id as its instance id. A re-queue or retry that finds the instance already there restarts it.\n- If a retry's restart throws, the item goes back to `failed`, and the retry still counts.\n\nI cleaned up the old Python files that git ignores under `api/`: `.venv` (271 MB), the `.pyc` leftovers in `app/` and `migrations/`, and the pytest and ruff caches. Biome had been reading them, which made the api lint fail. I closed the api and tts subagents and deleted their worktrees; the branches still exist.\n\nTwo ignored folders I left in place, because they look like your data:\n- **`api/data/nagara.db`**: the old local SQLite database.\n- **`api/prototype_cache/`**: 16 `.ogg` files from earlier listening tests.\n\nShould I delete them?\n\nThe pipeline subagent is now on ASE-81, the local dev setup:\n- the shared `.wrangler-state` folder and the tunnel proxy\n- `.dev.vars` filled from your existing keys by a script\n- the API's signed audio links pointing at the local bucket\n- a smoke test with both Workers and the Modal dev copy running, but no real articles yet\n\nThe manual rows come after that."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2198,"cache_read_input_tokens":210215,"output_tokens":459,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2198,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":459,"cache_read_input_tokens":210215,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2198,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2198},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"37cce5ee-6652-4528-a1f3-207cbd6d4c4f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfvb8ZR8HeX3hw24inz3J","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"9409e242-a73e-48e1-8a5e-5f8c74628211","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:14:33.750Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/briefs","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
