{"parentUuid":"82b0d2df-150d-438b-be76-6333cff25c54","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fee01dd2-023b-45ab-adef-749adc411c6a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"\n\n<pasted_content id=\"bfba\">\n# Annotations on claude · last message\n\n## Annotation 1 (line 32)\nComment on: \"- **Fake agent:** the stand-in sits behind a `scriptedAgentReplies` setting in production code. Reviewers want it moved out of `src/`; the test design asked for configuration.\"\n> let's avoid this reaching the production code\n\n## Annotation 2 (line 33)\nComment on: \"- **Modal 500s:** a result 500 is retried, but a synthesis that fails deterministically answers 500 on every poll, so the retries can't help.\"\n> this is fine\n\n## Annotation 3 (line 34)\nComment on: \"- **HTML size:** the HTML passes between steps as the fetch step's result. Its JSON-escaped form can exceed the 1 MiB cap the fetch step checks against raw bytes.\"\n> the 1mib cap was something from cloudflare or a self set restriction? why is that in place?\n\n## Annotation 4 (line 35)\nComment on: \"- **Rerun duplicates:** a step that reruns can write a second ledger row or save a second identical recipe version.\"\n> don't we re-check the recipe existance/working before retrying?\n\n## Annotation 5 (line 36)\nComment on: \"- **Firecrawl retries:** every non-2xx is retried, so a 401 or 402 uses all three attempts.\"\n> that's fine\n\n## Annotation 6 (line 37)\nComment on: \"- **Firecrawl billing:** the docs say an `auto` proxy escalation costs 5 credits; the wiki says it costs nothing extra. One of them is wrong.\"\n> doesn't firecrawl return how much it costs?\n\n## Annotation 7 (line 42)\nComment on: \"The api has no R2 binding,\"\n> why not? doesn't it need it for the signed link generation?\n\n## Annotation 8 (line 43)\nLooks good: \"Step retries are `limit: 2`, which is 3 attempts.\"\n\n## Annotation 9 (line 44)\nLooks good: \"The Workflow instance id is now the item id.\"\n\n## Annotation 10 (line 45)\nLooks good: \"The R2 bucket name `nagara` is a placeholder, and so is the D1 id.\"\n\n## Annotation 11 (line 46)\nComment on: \"A push that changes only the pipeline also redeploys the api.\"\n> why is that?\n\n## Annotation 12 (line 47)\nLooks good: \"Relative image `src` values are resolved against the item URL, and SVG cleaning also strips `on*` attributes.\"\n\n</pasted_content id=\"bfba\">\n"},"uuid":"5600fb6e-07b5-43ab-9c3c-aaa554853511","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:18:51.086Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":92,"turnIndex":275},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/api","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
