{"parentUuid":"9e1c0178-3cdf-4570-89e5-b25ec9a8258b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvbaE5GMDV22CvWBFcQQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ASE-81 is done and committed as `e71c820`. Both Workers run locally on one shared `.wrangler-state`, and the smoke test passed:\n- `/health` answered 200, and a request without the key got 401.\n- `POST /items` wrote a queued row. The pipeline's Workflow picked it up and failed in fetch as expected, because the URL pointed at an invalid domain.\n- A PUT through the tunnel and proxy reached the local bucket, and a GET signed the way the API signs read the same bytes back.\n- The image route redirected to the local bucket.\n- The Modal dev copy answered with the proxy keys and refused requests without them.\n\nEverything it started is stopped, by PID.\n\n- **Port 8787 is taken** by an unrelated `bun` process (pid 713), so the API ran on 8788 for the smoke test. Free 8787, or use `pnpm dev --port 8788`.\n- **Launch order:** the tunnel has to start before the pipeline dev server, because the server reads the tunnel's hostname from `.dev.vars` at startup.\n- **Local audio and image links** only work while the pipeline dev server is running, since the local bucket is served there.\n- **`local-development.md` needs updating:** it says the API reads audio through its own R2 binding, and it's missing the launch details above.\n\nThe manual validation is next. It needs your answer on the fixes I proposed: taking the fake agent out of `src/`, the serialized-size HTML cap, dropping the Firecrawl \"5 credits\" claim, and the CI deploy condition. They change pipeline code, and a dev-server reload strands any running item, so I'd make those changes before running the manual rows."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2312,"cache_read_input_tokens":219847,"output_tokens":670,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":120},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2312,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":670,"cache_read_input_tokens":219847,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2312,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2312},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b91cf562-356e-4f61-8ac0-018873ab5a4c","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfvbaDhCTTNPwCLNcPQGt","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"25c64a98-de18-4971-95b6-ec899c4bdd95","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:20:23.893Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/pipeline/src","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
