404 | Gemini answers | ready after polls | first run | ready; both images gone from the units; one degradation {image, 404, url} for the 404 and none for the avatar, which drops silently. By hand: an article with a broken image reaches ready without it | test + manual |  |\n| D1 | enqueues a URL with a voice | url and voice | succeeds | 202 queued, the row with that voice and queued_at, create called with {itemId}. By hand on the deployed API: the item goes queued, generating, ready | test + manual |  |\n| D4 | enqueues while create throws | url only | throws | the item returned failed with the create's error, current_step empty. By hand locally: enqueue with the pipeline Worker stopped, see the failed item, start the pipeline, retry it to ready | test + manual |  |\n| D5 | polls a ready item | ready | present | one | units with index, start, end and no spoken; audio_url; duration. By hand on a fresh local state folder after migrate:local: the row reads back with every column | test + manual |  |\n| D13 | retries an item that failed in describe | failed under the cap | another step | one | 202 queued, retry_count + 1, error null, restart from describe. By hand on the deployed API: a failed item retried reaches ready | test + manual |  |\n| D16 | retries an item at 3 retries | failed at the cap | another step | one | 409. By hand: a fourth retry of a failed item answers 409 | test + manual |  |\n| D20 | asks for a ready item's audio | audio | ready | stored | 307 to a URL signed for audio/<id>, X-Amz-Expires=3600. By hand: the URL plays and seeks in a browser audio element | test + manual |  |\n| D21 | asks for a generating item's audio | audio | not ready | stored | 404. By hand: the audio route of an item still generating answers 404 | test + manual |  |\n| D25 | calls every /items route without a key | missing | an /items route | 401. By hand on the deployed API: a poll without the key answers 401 | test + manual |  |","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"dd1df625-1006-4a2