{"parentUuid":"172a5fce-0806-41d6-b136-ec42a891f11f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvcfWKZs5qsUZLiVaBfg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I committed the doc changes as `4101b42`.\n\nThe consistency check is running. It's read-only and writes its findings to `reports/consistency-check.md`. It sweeps the whole repo for:\n- **Leftovers:** remnants of the Python API, the extraction service, the old CI files, unused cassettes, dead exports and dependencies.\n- **Docs vs code:** every route, status, step, binding, var and port a note states, plus `CLAUDE.md` and the README.\n- **Code vs code:** wrangler configs, `.dev.vars.example` files and the shapes passed between tts and the pipeline.\n- **Old vocabulary:** names and comments that still say \"job\" or \"Railway\".\n\nIt makes no edits, because the manual validation is still using the dev servers in the same checkout. The validation's first recipe settled after about 100 seconds, and the remaining rows are running now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":669,"cache_read_input_tokens":248475,"output_tokens":288,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":669,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":288,"cache_read_input_tokens":248475,"cache_creation_input_tokens":669,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":669},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b5e482c9-40dc-49c4-b1b3-c13e89d48c5d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfvcfVtXFQ7LtsrWiMhwL","requestedModel":"claude-opu