{"parentUuid":"b464e2b5-2f08-42e0-8af8-bc39f71e0c0e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"bef968bc-ddde-4eb2-87c7-308e1c77ded3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MKNK5dy3RKLUrbQZvCe9Q8","type":"tool_result","content":"done\n.md`** still describes the Python API from top to bottom: FastAPI, `uvicorn`, port 8000, the item created as `generating`, and status resolved when it is polled.\n- **D1 `database_id`** is the all-zero placeholder in all three wrangler configs, and nothing marks it as a placeholder. The CI migrate job and both deploys would target a database that does not exist.\n- **`pnpm deploy`** is pnpm's built-in command, so the deploy command in `CLAUDE.md` and `deployment-and-ci.md` never runs the pipeline's `deploy` script. It should be `pnpm run deploy`.\n- **Status write**: four notes say the API writes `queued` through the shared status write in `common/`. In the code the API calls it only for `failed`; it writes `queued` with its own INSERT and UPDATEs.\n- **`api/tests/cassettes/`**: 31 Python-era cassettes that no test reads. Two cassettes in the pipeline's describe folder are also never imported.\n- **`.gitattributes`** exempts image fixtures from LFS under `tests/fixtures`, but the TypeScript trees use `test/fixtures`. A future image fixture there would reach CI as LFS pointer text.\n- **Mahou wiki**: two entries still describe `POST /jobs` and the extraction pipeline's conftest.\n\nThings that agree: the secrets in the `.dev.vars.example` files match what the code reads, every pipeline var is read, every dependency is imported, and the request and response shapes between `tts/` and `pipeline/` match.\n\nCount per group:\n- Leftovers: 9\n- Docs vs code: 18\n- Code vs code: 2\n- Vocabulary: 7\n-rw-r--r-- 1 agus agus 14155 Oct 11 11:38 /home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/reports/consistency-check.md","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"c0e2f4e0-bcce-403f-940d-dc7beeec3bfb","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:38:39.323Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"done\n.md`** still describes the Python API from top to bottom: FastAPI, `uvicorn`, port 8000, the item created as `generating`, and status resolved when it is polled.\n- **D1 `database_id`** is the all-zero placeholder in all three wrangler configs, and nothing marks it as a placeholder. The CI migrate job and both deploys would target a database that does not exist.\n- **`pnpm deploy`** is pnpm's built-in command, so the deploy command in `CLAUDE.md` and `deployment-and-ci.md` never runs the pipeline's `deploy` script. It should be `pnpm run deploy`.\n- **Status write**: four notes say the API writes `queued` through the shared status write in `common/`. In the code the API calls it only for `failed`; it writes `queued` with its own INSERT and UPDATEs.\n- **`api/tests/cassettes/`**: 31 Python-era cassettes that no test reads. Two cassettes in the pipeline's describe folder are also never imported.\n- **`.gitattributes`** exempts image fixtures from LFS under `tests/fixtures`, but the TypeScript trees use `test/fixtures`. A future image fixture there would reach CI as LFS pointer text.\n- **Mahou wiki**: two entries still describe `POST /jobs` and the extraction pipeline's conftest.\n\nThings that agree: the secrets in the `.dev.vars.example` files match what the code reads, every pipeline var is read, every dependency is imported, and the request and response shapes between `tts/` and `pipeline/` match.\n\nCount per group:\n- Leftovers: 9\n- Docs vs code: 18\n- Code vs code: 2\n- Vocabulary: 7\n-rw-r--r-- 1 agus agus 14155 Oct 11 11:38 /home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/reports/consistency-check.md","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"44d8f59d-da64-4632-8b31-bede2e2d0662","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/briefs","root":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nag