{"parentUuid":"9e674a2f-8881-4041-8536-25c8d8871142","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14965746 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"e8b2ef06-89ce-4ff6-8286-76540402f726","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:38:48.119Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14965746 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/briefs","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"e8b2ef06-89ce-4ff6-8286-76540402f726","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfvcz7rjpXXYDJ9ZGc9YL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The consistency check found 36 findings, all in `reports/consistency-check.md`:\n\n| Group | Count |\n|---|---|\n| Leftovers | 9 |\n| Docs vs code | 18 |\n| Code vs code | 2 |\n| Vocabulary | 7 |\n\n**Leftovers:**\n- `api/tests/cassettes/`: 31 Python-era cassettes that no test reads.\n- Two describe cassettes nothing imports.\n- Two mahou wiki entries in `.mahou/wiki/` still describe `POST /jobs` and the Python conftest.\n- `.gitattributes` exempts `tests/fixtures` from LFS, but the TypeScript trees use `test/fixtures`. A new image fixture there would reach CI as LFS pointer text.\n- The `api/data/` lines in `.gitignore`.\n- An unused `display` field on image units in the recipe runtime.\n- \"spike\" in the tts `pyproject.toml` description.\n\n**Docs vs code**, the larger ones:\n- `README.md` still describes the Python API from top to bottom.\n- `pnpm deploy` in `CLAUDE.md` and `deployment-and-ci.md` is pnpm's built-in command and never runs the deploy script. It should be `pnpm run deploy`.\n- Four notes say the API writes `queued` through `common/`'s status write. The API only uses that write for `failed`.\n- The rest are small factual fixes: `duration` and `audio_url` are `null` rather than absent, `RETRY_MAX`, the lease step's timeouts, two missing fail-at-once cases, the table-header rule, a nonexistent 3.1 fallback model, \"not-accessible\", and the folder lists in the docs indexes.\n\n**Code vs code:**\n- The placeholder D1 id. It gets fixed tomorrow, when the real database exists.\n- `migrations_dir` is set on the API's D1 binding but not the pipeline's.\n\n**Vocabulary:** \"job\" wording left in `CLAUDE.md` and one comment in `common/`, the Python name `sanitize_spoken`, and `.mahou/spike.md` naming only one production Worker.\n\nAll are pointed fixes. The D1 id waits for tomorrow, and `api/.env` I'm leaving for you to delete once you've checked it.\n\nOne finding needs your call. An image degradation records the `src` exactly as the recipe declared it, which can be relative or a `data:` URI, while the note says it records the URL. I'd record the resolved URL in the code, since a relative path is useless in a degradation.\n\nThe pipeline subagent is still running the manual validation. Code changes would reload the dev servers and strand its items, so I'll apply all of these once it reports. Is the resolved URL OK?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":363,"cache_read_input_tokens":256769,"output_tokens":913,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":363,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":913,"cache_read_input_tokens":256769,"cache_creation_input_tokens":363,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":363},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0d3ae9d8-74f8-4e3a-98c3-5ade681b6aeb","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfvcz7Tg46Yekoxae4tzQ","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"4d3682ca-117b-41ff-ad11-f722e8c83aec","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:38:57.358Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/briefs","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug"