{"parentUuid":"57f76b51-f87c-4a50-b28b-4c049154931b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c64b69f2-49ca-4102-a16a-e5e428382fbf","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XEevyn9Nn3RYmZ1RLJYThw","type":"tool_result","content":"idle\nThis is the reminder I scheduled earlier, and that work is already finished. D4 was completed after the supervisor asked me not to wait: I backdated `itm_57e81442`'s `queued_at` instead of waiting the 15 minutes. The summary, the shutdown and the report are done too.\n\nOn `itm_57e81442`: the poll's re-queue claimed the row, but the item never ran. Its Workflow instance was created while the pipeline dev server was stopped and errored at creation, and the re-queue's restart left it errored, so the item stays `queued` (finding F4). The forced enqueue-time failure, the other D4 path, passed and its item retried to ready, so D4 is recorded as partial.\n\nEverything I started is stopped, and I'm not bringing the system back up for this reminder. The full results are in my previous message and in `.scratch/cloudflare-migration/reports/validation/index.html`.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"18b43452-6e7e-4e3d-95f9-8fb7d1a04644","timestamp":"2026-10-11T15:05:38.057Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"idle\nThis is the reminder I scheduled earlier, and that work is already finished. D4 was completed after the supervisor asked me not to wait: I backdated `itm_57e81442`'s `queued_at` instead of waiting the 15 minutes. The summary, the shutdown and the report are done too.\n\nOn `itm_57e81442`: the poll's re-queue claimed the row, but the item never ran. Its Workflow instance was created while the pipeline dev server was stopped and errored at creation, and the re-queue's restart left it errored, so the item stays `queued` (finding F4). The forced enqueue-time failure, the other D4 path, passed and its item retried to ready, so D4 is recorded as partial.\n\nEverything I started is stopped, and I'm not bringing the system back up for