{"parentUuid":"3564ebc8-80a0-4a1f-bef2-3ea87465d2b0","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14996736 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"3b203110-7d6e-47f6-af3c-c23cd4697a27","timestamp":"2026-10-11T15:12:38.665Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14996736 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/briefs","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"3b203110-7d6e-47f6-af3c-c23cd4697a27","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvfZoMS2aw17QiBvhvn7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've written the brief for F1 and F4.\n\n**F4:** before restarting, the API reads the instance's status.\n- If the instance errored or was terminated, the API creates a new one under `<itemId>-2`, then `-3`, and so on.\n- If the instance is alive, a re-queue leaves it alone.\n- Otherwise the API restarts it, as it does now.\n\nThe brief also checks that a suffixed instance id works everywhere the pipeline uses it, such as the domain lease queue. It then reruns the D4 stuck-item path locally, recovers the two items already stuck in the local state, and updates the three notes.\n\n**F1:** the most likely cause is a rule meant to remove the space before sentence punctuation like \"word .\" that also catches \".wast\". The fix narrows it so a space before a dot followed by a letter or digit stays. On whether to read it as \"dot wast\", the subagent will synthesize two short clips, \".wast files\" and \"dot wast files\", for you to listen to before anything changes.\n\nThe subagent is at 70% of its context and in the middle of the consistency fixes. Once that turn ends I'll have it run `/compact`, then send it the F1 and F4 brief."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1623,"cache_read_input_tokens":274130,"output_tokens":385,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1623,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":385,"cache_read_input_tokens":274130,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1623,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input