{"parentUuid":"0b50a7ad-8844-4e3a-9d8c-d17dfc67bf9c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwAa4FWJrEuYnT2vCx8g","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've updated the rule:\n- **Dots inside words are read too:** `index.html` becomes \"index dot html\", `example.com` becomes \"example dot com\", and `.wast` becomes \"dot wast\".\n- **Left as they are:** numbers, sentence punctuation, ellipses, and single-letter abbreviations like \"e.g.\", \"i.e.\" and \"U.S.\". Without that last exception, \"e.g.\" would be read as \"e dot g\".\n\nBefore the number part goes in, the subagent will synthesize six short clips for you to listen to:\n- \"Version 3.14 shipped today.\"\n- \"It takes 0.5 seconds.\"\n- \"It takes .5 seconds.\"\n- the same three with \"point\" written out\n\nThey go in `reports/validation/num-*.ogg`, with an index file saying which clip is which. I'll tell you when they're ready, and numbers stay untouched until you decide."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":864,"cache_read_input_tokens":289982,"output_tokens":287,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":864,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":287,"cache_read_input_tokens":289982,"cache_creation_input_tokens":864,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":864},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"56dda200-9284-47ce-b32c-0458f166e929","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfwAa3qx5jddXadkjgCPd","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"562fe1d5-1137-4