{"parentUuid":"3b3abc2b-78a8-484e-b928-12e3b0af1661","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c1812271-2cb6-44fe-84c1-dee77a7afa91","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RmFb1AyYPZNzNNTfQJm8K7","type":"tool_result","content":"# Status\n\n- **Stage**: implemented and validated locally on `feat/cloudflare-migration` (ASE-73 to ASE-82 done, not pushed). Next: ASE-83, the production switchover and deploy.\n\n## Links\n\n- Linear: milestone \"Cloudflare migration\", project nagara; tasks ASE-73 to ASE-83, in run order. ASE-28 and ASE-29 canceled as superseded.\n- Docs: commits c0dbdba, 4930ea1, fdc0c1a on `feat/cloudflare-migration`.\n\n## Local artifacts\n\n- `README.md`: folder index, spike table, credentials to delete by hand.\n## Tracking\n\n- ASE-83 tomorrow: create the production D1 (replace the placeholder id in the three wrangler configs), the R2 bucket (name `nagara` is a placeholder) and tokens, set secrets, deploy, run the deployed halves of the manual rows (B1, D1, D13, D25).\n\n- Implementation tasks from the test design: listed at the end of `test-design/nagara.md`.\n\n- Remind the user at the start of tomorrow's session: remove the Modal proxy token created 2026-10-11 for local validation, and delete `modal-proxy.env`, once the production secrets no longer need it.\n- Delete the Modal proxy auth token and revoke the R2 API tokens from the spikes (see `README.md`, \"Still to delete by hand\").","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e383ec74-93af-485e-96c1-b0ea6a380b53","timestamp":"2026-10-11T21:48:02.390Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"# Status\n\n- **Stage**: implemented and validated locally on `feat/cloudflare-migration` (ASE-73 to ASE-82 done, not pushed). Next: ASE-83, the production switchover and deploy.\n\n## Links\n\n- Linear: milestone \"Cloudflare migration\", project nagara; tasks ASE-73 to ASE-83, in run order. ASE-28 and ASE-29 canceled as superseded.\n- Docs: commits c0dbdba, 4930ea1, fdc0c1a on `feat/cloudflare-migration`.\n\n## Local artifacts\n\n- `README.md`: folder index, spike table, credentials to delete by hand.\n## Tracking\n\n- ASE-83 tomorrow: create the production D1 (replace the placeholder id in the three wrangler configs), the R2 bucket (name `nagara` is a placeholder) and tokens, set secrets, deploy, run the deployed halves of the manual rows (B1, D1, D13, D25).\n\n- Implementation tasks from the test design: listed at the end of `test-design/nagara.md`.\n\n- Remind the user at the start of tomorrow's session: remove the Modal proxy token created 2026-10-11 for local validation, and delete `modal-proxy.env`, once the production secrets no longer need it.\n- Delete the Modal proxy auth token and revoke the R2 API tokens from the spikes (see `README.md`, \"Still to delete by hand\").","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"573f6bc5-04c9-49d8-8a4d-46a71d8b1b56","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","root":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","branch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"filadd/cc-plugin-marketplace","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","platform":"linux"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3b3abc2b-78a8-484e-b928-12e3b0af1661","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratc