issue above.\n  \n  **Not verified**\n  - `wrangler d1 migrations apply` on drizzle output.\n  - Behaviour of D1 on `db.transaction`.\n  - Handling of the breakpoint markers by `applyD1Migrations`.\n  - The `.returning()`, `meta.changes` and insert-select behavior on D1.\n  - Whether wrangler's `migrations_pattern` works with 1.x subfolders.\n  - Drizzle docs on the 1.x migration folder and the D1 `relations` option.","handback":true},"promptSource":"system","turnOrigin":"peer","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":106,"turnIndex":306},"queueSkipAttachments":true,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
