{"parentUuid":"309540be-925d-48d6-aaf6-b9081ea24e66","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"silent_turn_reminder","text":"The user hasn't heard from you in a while — say in a few words what you're doing, then continue."},"type":"attachment","uuid":"96bb2a13-e955-4812-ab50-5d0e081a18dd","timestamp":"2026-10-11T22:09:14.784Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nThe user hasn't heard from you in a while — say in a few words what you're doing, then continue.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"96bb2a13-e955-4812-ab50-5d0e081a18dd","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14937840 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"89134154-d434-49da-9ea9-a5b1369dcca6","timestamp":"2026-10-11T22:09:14.786Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14937840 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"89134154-d434-49da-9ea9-a5b1369dcca6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwDLNX4vYR2m4zPrEyP8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full Drizzle program design is on the canvas at **http://localhost:5190**. Each branch is a column, and the text record is `program-design/drizzle.md`.\n\n- **1 `common/` package**\n  - 1.1 Package layout.\n  - 1.2 How a schema change reaches D1: edit `schema.ts`, `pnpm db:generate`, review, then `wrangler` applies it locally, in the tests and in CI.\n  - 1.3 The schema as a class diagram, plus the 13 query functions and what each one replaces.\n  - 1.4 The module list.\n- **2 Callers:** the retry route's callstack, as an example of how the routes and steps call `common/`.\n- **3 Standards:** what changes in `CLAUDE.md`, the invariants, the notes and the wiki.\n\nPoints worth checking first:\n- **Versions:** drizzle-orm 0.45.4 and drizzle-kit 0.31.11, not the 1.0 release candidate. The release candidate writes migrations into subfolders that neither wrangler nor the tests can read. I confirmed 0.31.11's output applies cleanly with wrangler.\n- **Initial migration:** a generated `0000_initial.sql` replaces `0001_initial.sql`, since production D1 doesn't exist yet. The local state gets reset once.\n- **CI check:** CI fails when the schema changes without a migration.\n- **Row types:** they derive from the schema. `cached` reads back as a boolean, and drizzle encodes and decodes the JSON columns.\n- **Where queries live:** every query goes in `common/src/db/`, including those only one Worker runs. `CLAUDE.md` gets a database exception to its rule that single-Worker code stays in that Worker.\n- **Batching:** writes return the query unawaited, so steps can batch them as they do today. `db.transaction` isn't used, because D1 rejects it.\n\nPut a sticky note on anything that doesn't match your idea, or say it by voice, then click Send to Claude."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":364,"cache_read_input_tokens":364782,"output_tokens":666,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":364,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":666,"cache_read_input_tokens":364782,"cache_creation_input_tokens":364,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":364},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"02f9e74c-f150-4f5a-8699-c7c7b2bae0ff","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfwDLN8Vbis7t7PW96eE5","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"05669c01-f9d7-4fce-9c65-2b3deb876fe5","timestamp":"2026-10-11T22:09:20.892Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
