{"parentUuid":"9a68a61b-fd11-420a-a74e-2845c5dcf7d1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwF4bxyenKNGGbZ5mNUj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EUheN5cLqt6hTeHRe5QUUY","name":"mcp__linear-server__save_issue","input":{"team":"Asermax","project":"nagara","milestone":"Cloudflare migration","title":"common/: every D1 read and write through drizzle","labels":["Improvement"],"priority":2,"state":"Todo","description":"Move every D1 interaction into `common/src/db` as drizzle queries, with drizzle-kit generating the migrations from a schema in `common/`.\n\n* drizzle-orm 0.45.4 and drizzle-kit 0.31.11 (not the 1.0 RC: its per-migration subfolders are invisible to wrangler and `readD1Migrations`)\n* `common/src/db/schema.ts` with the three tables, every CHECK, FK and index of today's migration; row types derived from it\n* per-table functions, one per module: items (`getItem`, `createItem`, `updateItem`, `writeStatus`, `claimRetry`, `claimRequeue`), recipe-versions (`getLatestRecipeVersion`, `createRecipeVersion`), cost-entries (`createCostEntry`); writes return the unawaited query so steps keep batching; no `sql` template in queries\n* the generated `0000_initial.sql` replaces `0001_initial.sql`; local state reset once\n* CI `common-checks` fails when the schema changed without its migration\n* the API and pipeline call only these functions; the retry route reads before it claims\n\nProgram design: `.scratch/cloudflare-migration/program-design/drizzle.md` (scratch, local)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1727,"cache_read_input_tokens":396735,"output_tokens":737,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":82},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1727,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":737,"cache_read_input_tokens":396735,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1727,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1727},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01EUheN5cLqt6hTeHRe5QUUY":{"team":"Asermax","project":"nagara","milestone":"Cloudflare migration","title":"common/: every D1 read and write through drizzle","labels":["Improvement"],"priority":2,"state":"Todo","description":"Move every D1 interaction into `common/src/db` as drizzle queries, with drizzle-kit generating the migrations from a schema in `common/`.\n\n* drizzle-orm 0.45.4 and drizzle-kit 0.31.11 (not the 1.0 RC: its per-migration subfolders are invisible to wrangler and `readD1Migrations`)\n* `common/src/db/schema.ts` with the three tables, every CHECK, FK and index of today's migration; row types derived from it\n* per-table functions, one per module: items (`getItem`, `createItem`, `updateItem`, `writeStatus`, `claimRetry`, `claimRequeue`), recipe-versions (`getLatestRecipeVersion`, `createRecipeVersion`), cost-entries (`createCostEntry`); writes return the unawaited query so steps keep batching; no `sql` template in queries\n* the generated `0000_initial.sql` replaces `0001_initial.sql`; local state reset once\n* CI `common-checks` fails when the schema changed without its migration\n* the API and pipeline call only these functions; the retry route reads before it claims\n\nProgram design: `.scratch/cloudflare-migration/program-design/drizzle.md` (scratch, local)."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"478ab9ad-8515-4c53-b71b-7dc96db94264","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfwF4bSVAw1NdV1Cgy7BW","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"43cd663a-ee0e-4740-ba0b-7c7c7b9c0c79","timestamp":"2026-10-11T22:32:02.645Z","advisorModel":"