{"parentUuid":"43cd663a-ee0e-4740-ba0b-7c7c7b9c0c79","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"008d3378-7509-438e-8fc0-0c55a480f95f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EUheN5cLqt6hTeHRe5QUUY","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"ASE-84\",\"uuid\":\"7114b101-fe2c-4b19-91ca-0dfb30ddf6ee\",\"title\":\"common/: every D1 read and write through drizzle\",\"description\":\"Move every D1 interaction into `common/src/db` as drizzle queries, with drizzle-kit generating the migrations from a schema in `common/`.\\n\\n* drizzle-orm 0.45.4 and drizzle-kit 0.31.11 (not the 1.0 RC: its per-migration subfolders are invisible to wrangler and `readD1Migrations`)\\n* `common/src/db/schema.ts` with the three tables, every CHECK, FK and index of today's migration; row types derived from it\\n* per-table functions, one per module: items (`getItem`, `createItem`, `updateItem`, `writeStatus`, `claimRetry`, `claimRequeue`), recipe-versions (`getLatestRecipeVersion`, `createRecipeVersion`), cost-entries (`createCostEntry`); writes return the unawaited query so steps keep batching; no `sql` template in queries\\n* the generated `0000_initial.sql` replaces `0001_initial.sql`; local state reset once\\n* CI `common-checks` fails when the schema changed without its migration\\n* the API and pipeline call only these functions; the retry route reads before it claims\\n\\nProgram design: `.scratch/cloudflare-migration/program-design/drizzle.md` (scratch, local).\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"1f715c70-f21d-466d-92a3-ef263db6955e\",\"name\":\"Cloudflare migration\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/asermax/issue/ASE-84/common-every-d1-read-and-write-through-drizzle\",\"gitBranchName\":\"asermax/ase-84-common-every-d1-read-and-write-through-drizzle\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-11T22:32:07.800Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-11T22:32:07.800Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"cancele