{"parentUuid":"aa01c50b-190a-492d-b36b-c2829285b078","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwFdq6SDob9m8Pda73kj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Drizzle docs are written and uncommitted, and I've closed that subagent. They cover:\n- **`CLAUDE.md`**: the layout row, `db:generate` in the commands, invariant 7, the database exception to the code-style rule, and a \"schema change\" bullet.\n- **Notes:**\n  - `common-package` gets a new \"Reading and writing D1\" section with the functions table.\n  - `persistence-and-storage` gets a \"How the schema changes\" diagram.\n  - `deployment-and-ci` gets the schema check.\n  - `invariants` row 7 is updated.\n  - `item-contract` and `item-lifecycle` now say the retry route reads before it claims.\n  - The docs README and `recipes` got small touches.\n- **Wiki:** a new local entry, `.mahou/wiki/cloudflare/drizzle-on-d1.md`.\n\nIt went beyond the brief in one place: the item-JSON bullet in `CLAUDE.md` now says that a backfill with no schema change uses an empty migration from `pnpm db:generate --custom`. Keep that, or drop it?\n\nThe implementation subagent is still porting the code. The learn items from my previous message are still waiting on your answers to the open points."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":297,"cache_read_input_tokens":414988,"output_tokens":403,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":297,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":403,"cache_read_input_tokens":414988,"cache_creation_input_tokens":297,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":297},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fa