{"parentUuid":"8d6a1eb8-cc8b-47fd-b044-073c6ad4209e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwFhoT5F1g8ktNWbG3bF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1588,"cache_read_input_tokens":415285,"output_tokens":1368,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":553},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1588,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1368,"cache_read_input_tokens":415285,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1588,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1588},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":5914,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"1d868841-5c66-40f9-b2ba-2cf426555123","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfwFho5FVqyv4M7KW9Wqz","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"0929058c-7472-45bf-886e-557986543d8f","timestamp":"2026-10-11T22:40:27.234Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"0929058c-7472-45bf-886e-557986543d8f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwFhoT5F1g8ktNWbG3bF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Annotation 1: is this already in the canvas skill?** Partly. Here is what `mahou:canvas` says today, under \"Working with the user\":\n\n> **Talking on the canvas.** Write what you would say in the chat as a Claude note, a grey dashed rectangle labelled `Claude`, in the part of the canvas it is about. … The loading skill says which of the two to use; when it does not, ask the user.\n\nSo \"in the part it is about\" is already a canvas rule, and putting the note at the top of the canvas broke it. Two things are missing:\n- **Chat or canvas:** program-design-with-canvas never says which one to use, so I answered in the chat until you told me otherwise.\n- **The question card:** the violet `❓ Q<n>` card, the Claude note under it, and deleting the card when the question closes are defined only in design-with-canvas. Program design now uses them too.\n\nTwo places this could land:\n- **(a) program-design-with-canvas:** a short section that names the canvas as the place to talk, and copies the question card from design-with-canvas.\n- **(b) the canvas skill:** a question-card subsection under \"Talking on the canvas\", read by every loading skill. Design-with-canvas would point to it instead of defining the card, and program-design-with-canvas would add only \"talk on the canvas\".\n\nWhich one?\n\n**Annotation 4.** In `implement`, manual validation moves before design reconciliation, and the consistency check becomes part of reconciliation:\n1. Implement and review.\n2. Manual validation.\n3. Design reconciliation: the drift the subagents flagged, plus the consistency-check subagent's findings. You settle them all, an implementation subagent applies the code fixes, and `write-documentation` runs once for the docs.\n\nThe other annotations are noted:\n- Item 3 now says: compact only between tasks, never during one, once the subagent nears 50%.\n- Item 6 is dropped.\n- Items 2, 5 and 7 are approved.\n\nStill open:\n1. **Item 4, the agent's name:** `consistency-checker`, or something else?\n2. **Item 7, where it lands:** nagara's `CLAUDE.md` code style, or `.mahou/`?\n3. **Item 8, rules for when you're away:** keep it or drop it? If kept, does Inbox routing become a global `implement` option or a nagara-only rule? And does the no-`rm -rf` rule go in your global `CLAUDE.md`, in mahou basics, or in nagara only?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1588,"cache_read_input_tokens":415285,"output_tokens":1368,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":553},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1588,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1368,"cache_read_input_tokens":415285,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1588,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1588},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1d868841-5c66-40f9-b2ba-2cf426555123","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfwFho5FVqyv4M7KW9Wqz","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"1533195d-5baa-42cd-9d8b-0f1b9c5c9b24","timestamp":"2026-10-11T22:40:34.531Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
