{"parentUuid":"40085f00-0ce2-4354-9bfb-b48ab7fa2db2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwFvKSDAK5vJaGLBtsY8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Only the two skills I wrote in this project lack it. The others already put questions and talk next to what they're about:\n\n| Skill | Talking on the canvas | Question cards |\n|---|---|---|\n| explore-with-canvas | Claude note next to the answer it refers to | Decisions as violet `❓ <title>` cards |\n| shape-with-canvas | Claude note in the branch or question it's about | Full \"Questions\" section: violet card, follow-ups, summary box, deleted on close |\n| design-with-canvas | Same as shape | Same \"Questions\" section |\n| program-design-with-canvas | Nothing: it never says chat or canvas | None |\n| test-design-with-canvas | One Claude note at the **top of the canvas**, holding the open questions | None |\n\ntest-design-with-canvas has the pattern you just corrected: its open questions sit in a single note at the top, away from the tree they're about. Last round its questions went to the chat, which hid the gap.\n\nFor program-design-with-canvas I'll draft a section that says to talk on the canvas. It will copy design-with-canvas's \"Questions\" section, adapted to parts: a question goes inside the part it's about, on its right side, next to the items being discussed. Do you want the same change in test-design-with-canvas, with questions inside the tree and branch they're about instead of the top note?\n\nThat leaves three choices open:\n- **Item 4:** the agent's name. I proposed `consistency-checker`.\n- **Item 7:** whether the rule goes in nagara's `CLAUDE.md` or in `.mahou/`.\n- **Item 8:** whether the subagent rule goes in your global `CLAUDE.md` or in mahou basics."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2511,"cache_read_input_tokens":422431,"output_tokens":683,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":130},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2511,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":683,"cache_read_input_tokens":422431,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2511,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2511},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b01ce5de-8474-497e-b366-f35dc20c9308","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfwFvK1QK7H3uMkBynZnc","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7acc0bfb-e75b-4212-b934-caa8dbf02627","timestamp":"2026-10-11T22:43:17.530Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
