{"parentUuid":"075cd0ac-97ea-4324-8acc-189b8629f92c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwG1QUi24Df5KAzSZuC7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Noted: item 4's agent is `consistency-checker`, and item 8's `rm -rf` rule goes in `implement`, as a line in the brief's repository rules.\n\n**What item 7 is for:** the fake recipe agent used to live in the pipeline's production code, behind a `scriptedAgentReplies` setting. You ruled it must not reach production, so it moved into a test-only module that the vitest config swaps in. A build check confirmed `dist/` has no trace of it. Item 7 turns that ruling into a standing nagara rule: test doubles are wired in only through the test setup, never through a setting or branch the production bundle carries. It would land in one of two places:\n- **nagara's `CLAUDE.md`**, as a bullet in \"Code style\", read by anyone working on the code.\n- **nagara's `.mahou/implement.md`**, where only `mahou:implement` and its briefs pick it up.\n\nTwo answers before I draft:\n1. Item 7: `CLAUDE.md` or `.mahou/implement.md`?\n2. Should test-design-with-canvas get the same change as program-design-with-canvas, with questions inside the tree and branch they're about instead of the note at the top of the canvas?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":972,"cache_read_input_tokens":424942,"output_tokens":457,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":60},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":972,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":457,"cache_read_input_tokens":424942,"cache_creation_input_tokens":972,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":972},"type":"message"}],"spee