{"parentUuid":"b994aa9d-048c-4ab4-ac7c-4eb71ccc87a0","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14968717 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"e9acde4e-46c8-4768-b4aa-b200e8b119c1","timestamp":"2026-10-11T22:49:47.585Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14968717 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"e9acde4e-46c8-4768-b4aa-b200e8b119c1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwGRhjx1TFEtCJYuzmqJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ASE-84 is done. Four commits on `feat/cloudflare-migration`, `90515d1` through `8d2ca24`, move every D1 read and write onto Drizzle query functions in `common/src/db/`.\n\n- **Tests:** all pass, with lint and types clean and the pipeline build working.\n  - `common/`: 28. There are 11 new tests for the claims, the recipe versioning and `updateItem`.\n  - API: 56.\n  - pipeline: 136.\n- **Generated migration:** I compared it against the old `0001_initial.sql` by inserting bad values. The same inserts are rejected by every CHECK, unique pair and foreign key. The CHECKs now have names, and the unique pair is now a named index.\n- **Platform checks:** `readD1Migrations` handles drizzle's statement-breakpoint markers, and `.returning()` works for both claims on D1.\n- **CI:** the new check catches a column added without regenerating the migration.\n- **Small additions to the design:**\n  - a shared `mint-id.ts` for the three create functions\n  - the retry route also re-reads the item after a successful claim, so the 202 still returns the item as the claim left it\n  - one test now expects `cached: true` instead of `1`, as the design intended\n- **Live smoke test on a reset local state:** the subagent reports that the Modal key was removed during the run, so it went as far as `start synthesis` and then failed with a 401.\n  - It verified the enqueue insert, the fetch batch, recipe version 1, the describe batch with 3 cost rows, the status writes, and a retry claim.\n  - The store step didn't run live.\n  - `modal-proxy.env` is still on disk, so the key itself must have been removed or rotated in Modal.\n\nThe agentic review of the ASE-84 change is running now. The Drizzle docs are still uncommitted, and the learn drafts above are waiting on your call for each item."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":747,"cache_read_input_tokens":457136,"output_tokens":632,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":747,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":632,"cache_read_input_tokens":457136,"cache_creation_input_tokens":747,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":747},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"15550434-dd0c-467c-9a65-4224b4421d80","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfwGRhHuiDhupka9Es8ee","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"933754b5-dd52-42ea-bdad-8bf77f3dc50b","timestamp":"2026-10-11T22:49:55.491Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
