{"parentUuid":"370ba836-cb7e-42d8-97f2-cf3d2fc55bb3","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b4539a27-3dad-4a2a-9c7a-fa360e1c69df","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KrU28YLw8ZsrMuhGFUSj31","type":"tool_result","content":" M .github/workflows/cloudflare.yml\n M .mahou/wiki/INDEX.md\n M .mahou/wiki/cloudflare/INDEX.md\n M CLAUDE.md\n M common/package.json\n M common/src/db/items/write-status.ts\n M docs/technical-design/README.md\n M docs/technical-design/common-package.md\n M docs/technical-design/deployment-and-ci.md\n M docs/technical-design/invariants.md\n M docs/technical-design/item-contract.md\n M docs/technical-design/item-lifecycle.md\n M docs/technical-design/persistence-and-storage.md\n M docs/technical-design/recipes.md\n?? .mahou/wiki/cloudflare/drizzle-on-d1.md\nCLAUDE.md:26:common/    pnpm db:generate (migration from the schema) · pnpm migrate:local (D1 in the shared state folder)\nCLAUDE.md:132:  `pnpm db:generate` in `common/`. Write the backfill because the item Workflow persists the display list across the async gap: a later step or request\nCLAUDE.md:136:- **A schema change** → an edit to `common/src/db/schema.ts` and `pnpm db:generate` in `common/`,\ndocs/technical-design/deployment-and-ci.md:76:Each tree runs **test, lint and types as three parallel jobs** on pushes to `main`, path-filtered to its own directory (`api/**`, `pipeline/**`, `common/**`, `tts/**`), so a docs-only push, or a change to one tree, runs neither another tree's checks nor its deploy. A change to `common/` also runs the type checks of `api/` and `pipeline/` against the changed package, as part of `common/`'s checks. One more `common/` check runs `pnpm db:generate` and fails when it leaves a new or changed file under `common/migrations/`, so a schema edit committed without its migration never reaches the migrate job. The `api`, `pipeline` and `common` jobs install with `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` on Node 24 and run `pnpm test`, `pnpm lint` and `pnpm types`; the `tts` jobs provision the pinned toolchain (uv/ruff/ty/pytest, see the repository's `CLAUDE.md`) with `uv sync --frozen` against `tts/`'s lockfile.\n83:## Code style\n84-\n85-Follows the global style guide, plus:\n86-\n87-- **Payloads crossing a service boundary are typed**: what the Workers share (the item row, the unit\n88-  union, the item Workflow's params) is a TypeScript type in `common/`, and the TTS service's request\n89-  and return shapes are pydantic models in `tts/`. The Workers' types are checked when the code builds,\n90-  never at runtime: a value read back from D1 or received from Modal is trusted to match its type.\n91-- Everything both Workers use lives in `common/`; code that only `pipeline/` modules share stays in\n92-  `pipeline/`, in the module it belongs to, and the others import it from there. Each module inside\n93-  `pipeline/` is as independent of the others as it can be.\n94-- The database is the exception: every D1 read and write is a drizzle query function in\n95-  `common/src/db/`, one folder per table, even when only one Worker uses it. The functions follow one","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"1d39fab3-31a2-4f54-a7e8-227f59b7c598","timestamp":"2026-10-11T23:01:39.654Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":" M .github/workflows/cloudflare.yml\n M .mahou/wiki/INDEX.md\n M .mahou/wiki/cloudflare/INDEX.md\n M CLAUDE.md\n M common/package.json\n M common/src/db/items/write-status.ts\n M docs/technical-design/README.md\n M docs/technical-design/common-package.md\n M docs/technical-design/deployment-and-ci.md\n M docs/technical-design/invariants.md\n M docs/technical-design/item-contract.md\n M docs/technical-design/item-lifecycle.md\n M docs/technical-design/persistence-and-storage.md\n M docs/technical-design/recipes.md\n?? .mahou/wiki/cloudflare/drizzle-on-d1.md\nCLAUDE.md:26:common/    pnpm db:generate (migration from the schema) · pnpm migrate:local (D1 in the shared state folder)\nCLAUDE.md:132:  `pnpm db:generate` in `common/`. 