{"parentUuid":"f8a9ea3a-1b63-4f2d-9c3a-aa478fa0e2fc","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b4539a27-3dad-4a2a-9c7a-fa360e1c69df","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JQFf2V2ns6Za6VDHCiFNL8","type":"tool_result","content":"afe00bf refactor(common): check the schema against its migrations with db:check\nCLAUDE.md:26:common/    pnpm db:generate (migration from the schema) · pnpm db:check (schema and migrations agree) · pnpm migrate:local (D1 in the shared state folder)\nCLAUDE.md:99:- **A test double never reaches the production bundle.** The tests wire a fake in through the vitest\ndocs/technical-design/deployment-and-ci.md:76:Each tree runs **test, lint and types as three parallel jobs** on pushes to `main`, path-filtered to its own directory (`api/**`, `pipeline/**`, `common/**`, `tts/**`), so a docs-only push, or a change to one tree, runs neither another tree's checks nor its deploy. A change to `common/` also runs the type checks of `api/` and `pipeline/` against the changed package, as part of `common/`'s checks. One more `common/` check, `pnpm db:check`, runs drizzle-kit's generate and fails when it leaves a new or changed file under `common/migrations/`, so a schema edit committed without its migration never reaches the migrate job. The `api`, `pipeline` and `common` jobs install with `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` on Node 24 and run `pnpm test`, `pnpm lint` and `pnpm types`; the `tts` jobs provision the pinned toolchain (uv/ruff/ty/pytest, see the repository's `CLAUDE.md`) with `uv sync --frozen` against `tts/`'s lockfile.\ndocs/technical-design/persistence-and-storage.md:77:    gen[\"pnpm db:generate<br/>in common/\"]","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"b6487e33-975f-4740-8af6-c6a54d252970","timestamp":"2026-10-11T23:01:48.289Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"afe00bf refactor(common): check the schema against its migrations with db:check\nCLAUDE.md:26:common/    pnpm db:generate (migration from the schema) · pnpm db:check (schema and migrations agree) · pnpm migrate:local (D1 in the shared state folder)\nCLAUDE.md:99:- **A test double never reaches the production bundle.** The tests wire a fake in through the vitest\ndocs/technical-design/deployment-and-ci.md:76:Each tree runs **test, lint and types as three parallel jobs** on pushes to `main`, path-filtered to its own directory (`api/**`, `pipeline/**`, `common/**`, `tts/**`), so a docs-only push, or a change to one tree, runs neither another tree's checks nor its deploy. A change to `common/` also runs the type checks of `api/` and `pipeline/` against the changed package, as part of `common/`'s checks. One more `common/` check, `pnpm db:check`, runs drizzle-kit's generate and fails when it leaves a new or changed file under `common/migrations/`, so a schema edit committed without its migration never reaches the migrate job. The `api`, `pipeline` and `common` jobs install with `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` on Node 24 and run `pnpm test`, `pnpm lint` and `pnpm types`; the `tts` jobs provision the pinned toolchain (uv/ruff/ty/pytest, see the repository's `CLAUDE.md`) with `uv sync --frozen` against `tts/`'s lockfile.\ndocs/technical-design/persistence-and-storage.md:77:    gen[\"pnpm db:generate<br/>in common/\"]","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/docs/technical-design/deployment-and-ci.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":73,"oldLines":7,"newStart":73,"newLines":7,"lines":["     class push person"," ```"," ","-Each tree runs **test, lint and types as three parallel jobs** on pushes to `main`, path-filtered to its own directory (`api/**`, `pipeline/**`, `common/**`, `tts/**`), so a docs-only push, or a change to one tree, runs neither another tree's checks nor its deploy. A change to `common/` also runs the type checks of `api/` and `pipeline/` against the changed package, as part of `common/`'s checks. One more `common/` check runs `pnpm db:generate` and fails when it leaves a new or changed file under `common/migrations/`, so a schema edit committed without its migration never reaches the migrate job. The `api`, `pipeline` and `common` jobs install with `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` on Node 24 and run `pnpm test`, `pnpm lint` and `pnpm types`; the `tts` jobs provision the pinned toolchain (uv/ruff/ty/pytest, see the repository's `CLAUDE.md`) with `uv sync --frozen` against `tts/`'s lockfile.","+Each tree runs **test, lint and types as three parallel jobs** on pushes to `main`, path-filtered to its own directory (`api/**`, `pipeline/**`, `common/**`, `tts/**`), so a docs-only push, or a change to one tree, runs neither another tree's checks nor its deploy. A change to `common/` also runs the type checks of `api/` and `pipeline/` against the changed package, as part of `common/`'s checks. One more `common/` check, `pnpm db:check`, runs drizzle-kit's generate and fails when it leaves a new or changed file under `common/migrations/`, so a schema edit committed without its migration never reaches the migrate job. The `api`, `pipeline` and `common` jobs install with `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` on Node 24 and run `pnpm test`, `pnpm lint` and `pnpm types`; the `tts` jobs provision the pinned toolchain (uv/ruff/ty/pytest, see the repository's `CLAUDE.md`) with `uv sync --frozen` against `tts/`'s lockfile."," "," One workflow ships the Cloudflare side with `cloudflare/wrangler-action`. A paths filter decides which of `common/`, `pipeline/` and `api/` changed, and each changed tree's checks run. The deploy chain runs in a fixed order: the migrate job applies `common/`'s SQL migrations to D1 when `common/` changed, the pipeline job runs `pnpm build` and deploys `dist/nagara/wrangler.json` when `pipeline/` changed or the migration ran, and the API job deploys the API Worker when `api/` changed or the migration ran, after the pipeline deploy when that one runs. A `common/` change therefore redeploys both Workers, which compile it in, and a push that changes only `pipeline/` deploys only the pipeline. A job in the chain runs only when no job before it failed. A job skipped because its tree did not change does not stop the jobs after it. A failed `common/` check, the schema check included, stops all three: no migration, no pipeline deploy and no API deploy. A failed `pipeline/` check stops both Worker deploys, and a failed `api/` check stops the API deploy. The jobs authenticate with `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN` and `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID`. `tts` keeps its own workflow, with a **`deploy` job that depends on all three of its checks**, runs `modal deploy` and authenticates with `MODAL_TOKEN_ID` / `MODAL_TOKEN_SECRET`. All four are GitHub Actions secrets."," "]}]},{"filePath":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/CLAUDE.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":23,"oldLines":7,"newStart":23,"newLines":7,"lines":["            pnpm test · pnpm lint · pnpm types"," api/       pnpm dev (wrangler dev, 8788) · pnpm run deploy (prod, via wrangler)","            pnpm test · pnpm lint · pnpm types","-common/    pnpm db:generate (migration from the schema) · pnpm migrate:local (D1 in the shared state folder)","+common/    pnpm db:generate (migration from the schema) · pnpm db:check (schema and migrations agree) · pnpm migrate:local (D1 in the shared state folder)","            pnpm test · pnpm lint · pnpm types"," web/       pnpm dev · pnpm test · pnpm build · pnpm biome check      (not yet built)"," ```"]},{"oldStart":96,"oldLines":6,"newStart":96,"newLines":9,"lines":["   naming pattern, `get<Model>`, `list<Models>`, `create<Model>`, `update<Model>` and","   `delete<Model>`, plus a conditional write named for what it does (`claimRetry`) when a plain update","   cannot express it. No route or step writes SQL.","+- **A test double never reaches the production bundle.** The tests wire a fake in through the vitest","+  configuration, such as a module the config substitutes, never through a setting or a branch the","+  deployed code carries. After a build, `dist/` contains none of the fake's code."," - Comments explain **why**, never what; do not add narration alongside a comment that is already there","   for a non-obvious reason."," - A new or changed note is created from `docs/_templates/note.md`; rationale goes in a `> [!NOTE]`"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/docs/technical-design/deployment-and-ci.md","/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/CLAUDE.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"dc5ae430-6c7a-4d33-8d80-e1f69cb899d0","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","root":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","branch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":14,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"filadd/cc-plugin-marketplace","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","platform":"linux"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f8a9ea3a-1b63-4f2d-9c3a-aa478fa0e2fc","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
