{"parentUuid":"fca7a9ec-eb74-4497-b956-b53a1f08e799","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwJGWegDuhYmcktjCrQq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The ORM follow-ups are done. Five commits, `827574f` through `da7b32e`, and the tree is clean.\n\n- **Writes return the row.** Every create and update now returns the row it wrote. Ids and timestamps are schema defaults.\n- **Atomic writes** are in `common/src/db/operations/`, one per step that batches:\n\n  | Function | What it writes in one batch | Called by |\n  |---|---|---|\n  | `recordFetch` | instance id and domain, plus the Firecrawl cost row | fetch step |\n  | `recordDescriptions` | units and degradations, plus one cost row per description | describe step |\n  | `recordAudio` | the ready write, plus the TTS cost row | store step |\n\n  No route or step calls `db.batch` any more.\n- **Claims** return the claimed row, or null when they lose. The retry route reads at most twice.\n- **Tests:**\n  - All pass: `common/` 38, API 56, pipeline 136.\n  - Each operation has a test that a failing cost row rolls back the whole batch.\n  - The migration is unchanged, and `db:check` passes.\n- **Docs** are committed: the `CLAUDE.md` database rule, the `common-package.md` functions section with two new callouts, a sentence in `item-lifecycle.md`, and the wiki entry.\n\nSide effects worth knowing:\n- **Timestamps:** a new item's `created_at`, `updated_at` and `queued_at` now come from separate clock reads, so they can differ by a millisecond.\n- **`createCostEntry`:** no Worker calls it now, only tests, because the steps write cost rows through the operations.\n- **Retry 404:** if a row were deleted right after a lost retry claim, the route would now answer 404.\n\nThe Plannotator review opened before the two doc commits landed, so it may not show `c7a1aee` and `da7b32e`. If you want to review those too, close it and I'll reopen it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3239,"cache_read_input_tokens":485038,"output_tokens":697,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":57},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3239,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":697,"cache_read_input_tokens":485038,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3239,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3239},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"06dcd469-2518-4f39-8431-dc75225c6516","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfwJGWHc23x68E3EGgdK1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b6a74e87-654d-4093-b0b3-337c4280be14","timestamp":"2026-10-11T23:14:05.033Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
