{"parentUuid":"325fc72f-5d7c-4cb4-aa8d-45483903d6a2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfwc1ZYUz2UosdJkoBqJf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I rewrote ASE-83 as a six-step checklist (credentials, Cloudflare resources, deploy, end-to-end test on workers.dev, cutover, cleanup) and moved it to In Progress: https://linear.app/asermax/issue/ASE-83\n\nThe Cloudflare account has no D1 databases or R2 buckets yet, so `nagara` is free for both.\n\n## What I need from you\n\nPut each credential in `.scratch/cloudflare-migration/prod-secrets.env` as `KEY=value`, one per line, using your editor or terminal. I copy them into wrangler secrets by key name and never print them.\n\n1. **`API_KEY`**: do you want to reuse Railway's key so existing clients keep working, or create a new one?\n2. **R2 tokens**: two tokens, both scoped to the `nagara` bucket. I need the bucket created before you can make them.\n   - Object Read only: `R2_GET_ACCESS_KEY_ID` / `R2_GET_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`\n   - Object Read & Write: `R2_PUT_ACCESS_KEY_ID` / `R2_PUT_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`\n3. **Modal proxy token**: a new one, as `MODAL_PROXY_KEY` / `MODAL_PROXY_SECRET`. The token from local validation looks revoked.\n4. **Firecrawl, Gemini and the AI Gateway token**: should I copy the ones in `pipeline/.dev.vars`, or will you add separate production keys to the file?\n\n## Decisions to confirm\n\n5. **Names**: is `nagara` right for both the D1 database and the R2 bucket?\n6. **Railway breaks early**: deploying `tts/` to Modal replaces the `nagara-tts` app that Railway calls. The new app's `synthesize` has a different signature, so Railway stops generating audio from that deploy until the cutover. Is that acceptable, or should I deploy the new TTS under a temporary app name while we test?\n7. **Go-ahead for step 2**: should I create the D1 database and the R2 bucket now? I'd also put the D1 id into the three `wrangler.jsonc` files and commit it. You can then make the R2 tokens while I wait for the rest."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":413,"cache_read_input_tokens":86967,"output_tokens":1004,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":243},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":413,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1004,"cache_read_input_tokens":86967,"cache_creation_input_tokens":413,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":413},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"cef81788-29d4-4f6d-8346-0899f7ad529b","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfwc1ZC9jbPvLL5gkdtdZ","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"1f58a257-786f-410e-91f1-fc99707064f2","timestamp":"2026-10-12T03:06:46.400Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
