{"parentUuid":"55f60785-97c7-4a2a-bca4-c99825bd8058","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwcM4b2ADTUvpvdhFJa7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I wrote the template to `.scratch/cloudflare-migration/prod-secrets.env`. Git ignores it through `.scratch` in your global gitignore. Every key has a short comment saying where its value comes from.\n\nFirecrawl, Gemini and the AI Gateway token can stay empty, and I'll copy them from `pipeline/.dev.vars`. The two R2 token pairs need the bucket to exist first, so leave them empty until I've created it.\n\nBefore I create the D1 database and R2 bucket, I still need your answers on three things:\n- **Names:** is `nagara` right for both the D1 database and the R2 bucket?\n- **Railway during the test:** deploying the new TTS stops Railway from generating audio until the cutover. Is that acceptable, or should I deploy it under a temporary Modal app name while we test?\n- **Go-ahead:** can I create the database and bucket now?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":621,"cache_read_input_tokens":88738,"output_tokens":296,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":621,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":296,"cache_read_input_tokens":88738,"cache_creation_input_tokens":621,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":621},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7fdbb7b7-09ae-4f96-84dd-5124517d03c3","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfwcM4EvKioUekSCAycBZ","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":