image or a nested list gets no line. The derivation strips a task-list checkbox and reads struck-through text as its words, with no sign of the strike. Emphasis markers and link destinations are dropped throughout.\ndocs/technical-design/article-extraction.md:68:The `\"Code sample.\"` placeholder is the **interim** spoken form of a code block. During the describe step the describer overwrites a code unit's spoken form with `Code: <one sentence>` and a describable image's with `Image: <one sentence>`; a code block keeps the floor `\"Code with no description.\"` only when the describer fails or the per-item budget is spent.\ndocs/technical-design/article-extraction.md:84:What the rule catches is a section-break ornament (`❦`, `* * *`, `§`) or bare punctuation that a recipe emitted as its own paragraph. A code unit always passes, because its spoken form is the `\"Code sample.\"` placeholder.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/common/wrangler.jsonc","hunks":[{"oldStart":2,"oldLines":12,"newStart":2,"newLines":11,"lines":["   \"$schema\": \"node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json\",","   \"name\": \"nagara-common\",","   \"compatibility_date\": \"2026-09-01\",","-  // The all-zero database_id is a placeholder until the production D1 database exists.","   \"d1_databases\": [","     {","       \"binding\": \"DB\",","       \"database_name\": \"nagara\",","-      \"database_id\": \"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000\",","+      \"database_id\": \"bdc5b6b3-724f-47df-8733-640fd263cd2f\",","       \"migrations_dir\": \"migrations\"","     }","   ]"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/api/wrangler.jsonc","hunks":[{"oldStart":6,"oldLines":12,"newStart":6,"newLines":11,"lines":["   \"compatibility_flags\": [\"nodejs_compat\"],","   \"routes\": [{ \"pattern\": \"nagara.asermax.com\", \"custom_domain\": true }],","   \"dev\": { \"port\": 8788 },","-  