 401","new_string":"- [x] Check that `https://asermax--nagara-tts-web.modal.run/{start,result}` answers 401"},{"op":"replace","old_string":"- [ ] Migrations:","new_string":"- [x] Migrations:"},{"op":"replace","old_string":"- [ ] Pipeline: `pnpm run deploy`","new_string":"- [x] Pipeline: `pnpm run deploy`"},{"op":"replace","old_string":"- [ ] API: `pnpm run deploy` in `api/`","new_string":"- [x] API (`https://nagara-api.asermax.workers.dev`): `pnpm run deploy` in `api/`"},{"op":"replace","old_string":"- [ ] `/health` answers 200.","new_string":"- [x] `/health` answers 200."}]}},"serverClassifierRequest":"8fc6d4e8-0550-4eba-ba26-b60dfc50c34a","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfwdVzJRExu9vGe2CH23i","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"1af30b26-ada0-48aa-be3d-cd8f4f808f84","timestamp":"2026-10-12T03:26:16.709Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"1af30b26-ada0-48aa-be3d-cd8f4f808f84","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"cf780016-c0dd-439c-a778-311c3d46f3e1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NRmAUFkUoxRFqboNJ54f2X","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"ASE-83\",\"uuid\":\"88a75223-8f1b-4fdd-bc3a-206276da0f5f\",\"title\":\"Switch nagara over to Cloudflare and retire Railway\",\"description\":\"Bring the migrated stack up in production and remove what it replaces. The first deploy is manual. The API runs on its [workers.dev](<http://workers.dev>) URL until the end-to-end test passes. Only then does `nagara.asermax.com` move to it and Railway get deleted.\\n\\nNotes: `docs/technical-design/deployment-and-ci.md`, `docs/technical-design/authentication.md`, `docs/technical-design/persistence-and-storage.md`.\\n\\nBranch: `feat/cloudflare-migration`.\\n\\n## 1. Credentials (user)\\n\\nEach one goes into `.scratch/cloudflare-migration/prod-secrets.env`, keyed by name, and never into the chat.\\n\\n- [X] `API_KEY`: the clients' key. Reuse Railway's or create a new one.\\n- [X] `R2_GET_ACCESS_KEY_ID` / `R2_GET_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`: an R2 API token with Object Read only, scoped to the `nagara` bucket. Used by the API.\\n- [X] `R2_PUT_ACCESS_KEY_ID` / `R2_PUT_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`: an R2 API token with Object Read & Write, scoped to the `nagara` bucket. Used by the pipeline.\\n- [X] `MODAL_PROXY_KEY` / `MODAL_PROXY_SECRET`: a new Modal proxy auth token. The local-validation token was revoked.\\n- [X] `FIRECRAWL_API_KEY`, `GEMINI_API_KEY`, `CLOUDFLARE_API_KEY` (AI Gateway token). `CLOUDFLARE_API_KEY` keeps the value the old `nagara` Worker already had.\\n\\n## 2. Cloudflare resources\\n\\n- [X] `wrangler d1 create nagara` (id `bdc5b6b3-724f-47df-8733-640fd263cd2f`, region ENAM), then put its id in place of the all-zero placeholder in `common/`, `api/` and `pipeline/` `wrangler.jsonc`, and commit.\\n- [X] `wrangler r2 bucket create nagara`.\\n- [X] Create the two R2 tokens from step 1, which needs the bucket to exist.\\n\\n## 3. Deploy\\n\\n- [X] tts: `uv run modal deploy app.py` in `tts/`. This replaces the `nagara-tts` app that Railway calls, so Railway stops synthesizing from this point.\\n- [X] Check that `https://asermax--nagara-tts-web.modal.run/{start,result}` answers 401 without proxy auth. Fix `MODAL_START_URL`/`MODAL_RESULT_URL` if the URL differs.\\n- [X] Migrations: `wrangler d1 migrations apply nagara --remote` from `common/`.\\n- [X] Pipeline: `pnpm run deploy` in `pipeline/`, then `wrangler secret put` for its 7 secrets. This replaces the old extraction-service `nagara` Worker. The v2 tag deletes JobIndex.\\n- [X] API (`https://nagara-api.asermax.workers.dev`): `pnpm run deploy` in `api/` with the custom-domain route removed locally and `workers_dev: true`. The change stays uncommitted. Then `wrangler secret put` for its 3 secrets.\\n\\n## 4. End-to-end test against [workers.dev](<http://workers.dev>)\\n\\nUse small articles, and listen to every audio.\\n\\n- [X] `/health` answers 200. D25: a poll without the key gets 401.\\n- [ ] D1: enqueue with a voice, and the item goes queued → generating → ready.\\n- [ ] C7: the first article of a new domain authors version 1 of its recipe.\\n- [ ] B1 / D20: the audio sits in R2, and the 307 URL plays and seeks in a browser.\\n- [ ] D21: the audio route of a generating item answers 404.\\n- [ ] D13: force a describe failure with a temporarily wrong `GEMINI_API_KEY`, restore the key, retry, and the item reaches ready.\\n- [ ] D16: a fourth retry answers 409.\\n- [ ] C1, C5, C9 and C11 where a real page reaches them.\\n\\n## 5. Cutover (only after step 4 passes)\\n\\n- [ ] Restore the custom-domain route, deploy the API, and point `nagara.asermax.com` at the API Worker.\\n- [ ] Remove the Cloudflare Access application and its service token from the pipeline.\\n- [ ] Delete the Railway API service, Postgres and bucket. Nothing is copied over.\\n- [ ] Add the GitHub secrets `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN` and `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID`, then merge, so CI deploys.\\n\\n## 6. Cleanup\\n\\n- [ ] Revoke the R2 tokens from the spikes.\\n- [ ] Delete the stopped Modal apps `nagara-tts-spike` and `nagara-spike-upload`.\\n- [ ] Delete `.scratch/cloudflare-migration/modal-proxy.env` and `prod-secrets.env`.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"1f715c70-f21d-466d-92a3-ef263db6955e\",\"name\":\"Cloudflare migration\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/asermax/issue/ASE-83/switch-nagara-over-to-cloudflare-and-retire-railway\",\"gitBranchName\":\"asermax/ase-83-switch-nagara-over-to-cloudflare-and-retire-railway\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:48.076Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-12T03:26:18.443Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-12T03:06:28.786Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Progress\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"Improvement\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Agustin Carrasco\",\"createdById\":\"c8b03f1c-0b66-413e-85b8-f11067346ca8\",\"project\":\"nagara\",\"projectId\":\"14d108e2-6712-4129-b37d-e021d5aa2f0b\",\"team\":\"Asermax\",\"teamId\":\"c821b24b-23d9-403e-9038-23d9024a2110\"}"}]}]},"uuid":"c69e4b3f-4c3f-4034-aaca-e8206f294d8f","timestamp":"2026-10-12T03:26:19.241Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"ASE-83\",\"uuid\":\"88a75223-8f1b-4fdd-bc3a-206276da0f5f\",\"title\":\"Switch nagara over to Cloudflare and retire Railway\",\"description\":\"Bring the migrated stack up in production and remove what it replaces. The first deploy is manual. The API runs on its [workers.dev](<http://workers.dev>) URL until the end-to-end test passes. Only then does `nagara.asermax.com` move to it and Railway get deleted.\\n\\nNotes: `docs/technical-design/deployment-and-ci.md`, `docs/technical-design/authentication.md`, `docs/technical-design/persistence-and-storage.md`.\\n\\nBranch: `feat/cloudflare-migration`.\\n\\n## 1. Credentials (user)\\n\\nEach one goes into `.scratch/cloudflare-migration/prod-secrets.env`, keyed by name, and never into the chat.\\n\\n- [X] `API_KEY`: the clients' key. Reuse Railway's or create a new one.\\n- [X] `R2_GET_ACCESS_KEY_ID` / `R2_GET_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`: an R2 API token with Object Read only, scoped to the `nagara` bucket. Used by the API.\\n- [X] `R2_PUT_ACCESS_KEY_ID` / `R2_PUT_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`: an R2 API token with Object Read & Write, scoped to the `nagara` bucket. Used by the pipeline.\\n- [X] `MODAL_PROXY_KEY` / `MODAL_PROXY_SECRET`: a new Modal proxy auth token. The local-validation token was revoked.\\n- [X] `FIRECRAWL_API_KEY`, `GEMINI_API_KEY`, `CLOUDFLARE_API_KEY` (AI Gateway token). `CLOUDFLARE_API_KEY` keeps the value the old `nagara` Worker already had.\\n\\n## 2. Cloudflare resources\\n\\n- [X] `wrangler d1 create nagara` (id `bdc5b6b3-724f-47df-8733-640fd263cd2f`, region ENAM), then put its id in place of the all-zero placeholder in `common/`, `api/` and `pipeline/` `wrangler.jsonc`, and commit.\\n- [X] `wrangler r2 bucket create nagara`.\\n- [X] Create the two R2 tokens from step 1, which needs the bucket to exist.\\n\\n## 3. Deploy\\n\\n- [X] tts: `uv run modal deploy app.py` in `tts/`. This replaces the `nagara-tts` app that Railway calls, so Railway stops synthesizing from this point.\\n- [X] Check that `https://asermax--nagara-tts-web.modal.run/{start,result}` answers 401 without proxy auth. Fix `MODAL_START_URL`/`MODAL_RESULT_URL` if the URL differs.\\n- [X] Migrations: `wrangler d1 migrations apply nagara --remote` from `common/`.\\n- [X] Pipeline: `pnpm run deploy` in `pipeline/`, then `wrangler secret put` for its 7 secrets. This replaces the old extraction-service `nagara` Worker. The v2 tag deletes JobIndex.\\n- [X] API (`https://nagara-api.asermax.workers.dev`): `pnpm run deploy` in `api/` with the custom-domain route removed locally and `workers_dev: true`. The change stays uncommitted. Then `wrangler secret put` for its 3 secrets.\\n\\n## 4. End-to-end test against [workers.dev](<http://workers.dev>)\\n\\nUse small articles, and listen to every audio.\\n\\n- [X] `/health` answers 200. D25: a poll without the key gets 401.\\n- [ ] D1: enqueue with a voice, and the item goes queued → generating → ready.\\n- [ ] C7: the first article of a new domain authors version 1 of its recipe.\\n- [ ] B1 / D20: the audio sits in R2, and the 307 URL plays and seeks in a browser.\\n- [ ] D21: the audio route of a generating item answers 404.\\n- [ ] D13: force a describe failure with a temporarily wrong `GEMINI_API_KEY`, restore the key, retry, and the item reaches ready.\\n- [ ] D16: a fourth retry answers 409.\\n- [ ] C1, C5, C9 and C11 where a real page reaches them.\\n\\n## 5. Cutover (only after step 4 passes)\\n\\n- [ ] Restore the custom-domain route, deploy the API, and point `nagara.asermax.com` at the API Worker.\\n- [ ] Remove the Cloudflare Access application and its service token from the pipeline.\\n- [ ] Delete the Railway API service, Postgres and bucket. Nothing is copied over.\\n- [ ] Add the GitHub secrets `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN` and `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID`, then merge, so CI deploys.\\n\\n## 6. Cleanup\\n\\n- [ ] Revoke the R2 tokens from the spikes.\\n- [ ] Delete the stopped Modal apps `nagara-tts-spike` and `nagara-spike-upload`.\\n- [ ] Delete `.scratch/cloudflare-migration/modal-proxy.env` and `prod-secrets.env`.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"1f715c70-f21d-466d-92a3-ef263db6955e\",\"name\":\"Cloudflare migration\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/asermax/issue/ASE-83/switch-nagara-over-to-cloudflare-and-retire-railway\",\"gitBranchName\":\"asermax/ase-83-switch-nagara-over-to-cloudflare-and-retire-railway\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-11T06:01:48.076Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-12T03:26:18.443Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-12T03:06:28.786Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Progress\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"Improvement\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Agustin Carrasco\",\"createdById\":\"c8b03f1c-0b66-413e-85b8-f11067346ca8\",\"project\":\"nagara\",\"projectId\":\"14d108e2-6712-4129-b37d-e021d5aa2f0b\",\"team\":\"Asermax\",\"teamId\":\"c821b24b-23d9-403e-9038-23d9024a2110\"}"}],"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"8fc6d4e8-0550-4eba-ba26-b60dfc50c34a","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","root":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","branch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"asermax/nagara","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"filadd/cc-plugin-marketplace","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","platform":"linux"}},"mcpMeta":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}],"version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app"}}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1af30b26-ada0-48aa-be3d-cd8f4f808f84","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":