{"parentUuid":"5127e735-5f70-4efb-b553-05a424b9cc33","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"19b40293-994e-4c6d-b7db-62896f2e9f52","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CtDoFk8WyAz3CkDJf52QXd","type":"tool_result","content":"B1.md\nC11.md\nC1.md\nC5.md\nC7.md\nC9.md\nD13.md\nD16.md\nD1.md\nD20.md\nD21.md\nD25.md\nD4.md\nD5.md\nheader.md\nsetup.md\nsummary.md\nrows/D13.md\nrows/summary.md\n## D13 a failed item, retried, reaches ready\nHow the failure was made, without code changes: `modal serve` was stopped (SIGINT to its process group) and its ephemeral app `ap-OKMiJR32qbZ85A2PLB5HFl` stopped with `modal app stop`, so the dev endpoint answered 404. The item `https://eli.thegreenplace.net/2026/monte-carlo-simulations/` (itm_e1efb577) was enqueued, extracted, described and failed in its start synthesis step after its three attempts. `modal serve` was then started again (same dev URL, new ephemeral app) and the item retried.\n```\n11:39:57 {\"id\": \"itm_e1efb577\", \"status\": \"queued\", \"current_step\": \"fetch\", \"error\": null}\n11:40:01 {\"id\": \"itm_e1efb577\", \"status\": \"generating\", \"current_step\": \"recipe\", \"error\": null}\n11:40:54 {\"id\": \"itm_e1efb577\", \"status\": \"generating\", \"current_step\": \"describe\", \"error\": null}\n11:40:57 {\"id\": \"itm_e1efb577\", \"status\": \"generating\", \"current_step\": \"start synthesis\", \"error\": null}\n11:41:15 {\"id\": \"itm_e1efb577\", \"status\": \"failed\", \"current_step\": \"start synthesis\", \"error\": \"modal start answered 404\"}\n11:41:30 {\"id\": \"itm_e1efb577\", \"status\": \"generating\", \"current_step\": \"start synthesis\", \"error\": null}\n11:41:37 {\"id\": \"itm_e1efb577\", \"status\": \"generating\", \"current_step\": \"wait for synthesis\", \"error\": null}\n11:42:39 {\"id\": \"itm_e1efb577\", \"status\": \"ready\", \"current_step\": null, \"error\": null}\n```\nBefore the retry: `{\"status\": \"failed\", \"current_step\": \"start synthesis\", \"error\": \"modal start answered 404\", \"retry_count\": 0, \"queued_at\": \"2026-10-11T14:39:57.472Z\"}`\nCall: `POST /items/itm_e1efb577/retry` with the key:\n```\n202\t{\"id\":\"itm_e1efb577\",\"url\":\"https://eli.thegreenplace.net/2026/monte-carlo-simulations/\",\"title\":\"Monte-Carlo simulations\",\"status\":\"queued\",\"voice\":\"af_heart\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11T14:39:57.472Z\",\"duration\":null,\"units\":null,\"error\":null,\"audio_url\":null}\n```\nRight after: `{\"status\": \"generating\", \"current_step\": \"start synthesis\", \"error\": null, \"retry_count\": 1, \"queued_at\": \"2026-10-11T14:41:29.266Z\"}`: queued_at rewritten, retry_count + 1, the error cleared, and the instance restarted from the step that failed (start synthesis, not fetch).\nAfter: `{\"title\": \"Monte-Carlo simulations\", \"status\": \"ready\", \"current_step\": null, \"error\": null, \"retry_count\": 1, \"duration\": 674.1}`. Ledger `{\"types\": \"firecrawl,describer,describer,tts\"}`: one firecrawl row and the describer rows of the first run only, so fetch and describe did not run again.\nThe failed step was start synthesis rather than describe: a describe child never fails its step, so describe cannot be made to fail through its inputs. The row's point, a failed item retried from the step that failed reaches ready, holds.\nResult: PASS","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"c089f412-2245-46da-ad24-190ed0cc834d","timestamp":"2026-10-12T03:28:10.761Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"B1.md\nC11.md\nC1.md\nC5.md\nC7.md\nC9.md\nD13.md\nD16.md\nD1.md\nD20.md\nD21.md\nD25.md\nD4.md\nD5.md\nheader.md\nsetup.md\nsummary.md\nrows/D13.md\nrows/summary.md\n## D13 a failed item, retried, reaches ready\nHow the failure was made, without code changes: `modal serve` was stopped (SIGINT to its process group) and its ephemeral app `ap-OKMiJR32qbZ85A2PLB5HFl` stopped with `modal app stop`, so the dev endpoint answered 404. The item `https://eli.thegreenplace.net/2026/monte-carlo-simulations/` (itm_e1efb57