{"parentUuid":"fe42f20d-7af0-4072-98b9-7a1ab2335d3e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwdhsWDmwgUXpJtUXCub","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":888,"cache_read_input_tokens":128974,"output_tokens":1062,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":16},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":888,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1062,"cache_read_input_tokens":128974,"cache_creation_input_tokens":888,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":888},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":6550,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"34284573-fd43-4c5c-b40f-412367845714","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfwdhs6fFYcJeGj31D1Ss","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ced6cc30-a800-42c3-8ed3-c24cf6554a8d","timestamp":"2026-10-12T03:28:57.581Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/reports/validation","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"ced6cc30-a800-42c3-8ed3-c24cf6554a8d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwdhsWDmwgUXpJtUXCub","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The stack is deployed and the first item went through end to end. I stopped at the retry rows because two of my actions were blocked: setting the wrong Modal secret, and the Linear update recording this round's results.\n\n**Deployed:**\n- **TTS:** the new app is deployed to Modal at `https://asermax--nagara-tts-web.modal.run`. It answers 401 without the proxy token and reaches the handler with it.\n- **D1:** the production database has `0000_initial.sql` applied, which created `items`, `recipe_versions` and `cost_entries`.\n- **Pipeline:** the new `nagara` Worker is deployed with all 7 secrets. `CLOUDFLARE_API_KEY` is the value the old Worker already had.\n- **API:** `nagara-api` runs at `https://nagara-api.asermax.workers.dev` with its 3 secrets. The custom-domain route is swapped for `workers_dev: true` in `api/wrangler.jsonc`, a change that stays uncommitted.\n\n**Tests passed:**\n\n| Row | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `/health` | 200 |\n| D25 | a poll without the key gets 401 |\n| D1 | `sive.rs/hellyeah` with `af_bella` went queued → generating → ready in about 90 s: 6 units, 40.75 s |\n| C7 | version 1 of the `sive.rs` recipe was authored and linked to the item; the cost ledger has a Firecrawl row and a TTS row |\n| D21 | the audio route answered 404 while the item was generating |\n| B1 / D20 | 307 to R2 signed for 3600 s; R2 serves `audio/ogg` with byte ranges; the file is 40.76 s |\n\n**Waiting on you:**\n- **Listen:** the audio is at `.scratch/cloudflare-migration/prod/itm_961ed933.ogg`, for example with `! mpv .scratch/cloudflare-migration/prod/itm_961ed933.ogg`.\n- **D13 and D16 plan:** a wrong `GEMINI_API_KEY` can't fail an item, because a describer failure only degrades it. So I'd temporarily set `MODAL_PROXY_SECRET` on the pipeline to a wrong value, which makes start synthesis fail. Then I'd enqueue two short `sive.rs` posts:\n  - Item A: retry it three times while it keeps failing, and a fourth retry should answer 409 (D16).\n  - Item B: restore the real secret from `prod-secrets.env`, retry, and it should reach `ready` (D13).\n\n  The auto-mode classifier blocked the `wrangler secret put`. If you approve the plan, allow that command, or run the wrong-secret step yourself with `! cd pipeline && echo wrong | npx wrangler secret put MODAL_PROXY_SECRET --name nagara` and I'll do the rest.\n- **Linear:** the classifier also blocked updating ASE-83's checklist with these results. The earlier updates went through. Can I retry it?\n\nStill to run: C1, C5, C9 and C11, plus the cutover in step 5."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":888,"cache_read_input_tokens":128974,"output_tokens":1062,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":16},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":888,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1062,"cache_read_input_tokens":128974,"cache_creation_input_tokens":888,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":888},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"34284573-fd43-4c5c-b40f-412367845714","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfwdhs6fFYcJeGj31D1Ss","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8e232041-a841-4cc5-91ab-b23d2c235dda","timestamp":"2026-10-12T03:28:59.421Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/