{"parentUuid":"106d4106-e6ca-4d7c-9d01-90f4f7cd7d58","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfweGVre8pQUphyy1haTS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The describer calls Gemini through the AI Gateway's Google AI Studio provider endpoint (`pipeline/src/describe/core.ts:16`). The URL is `https://gateway.ai.cloudflare.com/v1/<account>/nagara/google-ai-studio/v1beta/models/gemini-3.5-flash-lite:generateContent`.\n\n- **Two credentials go on each request.** `x-goog-api-key` carries our own `GEMINI_API_KEY`, which the gateway passes through to Google. `cf-aig-authorization` carries `CLOUDFLARE_API_KEY`, the token for the authenticated `nagara` gateway.\n- **Google bills our key directly.** The gateway doesn't store the Gemini key and doesn't use Cloudflare's unified billing.\n- **The gateway adds logging, analytics and caching.** The describer reads the `cf-aig-cache-status` header, and a `HIT` is recorded as `cached` on the cost ledger row.\n- **The Flue agents use the same gateway** for Workers AI (GLM), and send only `cf-aig-authorization`.\n\nItem B's retry with the restored secret is still running. I'll report D13 when it settles."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1492,"cache_read_input_tokens":136476,"output_tokens":547,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":142},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1492,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":547,"cache_read_input_tokens":136476,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1492,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1492},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":