{"parentUuid":"a26356ae-8cc9-493d-b61d-03f87fc00046","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"846cd608-f589-4070-ab03-34264ca2b2e0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LGio39rcQejTHQGX6YDLRZ","type":"tool_result","content":"docs/technical-design/image-and-code-describer.md:119:The Gemini key is stored on the gateway as a provider key, and the gateway adds it to each call it forwards to Gemini. The pipeline Worker holds only the AI Gateway token, as a secret, and sends it on every call. A failed or capped unit made no billable call, so only a successful describe writes a ledger row.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e3180329-30be-450e-ad31-037737a00088","timestamp":"2026-10-12T03:39:48.667Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"docs/technical-design/image-and-code-describer.md:119:The Gemini key is stored on the gateway as a provider key, and the gateway adds it to each call it forwards to Gemini. The pipeline Worker holds only the AI Gateway token, as a secret, and sends it on every call. A failed or capped unit made no billable call, so only a successful describe writes a ledger row.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/pipeline/src/describe/core.ts","hunks":[{"oldStart":23,"oldLines":7,"newStart":23,"newLines":6,"lines":["     method: \"POST\",","     headers: {","       \"content-type\": \"application/json\",","-      \"x-goog-api-key\": env.GEMINI_API_KEY,","       \"cf-aig-authorization\": `Bearer ${env.CLOUDFLARE_API_KEY}`,","     },","     body: JSON.stringify({"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/pipeline/worker-configuration.d.ts","hunks":[{"oldStart":37,"oldLines":7,"newStart":37,"newLines":6,"lines":[" ","     CLOUDFLARE_API_KEY: string;","     FIRECRAWL_API_KEY: string;","-    GEMINI_API_KEY: string;","     MODAL_PROXY_KEY: string;","     MODAL_PROXY_SECRET: string;","     R2_PUT_ACCESS_KEY_ID: string;"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/pipeline/vitest.config.ts","hunks":[{"oldStart":43,"oldLines":7,"newStart":43,"newLines":6,"lines":["           MODAL_RESULT_URL: \"https://modal.test/result\",","           CLOUDFLARE_API_KEY: \"test-gateway-token\",","           FIRECRAWL_API_KEY: \"test-firecrawl-key\",","-          GEMINI_API_KEY: \"test-gemini-key\",","           MODAL_PROXY_KEY: \"test-modal-key\",","           MODAL_PROXY_SECRET: \"test-modal-secret\",","           R2_PUT_ACCESS_KEY_ID: \"test-access-key\","]}]},{"filePath":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/pipeline/.dev.vars.example","hunks":[{"oldStart":4,"oldLines":7,"newStart":4,"newLines":6,"lines":[" # Secrets"," CLOUDFLARE_API_KEY="," FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=","-GEMINI_API_KEY="," MODAL_PROXY_KEY="," MODAL_PROXY_SECRET="," "]}]},{"filePath":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/docs/technical-design/image-and-code-describer.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":116,"oldLines":7,"newStart":116,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," **A failed description degrades the unit and never fails the item.** A unit whose child step failed gets a `describe failed` degradation and floors (code) or keeps the fallback (image). The describe phase never fails the item, even when every description failed: a code-bearing item whose Gemini calls all failed reaches `ready` with every code block on the floor `\"Code with no description.\"` and a degradation for each."," ","-The pipeline Worker holds the Gemini key and the AI Gateway token as secrets. A failed or capped unit made no billable call, so only a successful describe writes a ledger row.","+The Gemini key is stored on the gateway as a provider key, and the gateway adds it to each call it forwards to Gemini. The pipeline Worker holds only the AI Gateway token, as a secret, and sends it on every call. A failed or capped unit made no billable call, so only a successful describe writes a ledger row."," "," ## ⏩ What is not built yet"," "]}]}],"moreFiles":1,"changedFiles":["/home/agus/wo