{"parentUuid":"238c0d68-675b-4f47-b8b0-a92ced888b84","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14978465 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"e49daf4e-0be8-4268-8572-5d64e70fe144","timestamp":"2026-10-12T03:44:59.760Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14978465 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/prod","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"e49daf4e-0be8-4268-8572-5d64e70fe144","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwewLpm2fZj2GLAyNSfk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Every end-to-end row now passes in production, including the Gemini calls through the gateway's provider key.\n\n| Row | Item | Result |\n|---|---|---|\n| D16 | `itm_7f1e5d4e` (sive.rs/obvious) | failed 3 times with the wrong Modal secret; the 4th retry answered 409 `retry limit reached (3)` |\n| D13 | `itm_dc5289f5` (sive.rs/d22) | after I restored the secret, the retry restarted at start synthesis and reached `ready`; fetch and describe didn't run again |\n| C9 | danluu.com home page | failed at the recipe step with \"the page is not an article\" |\n| C5 | two eli.thegreenplace.net posts | the second waited `queued` at `lease` until the first released it after the recipe step, then both reached `ready` |\n| C1 real | the eli watgo post | `ready`, 246 s: 3 `code` units, 1 image, 17 paragraphs |\n| C1 synthetic | tunnel page | `ready`, 96 s: SVG and raster described, the good alt kept verbatim, the repeated chart reused, the ornament dropped |\n| C11 synthetic | tunnel page | `ready`, 48 s: the 404 image dropped with a `404` degradation, the avatar left out |\n\n- **Provider key:** the describer rows come from calls made after the switch, so Gemini works with only `cf-aig-authorization`. The describer no longer sends the key, `GEMINI_API_KEY` is gone from the code and docs, and the pipeline secret is deleted.\n- **Revisions:** the reviser agent ran in production. `sive.rs` now has 3 recipe versions and `eli.thegreenplace.net` has 2.\n- **Cleanup:** I stopped both tunnels and their servers by PID.\n\n**Code block typed as a paragraph:** on the synthetic C1 page, the recipe the author agent wrote typed the `pre` block as `paragraph`. The listener hears \"Code sample.\" where a description should be. The real article's code came out right, and so did the same page locally, so this varies with what the agent writes. The pipeline accepts a paragraph whose display is a code fence. I can file it as a separate Linear task, for example to have the runtime treat a fenced paragraph as code, or to tighten the author prompt. Do you want that?\n\n**Audio to listen to** is in `.scratch/cloudflare-migration/prod/`:\n- `itm_53a7d110.ogg`: the eli watgo post, with code descriptions.\n- `itm_171cfbf7.ogg`: synthetic C1, with image descriptions.\n- `itm_9c90aad6.ogg`: synthetic C11.\n- `itm_7b7ccc9a.ogg`: the compiler post, 325 s.\n\n**Uncommitted:**\n- The provider-key change: `pipeline/src/describe/core.ts`, `worker-configuration.d.ts`, `vitest.config.ts`, `.dev.vars.example` and two docs. Should I commit it?\n- The temporary workers.dev swap in `api/wrangler.jsonc`, which the cutover reverts.\n\nStep 5 is next: restore the custom domain, deploy the API, point `nagara.asermax.com` at it, remove the Access app, and delete Railway. Should I start with the API route once you've listened?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3099,"cache_read_input_tokens":161662,"output_tokens":1122,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3099,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1122,"cache_read_input_tokens":161662,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3099,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3099},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"bdd3192b-b33a-40be-a1df-0733bb199797","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfwewLSBVSBiYDRUb6vno","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionM