{"parentUuid":"4b6cdbc4-6471-48e6-b2f5-f26b90a09389","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwfDc5j15fqA6qyK71Xp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I didn't start the cutover. The auto-mode classifier blocked the command, which would have restored the custom-domain route and deployed the API to `nagara.asermax.com`. Nothing in it ran, so `api/wrangler.jsonc` still holds the workers.dev setting.\n\n`nagara.asermax.com` is on Cloudflare DNS, proxied, and Railway still answers `/health` with 200. When the API deploys with its custom domain, Cloudflare has to replace that record. Wrangler may refuse because of the existing Railway record. In that case, delete the record in the dashboard under DNS for `asermax.com` and redeploy.\n\nEither confirm I should run it, or run it yourself:\n\n```\n! git checkout -- api/wrangler.jsonc && cd api && pnpm run deploy\n```\n\nAfter the deploy, I'll check that `https://nagara.asermax.com/health` and an authenticated poll reach the new API."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":859,"cache_read_input_tokens":168979,"output_tokens":339,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":31},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":859,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":339,"cache_read_input_tokens":168979,"cache_creation_input_tokens":859,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":859},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"a5ba4980-159b-4da3-a0c2-520e0f7ce066","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfwfDbgfdSyjWdxSioJ4U","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5