{"parentUuid":"c3a66d2e-d9bf-44d0-8e0a-b81808760e18","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"546da284-5e91-4a0d-a220-b46ced64839e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"<bash-stdout></bash-stdout><bash-stderr>$ wrangler deploy\n\n ⛅️ wrangler 4.135.0 (update available 4.149.0)\n───────────────────────────────────────────────\nTotal Upload: 211.49 KiB / gzip: 42.69 KiB\nWorker Startup Time: 7 ms\nYour Worker has access to the following bindings:\nBinding                                                                Resource                  \nenv.ITEM_WORKFLOW (ItemWorkflow (defined in nagara))                   Workflow                  \nenv.DB (nagara)                                                        D1 Database               \nenv.R2_S3_ENDPOINT (\"https://2b32439a1d8fdcdf00a9f7f654a11...\")        Environment Variable      \nenv.R2_BUCKET (\"nagara\")                                               Environment Variable      \nenv.RETRY_MAX (3)                                                      Environment Variable      \nenv.REQUEUE_AFTER_MS (900000)                                          Environment Variable      \n\nUploaded nagara-api (3.38 sec)\n\u001b[33m▲ \u001b[43;33m[\u001b[43;30mWARNING\u001b[43;33m]\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBecause 'workers_dev' is not in your Wrangler file, it will be disabled for this deployment by default.\u001b[0m\n\n  To override this setting, you can enable workers.dev by explicitly setting 'workers_dev = true' in your Wrangler file.\n\n\n\u001b[33m▲ \u001b[43;33m[\u001b[43;30mWARNING\u001b[43;33m]\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBecause your 'workers.dev' route is disabled and your 'preview_urls' setting is not in your Wrangler file, Preview URLs will be disabled for this deployment by default.\u001b[0m\n\n  To override this setting, you can enable Preview URLs by explicitly setting 'preview_urls = true' in your Wrangler file.\n\n\nNo targets deployed for nagara-api (2.14 sec)\n\n\u001b[31m✘ \u001b[41;31m[\u001b[41;97mERROR\u001b[41;31m]\u001b[0m \u001b[1mTrigger configuration for \"nagara-api\" was only partially updated:\u001b[0m\n\n  \n    Custom domains:\n      - A request to the Cloudflare API (/accounts/2b32439a1d8fdcdf00a9f7f654a11a6d/workers/scripts/nagara-api/domains/records) failed.\n        - Hostname 'nagara.asermax.com' already has externally managed DNS records (A, CNAME, etc). Delete them first or try a different hostname. [code: 100117]\n  \n  Successful trigger changes were not rolled back.\n\n\n🪵  Logs were written to \"/home/agus/.config/.wrangler/logs/wrangler-2026-10-12_03-48-57_067.log\"\n[ELIFECYCLE] Command failed with exit code 1.\n</bash-stderr>"},"uuid":"b29332fc-6c6f-4694-aed8-94a80bd8c499","timestamp":"2026-10-12T03:49:05.241Z","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":133,"turnIndex":350},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"feat/cloudflare-migration","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
