othing to go on\" | \"when the user names nothing to build\"\n  drafts.md:82 | rule 33 | \"No summary and no take.\" | \"Do not summarize the session and do not give a take.\"\n  drafts.md:82 | rule 35 | \"The user has said what they want.\" | Cut it. The bullet's first sentence already says \"when the user names what to build\".\n  drafts.md:85 | rule 28 | \"Say which mode you are following, and for a mix which items go each way, before starting.\" | \"Before starting, tell the user which mode you are following. For a mixed ask, list the items you work as directed and the part of the session discovery covers.\"\n  drafts.md:90 | rule 28 | \"Depending on what the user asks, it collects the points where the session generated friction or changed the behavior of the flow that was running, gives a take on each, and drafts what the user picks; or it works the user's ask directly from the current context; or both.\" | \"When the user asks what the session has to teach, it collects the points where the session generated friction or changed the behavior of the flow that was running, gives a take on each, and drafts what the user picks. When the user names what to build, it works that ask directly from the current context. A mixed ask gets both.\"\n  drafts.md:94 | rule 32 | \"when the user gives nothing to go on\" | \"when the user names nothing to build\"\n  TOTAL: 13\n</agent-message>"}
