hing specific, or asks\"),\n(\"Used when the user gives nothing to go on, or asks\",\"Used when the user asks for nothing specific, or asks\"),\n(\"Say which mode you are following, and for a mix which items go each way, before starting. Every mode\",\"Before starting, tell the user which mode you are following. For a mixed ask, list the items you work as directed and the part of the session discovery covers. Every mode\"),\n(\"Depending on what the user asks, it collects the points where the session generated friction or changed the behavior of the flow that was running, gives a take on each, and drafts what the user picks; or it works the user's ask directly from the current context; or both.\",\n \"When the user asks what the session has to teach, it collects the points where the session generated friction or changed the behavior of the flow that was running, gives a take on each, and drafts what the user picks. When the user names what to build, it works that ask directly from the current context. A mixed ask gets both.\"),\n]\nfor a,b in R:\n    assert s.count(a)==1,a[:50]; s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF","description":"Apply verified unslop findings to drafts"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"ac98cba6-446d-4396-a753-188bdd99d296","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfwgnmjh4vAASa5uMpWGU","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a7dde635-c8d8-41af-8195-69f04a877c02","timestamp":"2026-10-12T04:09:28.103Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
