{"parentUuid":"e1306959-fa0f-4232-9ce9-3fdaa1bc869f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"88edd290-cb3b-44b7-b011-2caaec7a4816","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EbiXZ5YrpT3A9RJNgru3eS","type":"tool_result","content":"## Modes\n\nPick the mode from what the user asks.\n\n- **Discovery.** Follow `references/discover.md` when the user asks for nothing specific, or asks what the session, or a part of it, has to teach.\n- **Directed.** Follow `references/directed.md` when the user names what to build.\n- **Mixed.** When the user names some items and also asks what else there is, work the named items as directed and run discovery over the part of the session the ask points at.\n\nBefore starting, tell the user which mode you are following. For a mixed ask, list the items you work as directed and the part of the session discovery covers. Every mode continues with Drafting once there is an item to draft.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f4a8688c-b88a-45af-b7e6-1691a43d300e","timestamp":"2026-10-12T04:14:37.035Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## Modes\n\nPick the mode from what the user asks.\n\n- **Discovery.** Follow `references/discover.md` when the user asks for nothing specific, or asks what the session, or a part of it, has to teach.\n- **Directed.** Follow `references/directed.md` when the user names what to build.\n- **Mixed.** When the user names some items and also asks what else there is, work the named items as directed and run discovery over the part of the session the ask points at.\n\nBefore starting, tell the user which mode you are following. For a mixed ask, list the items you work as directed and the part of the session discovery covers. Every mode continues with Drafting once there is an item to draft.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"928989d2-d731-4bf2-a4d9-1f86f06f6edd","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara","root":"/