{"parentUuid":"166b83fa-3819-4831-bd37-380a64bb616e","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14966354 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"314d65e9-318a-490d-8024-92ec3147e6c4","timestamp":"2026-10-12T04:14:37.065Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14966354 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/agus/workspace/asermax/nagara/.scratch/cloudflare-migration/learn/round5","sessionId":"f14bad90-e61e-4c27-a38f-bf7cbc76465e","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"atomic-stirring-rossum"}
{"parentUuid":"314d65e9-318a-490d-8024-92ec3147e6c4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwhCMoSirQ2HFqG9uGYe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I applied all three annotations to item 3, and the draft file is updated. The \"Modes\" section now reads:\n\n> Pick the mode from what the user asks.\n>\n> - **Discovery.** Follow `references/discover.md` when the user asks for nothing specific, or asks what the session, or a part of it, has to teach.\n> - **Directed.** Follow `references/directed.md` when the user names what to build.\n> - **Mixed.** When the user names some items and also asks what else there is, work the named items as directed and run discovery over the part of the session the ask points at.\n>\n> Before starting, tell the user which mode you are following. For a mixed ask, list the items you work as directed and the part of the session discovery covers. Every mode continues with Drafting once there is an item to draft.\n\n- **\"Not from whether there are arguments\":** removed.\n- **The discovery steps** (collect the friction points, report each with a take, wait for the user to pick) are gone from the bullet. They're already steps 1 to 3 of `discover.md`.\n- **\"No summary and no take… map the state their ask touches\"** is gone from the directed bullet. `directed.md` already says not to summarize or give a take, and its step 1 is to map the state the ask touches.\n\nItems 1 and 2 and the rest of item 3 (the description, the first lines of `discover.md` and `directed.md`, and the README line) are unchanged. Which items should I write?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":999,"cache_read_input_tokens":236687,"output_tokens":456,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creatio